        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072ZLCB3M\",\"sku\":\"B072ZLCB3M\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-bristol-natural-edge-black-metal-side-table-walnut-b072zlcb3m\",\"name\":\"Rivet Bristol Natural Edge Black Metal Side Table, Walnut\",\"description\":\"With a wood top and metal 3-legged stand, this table is modern yet classic. The wood top is a &quot;natural edge&quot; cut. No two tables are exactly alike; allow for some height variation. This table is a handy landing spot for keys, phones and small table lamps. 18.9&quot;L x 18.9&quot;W x 18.2&quot;H Engineered wood with walnut veneer; metal stand bottom Modern yet classic Convenient side table for living room or bedroom Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Bristol Natural Edge Black Metal Side Table, Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Xh+yZvD1L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OdfC9iHhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OdfC9iHhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91A-nCul3fL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91A-nCul3fL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81D0VezjM9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81D0VezjM9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1UkMa6UHIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1UkMa6UHIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-2zou-hDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-2zou-hDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Tsz82lxrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.g