      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07P5LLX43\",\"sku\":\"B07P5LLX43\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"lauren-down-filled-oversized-ottoman-with-hardwood-frame-46-5-w-chocolate-b07p5llx43\",\"name\":\"Lauren Down Filled Oversized Ottoman with Hardwood Frame, 46.5&quot;W, Chocolate\",\"description\":\"Dimensions: 46&quot;W x 46&quot;D x 19&quot;H Soft down-filled cushions on a frame of solid hardwood mean this ottoman offers plush support and security. Neutral chocolate-colored upholstery allows this piece to blend into your existing color scheme with ease. Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric made of 98% polyester, 2% nylon; down-filled seat and back cushions Wide surface provides a comfortable space for rest or extra seating. Classic design will fit any space. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Lauren Down Filled Oversized Ottoman with Hardwood Frame, 46.5&quot;W, Chocolate\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81vMWyVcKsL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/917+VEfTYHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/917+VEfTYHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71cmPSfkYoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71cmPSfkYoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CWn3f9swL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CWn3f9swL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81dZRzWg7ML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81dZRzWg7ML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1PviewebZS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/pu