        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B082JH6LSF\",\"sku\":\"B082JH6LSF\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"mid-century-2-drawer-file-cabinet-21-7-w-pine-finish-b082jh6lsf\",\"name\":\"Mid-Century 2-Drawer File Cabinet, 21.7&quot;W, Pine Finish\",\"description\":\"Add a touch of mid-century design inspiration to your home office or workspace with this 2-drawer file cabinet. A deeper bottom drawer and elegantly shaped legs make this piece as stylish as it is useful. 21.7&quot;W x 15.4&quot;D x 23.4&quot;H Durable MDF wood with natural-finished pine veneer and antique bronze handles The 2 generously sized sliding drawers offer stylish storage of files, supplies, and more. Anything but dull and utilitarian, this beautifully proportioned filing cabinet would work equally well as a stylish side table. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Using a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the wood grain. Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Mid-Century 2-Drawer File Cabinet, 21.7&quot;W, Pine Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71S7YSK7N+L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81UHzzgAzFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81UHzzgAzFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71CuUtfOPSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71CuUtfOPSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81UQeN529cL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81UQeN529cL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/715Z2wdOYdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/715Z2wdOYdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71r1vmMRYoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.c