      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HYY8ZGY\",\"sku\":\"B07HYY8ZGY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"westcott-contemporary-93-sofa-fabric-93-w-haze-b07hyy8zgy\",\"name\":\"Westcott Contemporary 93&quot; Sofa, Fabric, 93&quot;W, Haze\",\"description\":\"This sofa’s base and armrests blend seamlessly to create a continuous, cohesive look. The stain-resistant fabric allows for clean comfort, and the removable and reversible back and seat cushions add lasting style. Sturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric Removable and reversible back and seat cushions add lasting style. Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you. Overall: 93&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 30&quot;H; Seat Height: 20&quot;H; Seat Depth: 24&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 30&quot;H; Arm Height: 30&quot;H; Leg Height: 5.25&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Westcott Contemporary 93&quot; Sofa, Fabric, 93&quot;W, Haze\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/910vvDJfNcL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NIJVXu7zL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NIJVXu7zL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1F-pL+2zDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1F-pL+2zDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A169NWn9FoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A169NWn9FoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hc3AJ2LZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hc3AJ2LZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91K9MyHnKDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91K9MyHnKDL.jpg\"}],\"attribu