        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07JY3NNPK\",\"sku\":\"B07JY3NNPK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"pinebrook-traditional-recliner-fabric-39-w-stone-b07jy3nnpk\",\"name\":\"Pinebrook Traditional Recliner, Fabric, 39&quot;W, Stone\",\"description\":\"Kick back and relax in this simple and stylish recliner. The sturdy wood frame and stain-resistant fabric upholstery make this a durable addition to your living room, and the push-back reclining mechanism makes relaxation easy. Sturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric Push-back reclining mechanism No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you. Overall: 39&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 41&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H; Seat Depth: 23&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 41&quot;H; Arm Height: 22&quot;H; Leg Height: 4.5&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Pinebrook Traditional Recliner, Fabric, 39&quot;W, Stone\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/910WIIzuQJL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hhVvyG5+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hhVvyG5+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gCruuGc2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gCruuGc2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91LFlbC-kdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91LFlbC-kdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1qEoHptB1S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1qEoHptB1S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915AiDd7gmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915AiDd7gmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-ima