      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z8769G\",\"sku\":\"B075Z8769G\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-swope-curved-arm-swivel-office-chair-26-w-felt-grey-b075z8769g\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Swope Curved Arm Swivel Office Chair, 26&quot;W, Felt Grey\",\"description\":\"26&quot;W x 24.8&quot;D x 33.9&quot;H Fabric is durable 100% polyester. Metal swivel base and legs. A swivel chair ideal for a desk but attractive enough for any room No assembly required. Vacuum or wipe with a soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. While designed for the office, this swivel chair adds refreshing style to any room. The Mid-century inspired silhouette features graceful curves and low-profile arms Four metal legs extend outward from the swivel base.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Swope Curved Arm Swivel Office Chair, 26&quot;W, Felt Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918OhgZ71BL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Tug5oM2QL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Tug5oM2QL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91dN99DTihL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91dN99DTihL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1PGLGOARfS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1PGLGOARfS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91o3KqzIShL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91o3KqzIShL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VMYxBGS1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VMYxBGS1L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"