        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X4T472\",\"sku\":\"B075X4T472\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"leila-tufted-sofa-88-w-sandstone-b075x4t472\",\"name\":\"Leila Tufted Sofa, 88&quot; W, Sandstone\",\"description\":\"This item is made to order just for you 88&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 31&quot;H Solid wood frame and legs with durable fabric upholstery. The tight, fixed back and removable/reversible cushions ensure durability and comfort. Treat yourself to luxury in this striking, vintage look sofa. With solid wood legs in a dark walnut finish, plush upholstery and a low, curved tufted back, it exudes opulence. Three removable/reversible seat cushions ensure many years of use. Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Leila Tufted Sofa, 88&quot; W, Sandstone\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81bE1U3PBSL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91z36Az-LGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91z36Az-LGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qylUc5bYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qylUc5bYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1L5x7Es6gL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1L5x7Es6gL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-C0RxUEcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-C0RxUEcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1udGsIfJHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1udGsIfJHL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"31.0\",\"label\":\"inc