        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07BWLJRCD\",\"sku\":\"B07BWLJRCD\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"dalton-sofa-couch-with-chaise-sand-b07bwljrcd\",\"name\":\"Dalton Sofa Couch with Chaise, Sand\",\"description\":\"Whatever you need to accommodate kids, pets, spills and every other facet of a busy life, this sofa has it all: Plush comfort, stain-resistant fabric, durable construction, and a timeless look to blend with your existing styles. 91.5&quot;W x 37.5&quot;D x 35&quot;H Solid hardwood and laminate wood frame; polyester/nylon performance fabric Modern casual Exceptional comfort with high performance polypropylene fabric for heavy wear. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Dalton Sofa Couch with Chaise, Sand\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JzGgIplVL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91K2taJtWHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91K2taJtWHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81dqBGAVlSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81dqBGAVlSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A188W8b+eQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A188W8b+eQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1t7Q1p9AIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1t7Q1p9AIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1YAlo716gL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1YAlo716gL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mP22yG4qL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mP22yG4qL.jpg\"},{\"al