      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B084W2WJH2\",\"sku\":\"B084W2WJH2\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"esme-memory-swivel-barstool-43-3-h-wax-sand-b084w2wjh2\",\"name\":\"Esme Memory-Swivel Barstool, 43.3&quot;H, Wax Sand\",\"description\":\"Add some stylish seating to your next get-together or party with this wingback barstool. This tall wax-sand-colored barstool features a memory swivel that returns the seat to its proper position every time. It will easily complement your contemporary kitchen or transitional bar. 20.1&quot;W x 22.4&quot;D x 43.3&quot;H; seat height: 29.9&quot;H; seat depth: 16.5&quot;D; seat back height: 18.5&quot;H; leg height: 24.8&quot;H Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric A memory-swivel mechanism means this barstool always looks tidy. Classic transitional look with memory swivel No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Esme Memory-Swivel Barstool, 43.3&quot;H, Wax Sand\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-DiFXWBTL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71g2+fODSnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71g2+fODSnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ak2hpkymL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ak2hpkymL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71s5PelEjCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71s5PelEjCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/717wAXrKnZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://stora