      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B085FHBF21\",\"sku\":\"B085FHBF21\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-contemporary-swivel-glider-recliner-chair-33-9-w-smoke-grey-b085fhbf21\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Contemporary Swivel Glider Recliner Chair, 33.9&quot;W, Smoke Grey\",\"description\":\"33.9&quot;W x 37.8&quot;D x 37.8&quot;H; seat height: 19.7&quot;H; seat depth: 19.7&quot;D Plywood frame with strong reclining mechanism, flat arms, and solid performance seat cushion and backrest cushion Recliner has a swivel glide that rotates 360 degrees. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Indoor use only; avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Contemporary Swivel Glider Recliner Chair, 33.9&quot;W, Smoke Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NLGqXfI5L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91o+iXJ2RNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91o+iXJ2RNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Q4veB8+BL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Q4veB8+BL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1RyWh187IL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1RyWh187IL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1d6TJkLh7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1d6TJkLh7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81hQM7VH5pL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81hQM7VH5pL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ypOpKzsEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original