      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QBMQPH3\",\"sku\":\"B07QBMQPH3\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"joanna-contemporary-tufted-chair-with-reversible-cushions-40-w-heather-grey-b07qbmqph3\",\"name\":\"Joanna Contemporary Tufted Chair with Reversible Cushions, 40&quot;W, Heather Grey\",\"description\":\"Clean lines give this armchair a modern, sophisticated look. Removable seat cushions and backs are comfortable and easy to adjust, and the performance fabric upholstery can be cleaned with a cloth or simple vacuuming. Steel seat springs and a wood frame provide structure, support and durability. Overall: 40&quot;W x 37&quot;D x 38&quot;H. Seat height: 21.5&quot;H; seat depth: 23&quot;H; seat back 19&quot;H Steel seat springs, wood frame and wood legs add structure and durability Loose, reversible seat cushions and inside back cushions in 100% polyester performance fabric. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Lightly vacuum every month or two to remove dirt and dust Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Joanna Contemporary Tufted Chair with Reversible Cushions, 40&quot;W, Heather Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QqRDag2zL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1lrQrPbIBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1lrQrPbIBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cgjDspD+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cgjDspD+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pZR6vuhrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pZR6vuhrL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+EhaPiIxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+EhaPiIxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.goog