        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075QFCHM9\",\"sku\":\"B075QFCHM9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-york-modern-extended-platform-queen-bed-90-2-l-grey-b075qfchm9\",\"name\":\"Rivet York Modern Extended Platform Queen Bed, 90.2&quot;L, Grey\",\"description\":\"Mid-century modern meets comfy in this platform bed. Clean lines, tapered wood feet and a low profile footboard are combined with sides that extend beyond the mattress for a very contemporary effect. Silver grey fabric adds extra appeal. 90.2&quot;L x 72&quot;W x 42.3&quot;H Upholstered with 100% polyester herringbone fabric. Tapered wood legs. Mid-century modern headboard curves up and back for distinctive side silhouette No boxspring required. Queen mattress sold separately. Assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet York Modern Extended Platform Queen Bed, 90.2&quot;L, Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+pGfGwy+L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81XWQfjY1HL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81XWQfjY1HL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B12tsbkjToS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B12tsbkjToS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ejL+F1jAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ejL+F1jAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1-TW58H4rS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1-TW58H4rS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-aTGretGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-aTGretGL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\