        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075YQXQ5C\",\"sku\":\"B075YQXQ5C\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"dunbar-modern-wood-buffet-55-w-oak-b075yqxq5c\",\"name\":\"Dunbar Modern Wood Buffet, 55&quot;W, Oak\",\"description\":\"55&quot;W x 19&quot;D x 36&quot;H Hardwood top A simple modern piece with rustic and modern influences Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This handsome modern buffet provides function with style - and is perfect for storing wine, linens, and glassware. Simple, clean lines and beautiful quarter-sawn oak veneer finish make this piece look at home in rustic or modern settings. Assembly is required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Dunbar Modern Wood Buffet, 55&quot;W, Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WX-mn8mDL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qWSte5G6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qWSte5G6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JbrAF4vLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JbrAF4vLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A12oWr0Mi6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A12oWr0Mi6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Dlchxl1JL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Dlchxl1JL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91SRwfgCsML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91SRwfgCsML.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"36.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"55.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"L