        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7BRXCK\",\"sku\":\"B07B7BRXCK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"cottage-wood-saddle-kitchen-bar-counter-stool-29-inch-height-blue-b07b7brxck\",\"name\":\"Cottage Wood Saddle Kitchen Bar Counter Stool, 29 Inch Height, Blue\",\"description\":\"18&quot;W x 9.5&quot;D x 29&quot;H; Seat Height: 29&quot;H Sturdy hardwoods Ideal for rustic and modern farmhouse spaces Easy to care for -- just wipe with damp cloth Assembly in 15-30 minutes Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty This simple, classic wooden bar stool is offered in a distressed finish. It's perfect for adding seating to a rustic or modern farmhouse kitchen, and easy to move around when you need more seating in another room.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Cottage Wood Saddle Kitchen Bar Counter Stool, 29 Inch Height, Blue\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jvxFrGV+L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-U6Xiu4nL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-U6Xiu4nL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yl1zFAESL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yl1zFAESL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81x4FukD4zL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81x4FukD4zL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HV0y4bXUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HV0y4bXUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81B+iNLsclL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81B+iNLsclL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"24.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\