      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07J2JGT7Y\",\"sku\":\"B07J2JGT7Y\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-alonzo-contemporary-leather-sofa-couch-80-w-cognac-b07j2jgt7y\",\"name\":\"Rivet Alonzo Contemporary Leather Sofa Couch, 80&quot;W, Cognac\",\"description\":\"A single bench cushion brings visual unity to this luxury sofa, and the gently sloping armrests give it a sleek style. With a solid-wood frame and strong brass legs, this sofa can lend elegance to your living room for years. Overall: 80.3&quot;W x 37.8&quot;D x 35.4&quot;H; Seat Height: 18.11&quot;H; Seat Depth: 22.05&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 12.99&quot;H; Arm Height: 23.62&quot;H; Leg Height: 7.09&quot;H Solid-wood frame with brass metal legs Bench seat cushion with great comfort Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Alonzo Contemporary Leather Sofa Couch, 80&quot;W, Cognac\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81p4WwqH3QL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81P0PtMNm6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81P0PtMNm6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91oJHMtT-tL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91oJHMtT-tL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71akIFm32BL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71akIFm32BL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1Rc-l300JS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1Rc-l300JS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ITRoxbiHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ITRoxbiHL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"la