      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07JY29YYP\",\"sku\":\"B07JY29YYP\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"wolcott-swivel-chair-fabric-33-w-latte-b07jy29yyp\",\"name\":\"Wolcott Swivel Chair, Fabric, 33&quot;W, Latte\",\"description\":\"This latte-colored swivel chair is the perfect way to add one more comfy seat to your living room. It’s also built to last, with a sturdy wood frame, a tight fixed back, a reversible seat cushion, and stain-resistant fabric upholstery. Sturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric The tight, fixed back and reversible seat cushions ensure durability and comfort. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you. Overall: 33&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 33&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H; Seat Depth: 23&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 33&quot;H; Arm Height: 25&quot;H;\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Wolcott Swivel Chair, Fabric, 33&quot;W, Latte\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A10yXK31mlL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cC-xbyzkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cC-xbyzkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19zOv0-oQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19zOv0-oQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1EhrTckabL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1EhrTckabL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1WRy+JvcjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1WRy+JvcjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+houXJc2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+houXJc2L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"He