        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0725Z2499\",\"sku\":\"B0725Z2499\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"parson-king-wood-bed-with-headboard-80-5-w-natural-b0725z2499\",\"name\":\"Parson King Wood Bed with Headboard, 80.5&quot;W, Natural\",\"description\":\"This design is modern farmhouse at its best. Oak veneer gives a distinctive grain to the tall headboard and low-profile footboard. The natural beauty and cozy feel of this piece will have you looking forward to bedtime. 80.5&quot;W x 86&quot;L x 56&quot;H Solid hardwood with hand-selected oak veneer This rustic bed has the look of natural reclaimed wood with distressed finish. Five slats with two legs each sturdily support a mattress and boxspring (sold separately). Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Parson King Wood Bed with Headboard, 80.5&quot;W, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QIA-U2AfL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GEDFFP4wL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GEDFFP4wL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91EqAH-pTuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91EqAH-pTuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ML1JCC5NL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ML1JCC5NL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91t7hGIbTVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91t7hGIbTVL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"56.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"86.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"v