        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7J5BC2\",\"sku\":\"B07B7J5BC2\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"alan-casual-wood-media-tv-console-table-62-w-washed-navy-and-gold-b07b7j5bc2\",\"name\":\"Alan Casual Wood Media TV Console Table, 62&quot;W, Washed Navy and Gold\",\"description\":\"With its lovely washed navy finish and gold hardware, this piece will add beauty to your room along with a way to organize your electronics. Four self-close drawers offer roomy storage for DVD's and game consoles. 62&quot;W x 18&quot;D x 28.25&quot;H Hardwood and fiberboard; metal pulls with gold finish Casual transitional style Four self-close drawers for additional storage No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Alan Casual Wood Media TV Console Table, 62&quot;W, Washed Navy and Gold\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81iainDTczL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71GupDNtGwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71GupDNtGwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1R78BlLnoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1R78BlLnoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81g70LadyvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81g70LadyvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91M7olWF18L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91M7olWF18L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91c5gnt3CxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91c5gnt3CxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91UjhWdkPdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight