    "dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Data": {
      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QBQFBBV\",\"sku\":\"B07QBQFBBV\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"flared-back-dining-chair-37-h-set-of-2-gray-b07qbqfbbv\",\"name\":\"Flared-Back Dining Chair, 37&quot;H, Set of 2, Gray\",\"description\":\"The flared backs of these chairs create a unique visual element that will help add sophistication to any dining area. The silver nailhead design along the chair edges completes the contemporary look. Chairs are supported by curved legs and a sturdy wood frame. Durable upholstery means simple care. 22.2&quot;W x 24.5&quot;D x 36.5&quot;H; seat height: 20&quot; Solid wood frame creates durability. Fabric upholstery is easy to maintain. Web suspension and no-sag springs provide comfortable seating. This elegant dining room chair is embellished with shiny silver nailheads that are carefully placed by hand. This sophisticated dining room side chair has a flared back and gently curved legs that create a classic transitional look. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Clean by vacuuming or wiping with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. The chair is sold in a set of 2.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Flared-Back Dining Chair, 37&quot;H, Set of 2, Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zJB5RaHtL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919XQGT2VeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919XQGT2VeL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1UtNwf0UJS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1UtNwf0UJS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81YqHUAjMjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81YqHUAjMjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91HNabMxTQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleap