        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QCQ1J5M\",\"sku\":\"B07QCQ1J5M\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"barstool-39-h-fawn-b07qcq1j5m\",\"name\":\"Barstool, 39&quot;H, Fawn\",\"description\":\"This high-back transitional-style barstool has distinctive fawn-colored fabric upholstery with brass nailhead trim. Open sides allow for freedom of movement, and the solid wood frame provides stability and balance. 21&quot;W x 22&quot;D x 39&quot;H; seat height: 26&quot;H; seat depth: 17&quot;D; seat back height: 13&quot;H Moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric on a solid hardwood frame Open sides allow maximum freedom of movement. These transitional barstools feature brass nailhead decorative trim on fawn-colored performance fabric seats. No assembly required Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Barstool, 39&quot;H, Fawn\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81z0x3DolgL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KdYCcZ7ML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KdYCcZ7ML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7147RstRiVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7147RstRiVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81kBpxBZiZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81kBpxBZiZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EL9d1q1ML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EL9d1q1ML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918DR55-QfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918DR55-QfL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"val