      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B071FMSYCH\",\"sku\":\"B071FMSYCH\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-farr-lotus-accent-chair-felt-grey-b071fmsych\",\"name\":\"Rivet Farr Lotus Accent Chair, Felt Grey\",\"description\":\"33.9&quot;D x 39.8&quot;W x 33.9&quot;H Stainless steel base with plywood-reinforced sides and back Contemporary Great for your living room or anywhere else a bold accent chair is needed. No assembly required. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. With its low-slung arms and stainless steel base of four angled legs, this chair is a statement modern accent. The bold design, along with the comfortable oversized cushion and back, will put a smile on your face and impress your guests.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Farr Lotus Accent Chair, Felt Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mlJsUrSML.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xEEIDuKhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xEEIDuKhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1ab1FStadS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1ab1FStadS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1DWNBmqIqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1DWNBmqIqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1nUwAi6sRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1nUwAi6sRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ASX7aKv1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ASX7aKv1L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"33.9\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"33.9