      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07TXPXJKS\",\"sku\":\"B07TXPXJKS\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"sophia-modern-swivel-kitchen-bar-stool-43-3-h-chalk-b07txpxjks\",\"name\":\"Sophia Modern Swivel Kitchen Bar Stool, 43.3&quot;H, Chalk\",\"description\":\"With a substantial padded back and seat, this bar stool provides maximum comfort -- and it swivels! The solid hardwood frame is sturdy and stable, and performance fabric makes it durable and easy to clean. 17.7&quot;D x 21.3&quot;W x 43.3&quot;H. Seat height is 30 inches. 95% polyester/5% nylon on hardwood frame; solid poplar legs. Foam padding and elastic suspension system keeps upholstery firm and resilient No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Sophia Modern Swivel Kitchen Bar Stool, 43.3&quot;H, Chalk\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-QAZX5-6L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Rbu99ZbDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Rbu99ZbDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vzrxyVsyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vzrxyVsyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71TCRAdkStL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71TCRAdkStL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71SPQF-cTlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71SPQF-cTlL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TFKCHYXML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TFKCHYXML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71IjBfoHZJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.goog