      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B071P9WJBT\",\"sku\":\"B071P9WJBT\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"parson-6-drawer-wood-bedroom-dresser-60-w-natural-b071p9wjbt\",\"name\":\"Parson 6-Drawer Wood Bedroom Dresser, 60&quot;W, Natural\",\"description\":\"This is modern farmhouse at its best. Oak veneer gives a distinctive grain to the body and drawers of this dresser, and metal pulls complete the simple design. The natural beauty of this piece provides a relaxing tone to your bedroom. 60&quot;W x 19&quot;D x 35&quot;H Solid hardwood with hand-selected oak veneer This rustic dresser has the look of natural reclaimed wood with distressed finish. Self-closing drawers are suspended on concealed ball-bearing extension glides. No assembly needed. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Parson 6-Drawer Wood Bedroom Dresser, 60&quot;W, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1s1RJmqhGL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1npK5Mp94L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1npK5Mp94L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1nk9U2u7WL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1nk9U2u7WL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Er7G2hoQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Er7G2hoQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91AaW4CzboL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91AaW4CzboL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"35.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"19.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\