      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07LC8L9V5\",\"sku\":\"B07LC8L9V5\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"solimo-antares-engineered-wood-single-bed-caramel-mahogany-finish-b07lc8l9v5\",\"name\":\"Solimo Antares Engineered Wood Single Bed (Caramel Mahogany Finish)\",\"description\":\"Premium quality engineered wood structure which has had more than 20 safety an Smooth edges for protection against accidental scrapes and cuts Underwent dynamic loading tests for 21,000 cycles and edge stability tests for 10,000 cycles Capable of withstanding loads of up to 225kg Elegant caramel mahogany finish which gives it a glossy look and makes it easy Made with high quality European standard particle board for durability Tested for resistance against humidity to ensure longevity Free from harmful chemicals and toxins to facilitate safe use Comes with 3-year warranty on manufacturing defects Do not move or push without dismantling. Avoid using wet cloth to wipe furniture for better care\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Solimo Antares Engineered Wood Single Bed (Caramel Mahogany Finish)\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81zjC77+K6L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61qBiGQfT0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61qBiGQfT0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jepOGUCgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jepOGUCgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71wN05aRgqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71wN05aRgqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61TeEVA68JL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61TeEVA68JL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61781