      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B071ZHY8X9\",\"sku\":\"B071ZHY8X9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"newport-3-drawer-bedroom-dresser-34-w-toffee-oak-b071zhy8x9\",\"name\":\"Newport 3-Drawer Bedroom Dresser, 34&quot;W, Toffee Oak\",\"description\":\"34&quot;W x 17&quot;D x 34&quot;H Oak color-finished hardwood with black metal drawers and hardware Transitional style will work in any style bedroom. Drawers suspend on self-closing, ball-bearing extension guides No assembly needed. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Keep your clothing neatly organized with this roomy transitional three-drawer dresser made with both metal and wood. The rivets around the perimeter of the black painted metal drawers give an industrial touch, and the sides and front are a warm, oak color .\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Newport 3-Drawer Bedroom Dresser, 34&quot;W, Toffee Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91na6KA7vEL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RGFLmztZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RGFLmztZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mjORS5djL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mjORS5djL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GWvWx4gBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GWvWx4gBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A10maEa+9FL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A10maEa+9FL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Hb6rLzJoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Hb6rLzJoL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"v