      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B086VZGZCB\",\"sku\":\"B086VZGZCB\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"gergana-upholstered-power-recliner-chair-34-w-ash-b086vzgzcb\",\"name\":\"Gergana Upholstered Power Recliner Chair, 34&quot;W, Ash\",\"description\":\"This power recliner chair complements any modern or contemporary living room. The ash-colored upholstery blends with any decor and is durable and easy to maintain. The armrests are low and curved, and the back cushion is loose, giving you adjustable comfort as you kick your feet up. This item is made to order just for you 34&quot;W x 43&quot;D x 35&quot;H; seat height: 21&quot;H; seat depth: 22&quot;D; back height: 35&quot;H; arm height: 24&quot;H; leg height: 5.125&quot;H Sturdy wood frame with polyester and acrylic upholstery Plug directly into outlet for power, or use battery pack so you do not have to worry about cords. The footrest reclines, but the back does not move. No assembly required Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. Spot clean if needed. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Gergana Upholstered Power Recliner Chair, 34&quot;W, Ash\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RJlRjj8WL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lWPwz+f6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lWPwz+f6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91sbWPaoRAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91sbWPaoRAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91t16J4jftL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91t16J4jftL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Sd+QjTpIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Sd+QjTpIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https: