      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QGSZ4YJ\",\"sku\":\"B07QGSZ4YJ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-slade-contemporary-living-room-accent-swivel-chair-27-w-aqua-b07qgsz4yj\",\"name\":\"Rivet Slade Contemporary Living Room Accent Swivel Chair, 27&quot;W, Aqua\",\"description\":\"The comfortable curved shape and cutout design give this swivel chair a modern look that coordinates with a variety of decor styles. The solid hardwood frame creates a sturdy base and foam cushions provide comfort. Overall: 27&quot;W x 22&quot;D x 28&quot;H; seat height: 18&quot;H; seat depth: 22&quot;D; seat back height: 27&quot;H; arm height: 28&quot;H; leg height: 1&quot;H Solid hardwood frame, wood swivel base, and 100% polyester fabric This swivel chair adds a pop of style to a living room, bedroom or home office equally well. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Slade Contemporary Living Room Accent Swivel Chair, 27&quot;W, Aqua\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gxBMSkSGL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1WiQJVOAeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1WiQJVOAeL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zKcxV-nFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zKcxV-nFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cf0-yYh+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cf0-yYh+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91q317ogucL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91q317ogucL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kPw+NXCBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.go