      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4MTFRH\",\"sku\":\"B07B4MTFRH\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"andover-modern-living-room-accent-chair-38-w-sand-b07b4mtfrh\",\"name\":\"Andover Modern Living Room Accent Chair, 38&quot;W, Sand\",\"description\":\"With sturdy frames and reversible cushions, the furniture in this collection will withstand years of fun and cuddles with family and pets. Features such as track arms and box-edge lines bring stylish sophistication to modern or transitional rooms. 38&quot;W x 38&quot;D x 35&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 25&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 28&quot;H; Arm Height: 28&quot;H; Leg Height: 4.25&quot;H Stain-resistant polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame Track arms and a streamlined shape are hallmarks of modern design Back and seat cushions are reversible; individual pieces can be configured in many ways Easy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Andover Modern Living Room Accent Chair, 38&quot;W, Sand\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PkbWdd1UL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ReR1nvU9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ReR1nvU9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91e164S7u+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91e164S7u+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WXAjTGICL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WXAjTGICL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91BHyLcvsDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91BHyLcvsDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cglDE+gzL.jpg\",\"url\":