      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075ZBVZPB\",\"sku\":\"B075ZBVZPB\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"larson-industrial-wood-metal-coffee-table-50-w-walnut-b075zbvzpb\",\"name\":\"Larson Industrial Wood & Metal Coffee Table, 50&quot;W, Walnut\",\"description\":\"This coffee table with a solid pine wood top and shelf has a natural distressed finish, while the metal legs and trim have a darker brown matte finish. The lower shelf provides ever-important space to store magazines, books, and remotes. 50&quot;W x 23.5&quot;D x 18.5&quot;H Solid pine wood tops and shelves with walnut finish; metal legs Industrial and rustic touches allow this table to blend with many styles. Convenient lower shelf for storing mail or books Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Larson Industrial Wood & Metal Coffee Table, 50&quot;W, Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TMR7a1JqL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yiYGinz5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yiYGinz5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zWZh6Ed+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zWZh6Ed+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LpKqVKcSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LpKqVKcSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91INPU2i1HL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91INPU2i1HL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81-YzIsiq-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81-YzIsiq-L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Hei