      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSCN9RM\",\"sku\":\"B07HSCN9RM\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-modern-desk-31-5-h-walnut-stain-b07hscn9rm\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Desk 31.5&quot;H, Walnut Stain\",\"description\":\"Beautiful gold-dipped tapered legs, 2 unique chevron-inlaid drawers, gold knobs, and a rich walnut finish make this sturdy, solid wood desk a work of style and beauty while affording ample space for your office supplies and important documents. 39.37”W x 13.78”D x 31.5&quot; H Wood Tapered legs with gold dip detail. Front drawer panels features chevron inlay design for unique style. The desk features 2 drawers to maximize storage in your office. Side wood gliding drawers feature gold front knobs to match gold accented legs. Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Desk 31.5&quot;H, Walnut Stain\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cITCUVx2L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1utjXOmO7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1utjXOmO7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71g7wPsQmKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71g7wPsQmKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814Wa9-2n-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814Wa9-2n-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/717QquN3qoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/717QquN3qoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Ic7BskVtL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Ic7Bs