      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4FZHH6\",\"sku\":\"B07B4FZHH6\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"edmunds-traditional-leather-recliner-30-w-charcoal-b07b4fzhh6\",\"name\":\"Edmunds Traditional Leather Recliner, 30&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"description\":\"[Dimensions Placeholder] Top-grain leather upholstery on hardwood pine frame Streamlined silhouette combines modern style with classic leather for a transitional look Push back reclining mechanism No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Straight lines and narrow arms combine modern touches with classic leather, making this chair an ideal transitional style -- AND it's a recliner that doesn't look like a recliner. This piecewill last through years of Netflix shows and afternoon naps.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Edmunds Traditional Leather Recliner, 30&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9194V0ANFfL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918EYzlBDdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918EYzlBDdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Su4zTT0wL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Su4zTT0wL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81t99uU5BiL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81t99uU5BiL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91sh5M5kyRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91sh5M5kyRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81fFSLytOyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81fFSLytOyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PAtmcuJuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage