        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HZ1L353\",\"sku\":\"B07HZ1L353\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bagley-sectional-component-armless-sofa-fabric-78-w-dove-b07hz1l353\",\"name\":\"Bagley Sectional Component, Armless Sofa, Fabric, 78&quot;W, Dove\",\"description\":\"This dove-colored sectional sofa boasts a smooth polyester-nylon blend that’s a dream to sit or lie on. This is the armless sofa component—put several pieces together to arrange your seating in a way that brings the most possible comfort to your living room. Sturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric Attached back and reversible seat cushions add lasting style. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you. Overall: 78&quot;W x 40&quot;D x 36&quot;H; Seat Height: 22&quot;H; Seat Depth: 24&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 36&quot;H; Leg Height: 2.125&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bagley Sectional Component, Armless Sofa, Fabric, 78&quot;W, Dove\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61te1EbX1NL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LVE1Sy7IL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LVE1Sy7IL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HYkBH0iLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HYkBH0iLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817L+ahZVQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817L+ahZVQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jGhs2WhAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jGhs2WhAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hhsZzC7zL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hhsZzC7z