      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073G7BVBP\",\"sku\":\"B073G7BVBP\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-martin-modern-storage-bench-39-w-sundried-velvet-b073g7bvbp\",\"name\":\"Rivet Martin Modern Storage Bench, 39&quot;W, Sundried Velvet\",\"description\":\"You're having friends over, but didn't have time to clean first. No problem - this storage ottoman is a great place to quickly stash clutter. In addition to its functionality, it's a stylish piece when closed. NOTE: This item is made-to-order, please expect an increased shipping time. 39” W x 19” D x 19” H Solid pine wood with polyester fabric Contemporary but classic A great ottoman for the living room or storage for blankets in a bedroom Simple assembly; just attach legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Martin Modern Storage Bench, 39&quot;W, Sundried Velvet\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81SgCHCMXxL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9169kmXfYKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9169kmXfYKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81PDe8y2V7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81PDe8y2V7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1lkDfOR7SL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1lkDfOR7SL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ioR-t8SFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ioR-t8SFL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"19.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"19.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"39.0\