      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07MF1SRGP\",\"sku\":\"B07MF1SRGP\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-modern-counter-stool-with-back-38-25-inch-height-beige-set-of-2-b07mf1srgp\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Modern Counter Stool with Back, 38.25 Inch Height, Beige, Set of 2\",\"description\":\"Overall: 23.75&quot;W x 20.25&quot;D x 38.25&quot;H; seat height: 24&quot;H; seat depth: 17.5&quot;H; seat back height: 15.75&quot;H Barstool of durable fabric on wood frame Contemporary design with wooden frame and tufted upholstery in beige fabric; solid-wood legs with black finish Foam padding and elastic suspension system keep the back and seat firm and springy. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Modern Counter Stool with Back, 38.25 Inch Height, Beige, Set of 2\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71cOR4HKrSL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71GewCJIK6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71GewCJIK6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gmiIQl7yL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gmiIQl7yL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Haxwg79KL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Haxwg79KL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71v0G6U682L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71v0G6U682L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+9CAbciXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+9CAbciXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/9