        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B82PXCW\",\"sku\":\"B07B82PXCW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-federal-mid-century-modern-drop-leaf-dining-kitchen-table-walnut-wood-b07b82pxcw\",\"name\":\"Rivet Federal Mid-Century Modern Drop Leaf Dining Kitchen Table, Walnut Wood\",\"description\":\"With rich walnut veneer and tapered legs, this mid-century modern drop leaf dining table will make a style statement along with accommodating meals and board games. The beautiful table top is attached to the legs with a handsome y-shaped joint. 32&quot;L x 28-52&quot;W x 30&quot;H Sturdy construction and durable hardwoods Mid-century modern retro style Assembly in 30 minutes or less; just bolt on legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Drop leaf sides with latches\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Federal Mid-Century Modern Drop Leaf Dining Kitchen Table, Walnut Wood\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81WZkmqGRDL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o4guz5-aL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o4guz5-aL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VLMEKhdZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VLMEKhdZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-bUyILwNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-bUyILwNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BdBtV1bbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BdBtV1bbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91bs4EFYKfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91bs4EFYKfL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"30.0\"