      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X5443L\",\"sku\":\"B075X5443L\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-upholstered-cube-ottoman-pouf-20-w-rain-b075x5443l\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Upholstered Cube Ottoman Pouf, 20&quot;W, Rain\",\"description\":\"This item is made to order just for you 20&quot;W x 20&quot;Dx 17&quot;H Solid wood frame with 100% polyester fabric. Multi-purpose cube ottoman is great in any space. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Prop up your feet or add a tray of your favorite snacks to the top of this plush cube ottoman. Sturdy enough to use as an extra seat in any room, this versatile ottoman is offered in a range of fabrics. No assembly. Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. If needed, spot clean with a damp cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Upholstered Cube Ottoman Pouf, 20&quot;W, Rain\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xH6031GaL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1iR7Q6jewL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1iR7Q6jewL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A10lB188m5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A10lB188m5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16lSgkCw5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16lSgkCw5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1x0VEntwOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1x0VEntwOL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A12JeTGVBFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A12JeTGVBFL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"17.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\