        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B082VML3QJ\",\"sku\":\"B082VML3QJ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-alvin-contemporary-livingroom-ottoman-29-5-w-aqua-teal-blue-b082vml3qj\",\"name\":\"Rivet Alvin Contemporary Livingroom Ottoman, 29.5&quot;W, Aqua Teal Blue\",\"description\":\"If you’re looking for a versatile piece that's both modern and timeless, this ottoman is for you. Fitted performance upholstery rests securely on a firm cushion, and blonde wood legs add durability and stability. Overall: 29.5&quot;W x 21.7&quot;D x 16.9&quot;H Solid-wood frame and legs with performance upholstery Modern, simple design that combines Mid-century touches with contemporary Scandinavian appeal Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Alvin Contemporary Livingroom Ottoman, 29.5&quot;W, Aqua Teal Blue\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71an9fwM6pL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kQ6sFvElL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kQ6sFvElL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HGtB2wIyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HGtB2wIyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/8104kRFvPIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/8104kRFvPIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91klf8yrxmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91klf8yrxmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91B5tmqOVzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91B5tmqOVzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81-0XEYUaOL.jpg\"