      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B085GXS8JG\",\"sku\":\"B085GXS8JG\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"primrose-upholstered-rocking-recliner-chair-33-w-gray-b085gxs8jg\",\"name\":\"Primrose Upholstered Rocking Recliner Chair, 33&quot;W, Gray\",\"description\":\"The classic gray upholstery comes in a plush but durable fabric and features slight ribbing that provides just a touch of texture to your decor. The sloping lines of this piece create a shape you can easily relax into, and the mechanisms allow you to recline or rock with ease. 33&quot;W x 42&quot;D x 42&quot;H; seat height: 21&quot;H; seat back height: 42&quot;H; seat depth: 22&quot;D; arm height: 26&quot;H Kiln-dried hardwood, engineered wood, and high-density oriented strand board frame. Steel seat and back springs. High-resilience memory foam cushions. A sturdy wood frame under plush cushions provides a solid base for this chair’s classic shape, creating a winning combination of design and comfort. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Clean only with water-based shampoo or foam upholstery cleaner. Do not saturate. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Primrose Upholstered Rocking Recliner Chair, 33&quot;W, Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81vl6oNn9pL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DPdGNhf7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DPdGNhf7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81xRq+A53eL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81xRq+A53eL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JATUmI69L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JATUmI69L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81R9JDxsREL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapi