        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z8767S\",\"sku\":\"B075Z8767S\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bateman-casual-rustic-wood-platform-bed-frame-with-tall-headboard-king-81-w-brown-b075z8767s\",\"name\":\"Bateman Casual Rustic Wood Platform Bed Frame with Tall Headboard, King, 81&quot;W, Brown\",\"description\":\"80.75&quot;W x 86.75&quot;L x 60.5&quot;H; Leg Height: 5.75&quot; Acacia veneer, rubberwood and poplar hardwoods Wide plank design adds modern farmhouse style Multi-slat mattress support means no additional box spring required Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour with two people Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty Drift off to a night of sweet dreams in this king-size rustic wood bed. It features a tall plank-style headboard that will be the perfect focal point in your room and complement your casual, farmhouse or industrial décor.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bateman Casual Rustic Wood Platform Bed Frame with Tall Headboard, King, 81&quot;W, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91LlBeF64pL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811VeQDLsCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811VeQDLsCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1u1ZxqnJUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1u1ZxqnJUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91iMKHIjW1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91iMKHIjW1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1y4VBgazDS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1y4VBgazDS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91YRPLHwJmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91YRPLHwJmL.jpg\"