      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072M1WJ8S\",\"sku\":\"B072M1WJ8S\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-emerly-mid-century-modern-velvet-metal-leg-sofa-couch-83-5-w-pewter-b072m1wj8s\",\"name\":\"Rivet Emerly Mid-Century Modern Velvet Metal Leg Sofa Couch, 83.5&quot;W, Pewter\",\"description\":\"A sleek profile and metal legs make this piece an eye-catching modern addition to your home. Stain-resistant, heavy-duty fabric is woven for a velvety look and feel, yet designed to outlast many movie nights and quiet lounging days. 83.5”W x 35”D x 34”H Hardwood frame with sturdy mortise-and-tenon joints, performance fabric, metal legs Contemporary Reversible cushions double the lifespan of this piece Fashionable yet practical and easy to clean Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Emerly Mid-Century Modern Velvet Metal Leg Sofa Couch, 83.5&quot;W, Pewter\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81vGyiOjEHL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OqoQK7vNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OqoQK7vNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Fl6JuS-ZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Fl6JuS-ZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1F8PD6kBML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1F8PD6kBML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sHc1Jo0KL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sHc1Jo0KL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"34.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"35.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"