      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QDNQPC5\",\"sku\":\"B07QDNQPC5\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"carson-tufted-kitchen-counter-bar-stool-45-h-hemp-b07qdnqpc5\",\"name\":\"Carson Tufted Kitchen Counter Bar stool, 45&quot;H, Hemp\",\"description\":\"An Amazon brand - Modern tufting on the back, along with substantial padding in the back and seat, make this bar stool stylish and comfortable. The seat rests upon on classic tall wooden legs. Performance fabric makes it durable and easy to clean. 23.6&quot;W x 18.5&quot;D x 44.5&quot;H. Base height is 30&quot;. 95% polyester, 5% nylon on a solid hardwood frame Foam padding and elastic suspension system keeps upholstery firm and resilient No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Carson Tufted Kitchen Counter Bar stool, 45&quot;H, Hemp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71hyRObmmDL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ZZZfcwxbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ZZZfcwxbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71U227gLYVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71U227gLYVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mMVM4vg0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mMVM4vg0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tKpEJewtL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tKpEJewtL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/717gOphxLNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/717gOphxLNL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"44.49\",\"label