      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B82T39G\",\"sku\":\"B07B82T39G\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-dayton-modern-metal-bar-stool-35-h-pack-of-2-black-b07b82t39g\",\"name\":\"Rivet Dayton Modern Metal Bar Stool, 35&quot;H, Pack of 2, Black\",\"description\":\"22.8&quot;W x 22.4&quot;D x 35&quot;H Metal with black finish; rope Ideal for a modern or industrial space Use at the bar or kitchen counter, or move to another room when you need extra seating No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Enjoy many hours of conversation around the bar or kitchen island with these sleek bar stools. With tall minimalist curved legs, they're sleek, modern and compact for small spaces. A woven rope seat is comfortable and adds a global design touch.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Dayton Modern Metal Bar Stool, 35&quot;H, Pack of 2, Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Y0fPglZyL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JJZ+tR7QL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JJZ+tR7QL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7164cYB+aAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7164cYB+aAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JIXaPUB+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JIXaPUB+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1its6IG8rL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1its6IG8rL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81phtFKyRcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81phtFKyRcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81vKgQrpKyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"htt