      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075YQXQJR\",\"sku\":\"B075YQXQJR\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bergen-tufted-dining-room-kitchen-chairs-38-6-h-set-of-2-hemp-beige-wood-oak-b075yqxqjr\",\"name\":\"Bergen Tufted Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, 38.6&quot;H, Set of 2, Hemp Beige, Wood Oak\",\"description\":\"These lovely chairs combine Mid-century tufted backs with traditional elegantly curved legs. Performance fabric makes them easy to clean and durable for a busy family's wear and tear, and solid catalpa legs are sturdy and stable. 25.2&quot;W x 21.3&quot;D x 38.6&quot;H 95% polyester/5% nylon on hardwood frame; solid catalpa wood legs; firm resilient padding Foam padding and elastic suspension system helps keep seat firm and resilient No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bergen Tufted Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, 38.6&quot;H, Set of 2, Hemp Beige, Wood Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81xDDJsFI1L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Q4al1M2aL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Q4al1M2aL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91eoX8TGbIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91eoX8TGbIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B11Wai8F4qS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B11Wai8F4qS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91V+rN5JyaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91V+rN5JyaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IgEAPDCsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IgEAPDCsL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\