        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z8KXB6\",\"sku\":\"B075Z8KXB6\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ferndale-rustic-coffee-table-51-w-sandstone-b075z8kxb6\",\"name\":\"Ferndale Rustic Coffee Table, 51&quot;W, Sandstone\",\"description\":\"Made of solid reclaimed pine, this coffee table will add a warm rustic touch to your home. Knots and natural variations in the grain of the wood make each piece unique. Two storage drawers and a lower shelf provide handy storage space. 51”W x 27”D x 19”H Durable, sustainably sourced solid pine Modern rustic, with weathered finish and metal drawer pulls Two drawers provides a convenient place to store extra keys and phone chargers Easy assembly in 15 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ferndale Rustic Coffee Table, 51&quot;W, Sandstone\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81wXSqNl5bL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81eron1kGgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81eron1kGgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zCcR8jf+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zCcR8jf+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1WuUQIIh7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1WuUQIIh7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/917+EaYfZ6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/917+EaYfZ6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KFK4nDpAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KFK4nDpAL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"19.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"n