        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QBQD99G\",\"sku\":\"B07QBQD99G\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"canton-twin-button-tufted-headboard-42-w-charcoal-b07qbqd99g\",\"name\":\"Canton Twin Button-Tufted Headboard, 42&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"description\":\"Button tufting gives this headboard a classic, homey look that is equally at home in shabby-chic or transitional surroundings. The soft charcoal-colored upholstery offers a restful place to lean back with a good book before sinking into a good night's sleep. 42&quot;W x 3&quot;D x 62&quot;H Polyester and linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame This bed adds modern classic style to any space. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick layer of padding for extra comfort while you rest in bed with a good book. The headboard is fully upholstered on both the front and the back. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Vacuum, brush lightly, or spot clean only.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Canton Twin Button-Tufted Headboard, 42&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71TeyFCDXML.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rDLSX9N7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rDLSX9N7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91K5lp0U6ZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91K5lp0U6ZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81W+8icnuGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81W+8icnuGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817e8IH94rL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817e8IH94rL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"62.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]