      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4ZFD47\",\"sku\":\"B07B4ZFD47\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bridgewater-curved-king-headboard-82-w-spinnsol-indigo-b07b4zfd47\",\"name\":\"Bridgewater Curved King Headboard, 82&quot;W, Spinnsol Indigo\",\"description\":\"This headboard adds classic style to any space. Hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the headboards curved silhouette. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. This item is made to order just for you Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame The headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. 82&quot;W x 4&quot;D x 56&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bridgewater Curved King Headboard, 82&quot;W, Spinnsol Indigo\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813LhZGBU2L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ARcbKQbiL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ARcbKQbiL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ozaTTk-qL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ozaTTk-qL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91G91KH+u3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91G91KH+u3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919c0cevIXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919c0cevIXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916QFjy-l7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916QFjy