        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7HVRTJ\",\"sku\":\"B07B7HVRTJ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"alicia-contemporary-wood-office-chair-32-h-black-b07b7hvrtj\",\"name\":\"Alicia Contemporary Wood Office Chair, 32&quot;H, Black\",\"description\":\"This classic chair is a modern refresh of those used by generations of bankers and lawyers. The height and tilt can be adjusted, while it swivels 360 degrees and rolls on casters. This piece will blend with traditional and transitional-style decor. 26.2&quot;W x 26.6&quot;D x 31.5&quot;-34.5&quot;H Hardwood frame and base; foam cushion with linen upholstery; metal casters Mid-century minimalist, retro style 360 degree swivel function; height and tilt of chair can be adjusted; natural wood finish with soft upholstered cushion Assembly in 30 minutes to an hour; Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Alicia Contemporary Wood Office Chair, 32&quot;H, Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81CeUrYJ1iL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ost9ifTcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ost9ifTcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/911ty2azY3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/911ty2azY3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Hg7nRznfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Hg7nRznfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1TOZDvcghS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1TOZDvcghS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+bM9W1I7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+bM9W1I7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.