      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSJY7CY\",\"sku\":\"B07HSJY7CY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rustic-buffet-36-h-carbon-finished-wood-with-distressed-gold-handles-b07hsjy7cy\",\"name\":\"Rustic Buffet 36&quot;H, Carbon-Finished Wood with Distressed Gold Handles\",\"description\":\"This rustic buffet features ample storage and gorgeous details to amp up the charm. A galvanized iron top rests upon carbon-finished wood and distressed gold handles complete the homespun motif. Hardwood, Metal Features 2 drawers above 2 doors; interior shelf behind doors Clean as required with a soft, damp cloth; wipe completely dry. Avoid heat vents or open windows. 38&quot;D x 35.4&quot;W x 36&quot;H One year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rustic Buffet 36&quot;H, Carbon-Finished Wood with Distressed Gold Handles\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91yiY8nIhmL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XSy8k3L9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XSy8k3L9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GNBrKZhDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GNBrKZhDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91fG1gTF+xL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91fG1gTF+xL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NxfzhelTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NxfzhelTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91a9NwTBLNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91a9NwTBLNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GCvwlvrlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https