        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0854SQFCY\",\"sku\":\"B0854SQFCY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-slade-contemporary-living-room-accent-swivel-chair-27-w-sunday-graphite-b0854sqfcy\",\"name\":\"Rivet Slade Contemporary Living Room Accent Swivel Chair, 27&quot;W, Sunday Graphite\",\"description\":\"The comfortable curved shape and cutout design give this swivel chair a modern look that coordinates with a variety of decor styles. The solid hardwood frame creates a sturdy base and foam cushions provide comfort. Overall: 27&quot;W x 22&quot;D x 28&quot;H; seat height: 18&quot;H; seat depth: 22&quot;D; seat back height: 27&quot;H; arm height: 28&quot;H; leg height: 1&quot;H Solid hardwood frame, wood swivel base, and performance fabric upholstery This swivel chair adds a pop of style to a living room, bedroom or home office equally well. Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Slade Contemporary Living Room Accent Swivel Chair, 27&quot;W, Sunday Graphite\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81SDHpTri0L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814tYcXIjjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814tYcXIjjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CwyRnVA6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CwyRnVA6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gpuHHJHAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gpuHHJHAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81iFDDq-+HL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81iFDDq-+HL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81tNx