        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07P6JVMZD\",\"sku\":\"B07P6JVMZD\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bradbury-chesterfield-classic-sofa-92-9-w-slate-b07p6jvmzd\",\"name\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Classic Sofa, 92.9&quot;W, Slate\",\"description\":\"This lovely sofa has the low button-tufted back, scroll arms, and short legs that are the hallmark of the classic chesterfield style. Whether as a statement piece or part of a living-room suite, this sofa will be a welcome addition to any decor. Dimensions: 93&quot;W x 39&quot;D x 30&quot;H Solid hardwood frame; upholstery: 98% polyester, 2% nylon Removable and reversible seat cushions A classic style updated in stain-resistant fabric makes this perfect for the modern home. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Classic Sofa, 92.9&quot;W, Slate\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-ej3bpdUL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91P66gXA43L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91P66gXA43L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Q77hCH0UL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Q77hCH0UL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+0Ba34+dL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+0Ba34+dL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18YxGLkn2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18YxGLkn2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71PSMVIjL8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71PSMVIjL8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com