      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B085BGSWNS\",\"sku\":\"B085BGSWNS\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-wide-cushion-mid-century-modern-top-grain-leather-set-of-2-accent-dining-room-kitchen-chairs-26-8-w-black-renewed-b085bgswns\",\"name\":\"Rivet Wide Cushion Mid-Century Modern Top-Grain Leather Set of 2 Accent Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, 26.8&quot;W, Black (Renewed)\",\"description\":\"These wide Mid-century modern chairs stand out with their deep seats and top-grain leather. Clean lines and sturdy tapered legs give them a handsome presence at a dining room table, in a living area or behind a desk. 26.8&quot;W x 23.2&quot;D x 32.2&quot;H Top-grain leather; Solid hardwood frame and legs Foam padding and elastic suspension system keep back and seat firm Easy assembly in 15 minutes. Wipe with a soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Wide Cushion Mid-Century Modern Top-Grain Leather Set of 2 Accent Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, 26.8&quot;W, Black (Renewed)\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81YTSuZxaUL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81l3G+vaYDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81l3G+vaYDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91wQVjtVHzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91wQVjtVHzL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"32.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"23.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"27.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"weight\",\"label\":\"Weight\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"16.5\",\"label\":\"pounds\"}]},{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"label\":\"Keywords\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"Dining chair\",\"label\":\