      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07TZSC9X9\",\"sku\":\"B07TZSC9X9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-decatur-modern-kitchen-bar-stool-41-h-light-grey-b07tzsc9x9\",\"name\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Kitchen Bar Stool, 41&quot;H, Light Grey\",\"description\":\"This beautiful modern barstool features a bold squared-off design for both the seat and legs. The metal frame, supported by an H-spreader bar supports a plush, backed, armless seat covered in beautiful grey fabric. Overall: 22&quot;D x 18&quot;W x 41&quot;H. Seat height: 30&quot; Solid wooden frame and black metal legs combine for maximum style and support Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Arrives fully assembled. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Kitchen Bar Stool, 41&quot;H, Light Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yixEvbDDL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81RnI0kpoHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81RnI0kpoHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ymCWrJPXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ymCWrJPXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71cLqCvcNSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71cLqCvcNSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61jkSb90SSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61jkSb90SSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B13mhwbI2xS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B13mhwbI2xS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91UIKBtJirL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresigh