      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QCQ1J95\",\"sku\":\"B07QCQ1J95\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-contemporary-channel-back-dining-chair-35-h-felt-gray-set-of-2-b07qcq1j95\",\"name\":\"Rivet Contemporary Channel-Back Dining Chair, 35&quot;H, Felt Gray, Set of 2\",\"description\":\"This channel-back chair is a modern addition to any dining space. Its felt-gray upholstery will complement any number of color schemes, and its simple, understated design allows it to work in nearly any space. A solid wood frame and easy-care fabric give this chair plenty of durability. 19&quot;W x 24&quot;D x 35&quot;H; seat height: 19&quot;H; seat depth: 17&quot;D; seat back height: 16&quot;H Set of 2 100% polyester fabric on solid wood frame Simple design with channel back No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Contemporary Channel-Back Dining Chair, 35&quot;H, Felt Gray, Set of 2\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818f+vPEaSL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BjzTjNPcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BjzTjNPcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KvCXqvi6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KvCXqvi6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Dn9i2mLUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Dn9i2mLUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81I4BU7CdFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81I4BU7CdFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91wTcj7valL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91w