      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075QDMWTL\",\"sku\":\"B075QDMWTL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bordeaux-tufted-low-wingback-queen-bed-with-headboard-71-w-grey-b075qdmwtl\",\"name\":\"Bordeaux Tufted Low Wingback Queen Bed with Headboard, 71&quot;W, Grey\",\"description\":\"The modest wingback on this tall, stately headboard recalls classic style. The tufted upholstered headboard is paired with a simple low-profile footboard and side rails. The lovely neutral grey accents a sophisticated transitional piece. 90.75&quot; L x 71&quot;W x 58.5&quot;H Polyester fabric covers a solid wood frame Sophisticated classic style provides a focal point in a transitional style bedroom No boxpring required; mattress sold seperatly Assemble in 30 minutes to 1 hour Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bordeaux Tufted Low Wingback Queen Bed with Headboard, 71&quot;W, Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RPZ9o+GkL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16V8DwFSwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16V8DwFSwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1DucC3jZCS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1DucC3jZCS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91J0+MyeN+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91J0+MyeN+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hHL8mjC5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hHL8mjC5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B12n2UUnHBS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B12n2UUnHBS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"valu