        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B074KN35K2\",\"sku\":\"B074KN35K2\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"cabernet-slatted-2-drawer-cabinet-23-6-w-ash-b074kn35k2\",\"name\":\"Cabernet Slatted 2-Drawer Cabinet, 23.6&quot;W, Ash\",\"description\":\"23.6”W x 15.7”D x 31.7”H Solid ash frame and legs are complemented by hardwood doors with ash veneer A handsome piece that can anchor a modern, rustic or transitional style room Can be a standalone piece in a hallway or a side table in a living room or bedroom. Assembly in 15 minutes or less. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This simple, beautifully designed 2-drawer cabinet can double as a compact side table next to a sofa or bed, providing storage space as well as a handsome complement to a modern, transitional or rustic decor. Solid ash accents add visual interest.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Cabernet Slatted 2-Drawer Cabinet, 23.6&quot;W, Ash\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KESMN-QWL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1eXlOuO--L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1eXlOuO--L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TkFfv20IL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TkFfv20IL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Ig1ui9VfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Ig1ui9VfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mf+wosR1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mf+wosR1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1J0ILdQlJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1J0ILdQlJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis