      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07MJJX2KW\",\"sku\":\"B07MJJX2KW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-modern-dining-chair-37-6-inch-height-cream-b07mjjx2kw\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Modern Dining Chair, 37.6 Inch Height, Cream\",\"description\":\"Overall: 24.20&quot;W x 19.5&quot;D x 37.6&quot;H; seat height: 18.5&quot;H; seat depth: 21&quot;D; seat back height: 19&quot;H Dining chair framed in wood and manufactured wood; cushioned with high-density foam for comfort An arching back silhouette, plush upholstery, and beautiful nailhead trim along the back and bottom edges make this modern dining chair both convenient accent seating and a stunning decor accent. Brown-finished solid-wood legs balance the design and offer lasting durability. Soft, woven fabric upholstery is 100% polyester for easy cleaning and maintenance. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Use water-based cleaning agents or foam. Never use tap water. Use distilled water, as tap water contains minerals that may cause rings or fading.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Modern Dining Chair, 37.6 Inch Height, Cream\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81STj7Ey2fL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81NcH12pxlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81NcH12pxlL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81k4rfmngjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81k4rfmngjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yck1nN6hL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yck1nN6hL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1179h-+OHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1179h-+OHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-