        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B084W2WJGL\",\"sku\":\"B084W2WJGL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"esme-memory-swivel-counter-height-barstool-39-4-h-hemp-b084w2wjgl\",\"name\":\"Esme Memory-Swivel Counter-Height Barstool, 39.4&quot;H, Hemp\",\"description\":\"This hemp-colored counter-height barstool features a memory swivel, so it will always look polished and poised at your bar or kitchen counter. The very slightly winged high back makes a refined statement when set against your classic kitchen cabinets or polished bar. 20.1&quot;W x 22.4&quot;D x 39.4&quot;H; seat height: 26&quot;H; seat depth: 16.5&quot;D; seat back height: 18.5&quot;H; leg height: 20.9&quot;H Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric A memory-swivel mechanism means this barstool always looks tidy. Classic transitional look with memory swivel No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Esme Memory-Swivel Counter-Height Barstool, 39.4&quot;H, Hemp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81WGvQE9FOL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71pwQQMHAiL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71pwQQMHAiL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81VykmOzzlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81VykmOzzlL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Mu+Z2ZX+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Mu+Z2ZX+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81fQvZkcy5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81fQvZkcy5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81J6r3T79sL.jpg\",\"ur