        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z85VX9\",\"sku\":\"B075Z85VX9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"sparrow-modern-industrial-coffee-table-55-1-w-wood-and-bronze-b075z85vx9\",\"name\":\"Sparrow Modern Industrial Coffee Table, 55.1&quot;W, Wood and Bronze\",\"description\":\"This sturdy, eye-catching coffee table will serve your family well through many fun gatherings. A sleek bronze-finished frame holds a top made of reclaimed elm. Elements of rustic, industrial and glam styles combine for a look that blends with modern décor. 55.1&quot;W x 31.5&quot;D x 18.5&quot;H Reclaimed elm wood top; metal frame with a bronze finish Modern and rustic, with elements of glam Sturdy and durable for displaying magazines, holding snack trays and every day life No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Sparrow Modern Industrial Coffee Table, 55.1&quot;W, Wood and Bronze\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Ui8ADmFuL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HD8Y7K2OL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HD8Y7K2OL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KDambstGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KDambstGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1jv8gOAo3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1jv8gOAo3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rsLiNdTjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rsLiNdTjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1nJNmUO2FL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1nJNmUO2FL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\"