        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073G7BVCT\",\"sku\":\"B073G7BVCT\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"highland-modern-wingback-living-room-accent-chair-31-9-w-oatmeal-b073g7bvct\",\"name\":\"Highland Modern Wingback Living Room Accent Chair, 31.9&quot;W, Oatmeal\",\"description\":\"Bridging classic and contemporary, this accent chair is a modern twist on the timeless wingback chair. The clean, updated style with thick-woven fabric brings welcoming comfort to your seating area. 31.9&quot;W x 37.8&quot;D x 42&quot;H Sustainably sourced solid beech wood covered in thick-woven fabric Contemporary Updated design on a classic piece blends well with existing décor. Minimal assembly; just attach legs Free returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Highland Modern Wingback Living Room Accent Chair, 31.9&quot;W, Oatmeal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1uQGRb4TfS.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1rgZTNg+RS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1rgZTNg+RS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Mk7V552pL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Mk7V552pL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GNbs1N+LL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GNbs1N+LL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lamvXuBpL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lamvXuBpL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1m7wnrQeIS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1m7wnrQeIS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1K9q9tepNS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googlea