        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07BW8PWHT\",\"sku\":\"B07BW8PWHT\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bradbury-chesterfield-tufted-leather-loveseat-sofa-couch-78-7-w-chestnut-brown-b07bw8pwht\",\"name\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Tufted Leather Loveseat Sofa Couch, 78.7&quot;W, Chestnut Brown\",\"description\":\"Create a lounge-worthy living room with this modernized Chesterfield sofa. Rich brown leather upholstery, along with a high back and arms, invites you to curl up to read a good book or take a catnap. Dimensions: 78.7''W x 39”D x 30.3”H Engineered wood frame and 100% leather Modern and classic touches Restyled classic design with durable leather. Easy-to-attach legs Free returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Tufted Leather Loveseat Sofa Couch, 78.7&quot;W, Chestnut Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71XoGiJXg3L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919fVGBw1nL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919fVGBw1nL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XPfHH3WIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XPfHH3WIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nK0NS5ozL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nK0NS5ozL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/716FjzI-NzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/716FjzI-NzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91A8wwstC+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91A8wwstC+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/712BPBU4mVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/p