        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B85FJD5\",\"sku\":\"B07B85FJD5\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-federal-mid-century-modern-small-wood-dining-table-39-57-l-brown-b07b85fjd5\",\"name\":\"Rivet Federal Mid-Century Modern Small Wood Dining Table, 39-57&quot;L, Brown\",\"description\":\"With rich walnut veneer and tapered legs, this mid-century modern dining table will make a style statement along with accommodating meals and board games. The beautiful table top is attached to the legs with a handsome y-shaped joint. 33&quot;D x 39-57&quot;L x 30&quot;H Sturdy construction and durable hardwoods Mid-century modern retro style An extra leaf is provided to expand the table if needed Assembly in 30 minutes or less; just bolt on legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Federal Mid-Century Modern Small Wood Dining Table, 39-57&quot;L, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811UmkIn6SL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ooyrhSUfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ooyrhSUfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pwmXog6kL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pwmXog6kL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o4guz5-aL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o4guz5-aL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/716eqOtlQQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/716eqOtlQQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Tk09zzWWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Tk09zzWWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9