        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QBQBXTD\",\"sku\":\"B07QBQBXTD\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"dining-chair-with-deep-tufting-42-h-hemp-b07qbqbxtd\",\"name\":\"Dining Chair with Deep Tufting, 42&quot;H, Hemp\",\"description\":\"Deep tufting creates texture and depth on this traditional dining chair. The brass nail design creates a contrast with hemp-colored upholstery. Upholstery fabric repels both water and stains, making the chair simple to care for. The chair is supported by a durable hardwood frame. 23&quot;W x 26&quot;D x 42&quot;H; seat height: 20&quot;H; seat depth: 18&quot;D; seat back height: 22&quot;H Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric made of 95% polyester, 5% nylon Classic design, deep tufting, and brass nails No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Dining Chair with Deep Tufting, 42&quot;H, Hemp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KlcfYsBiL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81n4veZOvBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81n4veZOvBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81u7mgC0weL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81u7mgC0weL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aiZPOKPJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aiZPOKPJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81GhcIQ0NIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81GhcIQ0NIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81DU4+gd2AL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81DU4+gd2AL.jpg\"}],\"attributes