        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07P8SV57Z\",\"sku\":\"B07P8SV57Z\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"lauren-down-filled-oversized-sofa-couch-with-hardwood-frame-89-w-pepper-b07p8sv57z\",\"name\":\"Lauren Down-Filled Oversized Sofa Couch with Hardwood Frame, 89&quot;W, Pepper\",\"description\":\"Dimensions: 89&quot;W x 45&quot;D x 37&quot;H Soft down-filled cushions on a frame of solid hardwood mean this sofa offers plush support and security. Neutral pepper-colored upholstery allows this piece to blend into your existing color scheme with ease. Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric made of 98% polyester, 2% nylon; down-filled seat and back cushions Removable and reversible seat cushions make cleanup easy. Classic design will suit any space. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Lauren Down-Filled Oversized Sofa Couch with Hardwood Frame, 89&quot;W, Pepper\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71rl+gFb2-L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+SwygbNqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+SwygbNqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JL5eW-1yL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JL5eW-1yL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B15G97XI0XS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B15G97XI0XS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71JHhpeMxQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71JHhpeMxQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71yhzHvnXGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/ori