      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QC84LP1\",\"sku\":\"B07QC84LP1\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"mid-century-swivel-chair-25-2-w-brown-b07qc84lp1\",\"name\":\"Mid-Century Swivel Chair, 25.2&quot;W, Brown\",\"description\":\"A button-tufted barrel back with arms in a continuous curve make this mid-century-inspired swivel chair a favorite place to sit while tackling the task at hand. The adjustable height and foam-padded upholstery allow for maximum comfort. 25.2&quot;W x 24.4&quot;D x 35.8–41.3&quot;H Bonded leather upholstery over solid engineered hardwood and metal frame; foam padding; metal base with rollers This mid-century-inspired swivel chair features a pneumatic seat height adjustment; a 360-degree swivel mechanism; and water- and stain- resistant bonded leather. The button-tufted barrel back upholstered in brown bonded leather makes this chair a welcome addition to your study or home office. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Mid-Century Swivel Chair, 25.2&quot;W, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81N0A3muy0L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81o6akfFz0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81o6akfFz0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16oatRJt7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16oatRJt7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81e0xtGSCBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81e0xtGSCBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CyyfHUm0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CyyfHUm0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-i