      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075ZDWPHC\",\"sku\":\"B075ZDWPHC\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"miramar-elm-wood-cutout-coffee-table-39-4-d-natural-b075zdwphc\",\"name\":\"Miramar Elm Wood Cutout Coffee Table, 39.4&quot;D, Natural\",\"description\":\"Beautiful texture and grain, combined with clever modern side openings, give this coffee table the appearance of a hollowed-out log. It's a foot stool, a place to rest beverages and trays of snacks, and a handsome conversation piece all in one. 39.4&quot;Diameter x 17.1&quot;H Elm wood shows natural grain A modern rustic piece that works with modern and modern farmhouse décor Sturdy and durable with display space for magazines or decorative items underneath No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Miramar Elm Wood Cutout Coffee Table, 39.4&quot;D, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9118Mw9hUWL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A146C45PAXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A146C45PAXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91BlV71WEQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91BlV71WEQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MZixepeFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MZixepeFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1C7awV9CIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1C7awV9CIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A14Te0QqIqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A14Te0QqIqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91