        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072635QWD\",\"sku\":\"B072635QWD\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-andrews-contemporary-top-grain-leather-sofa-82-w-cognac-b072635qwd\",\"name\":\"Rivet Andrews Contemporary Top-Grain Leather Sofa, 82&quot;W, Cognac\",\"description\":\"82&quot;W x 37”D x 36.2”H Soft top-grain leather; solid hardwood frame. Two-over-two cushion design with comfortable foam cushioning and resilient elastic webbing Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Bring comfort and style into your living room with this practical sofa. Featuring a solid wood frame with 100% top-grain leather, it's made to withstand active households. Clean, tailored lines add a modern touch. Simple leg assembly. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Andrews Contemporary Top-Grain Leather Sofa, 82&quot;W, Cognac\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pnIH2iwTL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jF7DYCw4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jF7DYCw4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814xmgxZkoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814xmgxZkoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A12z4mrmo-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A12z4mrmo-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B15pHkvfoKS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B15pHkvfoKS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"31.5\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"81.9\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"37.0\",\"label\":\"inches