        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4MN142\",\"sku\":\"B07B4MN142\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"edmunds-traditional-leather-recliner-30-w-saddle-brown-b07b4mn142\",\"name\":\"Edmunds Traditional Leather Recliner, 30&quot;W, Saddle Brown\",\"description\":\"Straight lines and narrow arms combine modern touches with classic fabric, making this chair an ideal transitional style -- AND it's a recliner that doesn't look like a recliner. This piece will last through years of movies and afternoon naps. 30&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 41&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 23&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 41&quot;H; Arm Height: 23&quot;H; Front legs: 4.5&quot;H; Back legs: 4.125&quot;H Top grain leather, sturdy pine wood frame Streamlined silhouette combines modern style with top grain leather for a transitional look Push back reclining mechanism No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Edmunds Traditional Leather Recliner, 30&quot;W, Saddle Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91br7ly0zML.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mub1j6VaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mub1j6VaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1mbv54efwS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1mbv54efwS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91D2SSliBCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91D2SSliBCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pFBtFk6yL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pFBtFk6yL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cE6lDJV0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-i