        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07GXT9HXN\",\"sku\":\"B07GXT9HXN\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"adjustable-activity-office-tilt-stool-black-b07gxt9hxn\",\"name\":\"Adjustable Activity Office Tilt Stool, Black\",\"description\":\"Active stool for home, school, or office; can help an energetic or restless person stay focused; suitable for kids and adults Curved base enables a wide range of motion; comfortable foam seat covered in durable polyurethane (PU) Backless design promotes active sitting and proper posture, which can help strengthen back and core Height-adjustable from 18.5 to 26 inches thanks to its user-friendly pneumatic gas lift Measures 13.6 by 13.6 by 21.8 inches; weighs 19.8 pounds; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty Note: To release the lift, have to provide a very strong pressure\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Adjustable Activity Office Tilt Stool, Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71pe0O+wvuL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/911V9BTw5UL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/911V9BTw5UL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Lc4JdN9kL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Lc4JdN9kL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71h+fwvNi4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71h+fwvNi4L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"21.85\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"13.58\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"13.58\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"weight\",\"label\":\"Weight\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"19.84\",\"label\":\"pounds\"}]},{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"label\":