      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07BZQQP5G\",\"sku\":\"B07BZQQP5G\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-fun-contemporary-office-desk-chair-36-39-h-grey-black-b07bzqqp5g\",\"name\":\"Rivet Fun Contemporary Office Desk Chair, 36&quot;-39&quot;H, Grey/Black\",\"description\":\"Contemporary style and function are hallmarks of this chair. The height and tilt of the seat can be adjusted, and it swivels 360 degrees. Soft cushioning on the squared back and seat keep you comfortable, and metal casters make it easy to move. 21&quot;W x 16.5&quot;D x 36&quot;-39&quot;H Polyester canvas upholstery, foam padding; metal base and frame Assembly in 15 minutes or less; insert casters onto base Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Fun Contemporary Office Desk Chair, 36&quot;-39&quot;H, Grey/Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ibi6oQcTL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19PuDQ6FkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19PuDQ6FkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+LRIiGatL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+LRIiGatL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1htitZDsyS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1htitZDsyS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ZOWzZ4JUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ZOWzZ4JUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81apIXgC1bL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81apIXgC1bL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"39.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"