      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4GVPRB\",\"sku\":\"B07B4GVPRB\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"brandeberry-farmhouse-charles-of-london-accent-chair-38-w-stone-b07b4gvprb\",\"name\":\"Brandeberry Farmhouse Charles of London Accent Chair, 38&quot;W, Stone\",\"description\":\"The classic English roll arm gives this cozy chair a look ideal for a cottage or farmhouse décor. Sturdy construction, durable fabric and reversible cushions allow this piece to withstand years of fun with friends, family and pets. 38&quot;W x 43&quot;D x 39&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 22&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 37&quot;H; Arm Height: 27&quot;H; Front legs: 5.25&quot;H; Back legs: 4&quot;H Stain-resistant polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame English roll arms combine with modern lines to blend with transitional or farmhouse décor Sturdy frame, reversible cushions for durability; front-leg casters make it easy to move Easy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Brandeberry Farmhouse Charles of London Accent Chair, 38&quot;W, Stone\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1bil1dU-QL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1lG3wTLNZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1lG3wTLNZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91U4md4BX3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91U4md4BX3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91m64KzQFBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91m64KzQFBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1g5iAYWNvS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1g5iAYWNvS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.go