        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HZ58Q4G\",\"sku\":\"B07HZ58Q4G\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bagley-sectional-component-wedge-fabric-67-w-linen-b07hz58q4g\",\"name\":\"Bagley Sectional Component, Wedge, Fabric, 67&quot;W, Linen\",\"description\":\"This sectional sofa boasts a smooth polyester-nylon blend that’s a dream to sit or lie on. This is the wedge component—put several pieces together to arrange your seating in a way that brings the most possible comfort to your living room. Sturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric Attached back and reversible seat cushions add lasting style. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you Overall: 67&quot;W x 40&quot;D x 36&quot;H; seat height: 22&quot;H; seat depth: 24&quot;D; seat back height: 36&quot;H; leg height: 2.125&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bagley Sectional Component, Wedge, Fabric, 67&quot;W, Linen\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61B-hRgOkGL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OSji2+-FL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OSji2+-FL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81PljiEVvvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81PljiEVvvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GpKKMmZWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GpKKMmZWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81DvK7BiQNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81DvK7BiQNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1k0VgojcqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1k0VgojcqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.goo