      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07P6JWDC1\",\"sku\":\"B07P6JWDC1\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bradbury-chesterfield-classic-ottoman-30-w-pepper-b07p6jwdc1\",\"name\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Classic Ottoman, 30&quot;W, Pepper\",\"description\":\"This lovely ottoman has the low profile and short legs that are the hallmark of the classic chesterfield style. Whether as a statement piece or part of a living-room suite, this ottoman will be a welcome addition to any decor. Dimensions: 30&quot;W x 22&quot;D x 20&quot;H Solid hardwood frame; upholstery: 98% polyester, 2% nylon This ottoman doubles as a welcome place to rest tired feet or as extra seating. A classic style updated in stain-resistant fabric makes this perfect for the modern home. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Classic Ottoman, 30&quot;W, Pepper\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814CHBEtV-L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VturKOkIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VturKOkIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81n-fQmFmhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81n-fQmFmhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qqpcliK1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qqpcliK1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91IEdupIhRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91IEdupIhRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81GdRQwf9+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81GdRQwf9+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"ht