        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4SCPNQ\",\"sku\":\"B07B4SCPNQ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bridgewater-scalloped-queen-headboard-71-w-classic-cream-b07b4scpnq\",\"name\":\"Bridgewater Scalloped Queen Headboard, 71&quot;W, Classic Cream\",\"description\":\"This headboard adds classic style to any space. The scalloped corners and top stitch detailing complete the look. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. This item is made to order just for you Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame The headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. 71&quot;W x 5&quot;D x 51&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bridgewater Scalloped Queen Headboard, 71&quot;W, Classic Cream\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FJT4ANrfL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-JQea3DTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-JQea3DTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81m0eEH1OfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81m0eEH1OfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TuyGJ3eJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TuyGJ3eJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rCJrrCVGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rCJrrCVGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MQ+V-XhpL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MQ+V-XhpL