        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSGCNGT\",\"sku\":\"B07HSGCNGT\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-industrial-wood-bar-cabinet-18-w-mango-french-honey-gray-b07hsgcngt\",\"name\":\"Rivet Industrial Wood Bar Cabinet, 18&quot;W, Mango, French Honey Gray\",\"description\":\"Upgrade your home décor with this captivating industrial-style bar cabinet. The interior space includes wine-bottle storage on one side and shelves for glassware on the other, and the geometric pattern on the doors, sealed with French honey gray finish, adds interest to the piece. 18&quot;W x 30&quot;D x 35&quot;H Modern styling that will blend well with most home décor Assemble in 15 minutes or less Care: Clean as required with a soft, damp cloth; wipe completely dry. Avoid placing furniture near heat vents or open windows. Long periods of heat or excessive dampness can cause splitting, warping, and swelling in solid wood. Protect fine furniture finishes from hot dishes, alcohol, and excessive moisture or dampness. Safety: Always use the anti-tip hardware when applicable and follow directions. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Industrial Wood Bar Cabinet, 18&quot;W, Mango, French Honey Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pAsEY2WxL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91s1T0BJ4vL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91s1T0BJ4vL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+E4CBk-XL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+E4CBk-XL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Yu7mlD3DL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Yu7mlD3DL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LwzUlsAyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://stor