      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07BWKH16R\",\"sku\":\"B07BWKH16R\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bradbury-chesterfield-tufted-leather-sofa-couch-92-9-w-black-b07bwkh16r\",\"name\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Tufted Leather Sofa Couch, 92.9&quot;W, Black\",\"description\":\"Create a lounge-worthy living room with this modern chesterfield sofa. Rich leather upholstery, along with a high back and arms, invites you to curl up to read a good book or take a catnap. Dimensions: 92.9''W x 39”D x 30.3”H Engineered wood frame and 100% leather Modern and classic touches Restyled classic design with durable leather. Easy-to-attach legs Free returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Tufted Leather Sofa Couch, 92.9&quot;W, Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71OCw66IsGL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xjNpuA0iL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xjNpuA0iL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71hhAZwSjPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71hhAZwSjPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BmOoxLr4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BmOoxLr4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91uF6RhzF+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91uF6RhzF+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71teSbGlm9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71teSbGlm9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1d9Ixj6AgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1d9Ixj6AgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"ht