        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B074KMVDRS\",\"sku\":\"B074KMVDRS\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"parson-entertainment-console-with-drawers-72-w-oak-b074kmvdrs\",\"name\":\"Parson Entertainment Console with Drawers, 72&quot;W, Oak\",\"description\":\"Enjoy years of use with this practical and casual solid wood media entertainment console. The 72&quot; width is perfect for a wide-screen TV for movies and gaming, with durable drawers and shelving below to contain devices and accessories. 72&quot;W x 16&quot;D x 25&quot;H Solid wood with beautiful oak finish Clean modern lines and rustic finish combined for a transitional style No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. A pleasing transitional console that will fit traditional or modern style rooms\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Parson Entertainment Console with Drawers, 72&quot;W, Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81zgzv-tHKL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81XoyLk-7mL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81XoyLk-7mL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IGqexTqhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IGqexTqhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QEU7AhM9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QEU7AhM9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ku8jX2sVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ku8jX2sVL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"25.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"72.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\"