        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07BWJCPX2\",\"sku\":\"B07BWJCPX2\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"kristin-round-arm-performance-fabric-reversible-chaise-sofa-couch-96-5-w-stone-b07bwjcpx2\",\"name\":\"Kristin Round Arm Performance Fabric Reversible Chaise Sofa Couch, 96.5&quot;W, Stone\",\"description\":\"This inviting sofa will be the center of many get-togethers with family and friends. With a classic style and durable build, no one will be able to resist sitting down and relaxing in all-out comfort. 96.5&quot;W x 37&quot;D x 37.5&quot;H Solid hardwood and laminate wood frame; polyester/nylon performance fabric Modern casual Classic style designed for heavy-duty use Minimal assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Kristin Round Arm Performance Fabric Reversible Chaise Sofa Couch, 96.5&quot;W, Stone\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811UU8EZQWL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1+dEuAMyNS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1+dEuAMyNS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1SHExmHKML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1SHExmHKML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A157NlPFkqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A157NlPFkqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1PNHqIvlFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1PNHqIvlFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81rPUJ+3dEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81rPUJ+3dEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81MYKpfB6lL.jpg\",\"url\":\"http