        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07J2Z2L2W\",\"sku\":\"B07J2Z2L2W\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-alvin-contemporary-sofa-couch-81-w-light-grey-b07j2z2l2w\",\"name\":\"Rivet Alvin Contemporary Sofa Couch, 81&quot;W, Light Grey\",\"description\":\"If you’re looking for a piece that’s at once modern and timeless, this sofa is for you. The button-tufted, fixed back gently curves into a pair of elegant armrests, and two firm, spacious seat cushions add durability and comfort. Overall: 81&quot;W x 37&quot;D x 32&quot;H; Seat Height: 18.1&quot;H; Seat Depth: 23.2&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 32&quot;H; Arm Height: 22&quot;H; Leg Height: 7.1&quot;H Solid-wood frame and legs with performance upholstery Modern, simple design that combines Mid-century touches with contemporary Scandinavian appeal Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Alvin Contemporary Sofa Couch, 81&quot;W, Light Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814L8rwPjtL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91UVqxRbJzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91UVqxRbJzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81z-J58G6RL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81z-J58G6RL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71r+34JadIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71r+34JadIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91uFDt9OoJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91uFDt9OoJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1hV-sfogzS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1hV-sfogzS.jpg