      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07MBFDKXG\",\"sku\":\"B07MBFDKXG\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-modern-upholstery-bar-stool-with-back-30-seat-height-beige-set-of-2-b07mbfdkxg\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Modern upholstery Bar Stool with Back, 30&quot; seat Height, Beige, Set of 2\",\"description\":\"Overall: 18.75&quot;W x 20.5&quot;D x 44&quot;H; seat height: 30&quot;H; seat depth: 16.5&quot;D,seat back height: 14&quot;H Barstool of durable fabric on wood frame Contemporary design with wooden frame and tufted upholstery in beige fabric; solid-wood legs with black finish Foam padding and elastic suspension system keep the back and seat firm and springy. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Modern upholstery Bar Stool with Back, 30&quot; seat Height, Beige, Set of 2\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71YI3LSyJRL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71EvSB4Wt8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71EvSB4Wt8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+jonTyxVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+jonTyxVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71PgHKrqpOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71PgHKrqpOL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9193iiu7QkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9193iiu7QkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71RfO6Ob6kL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71RfO6Ob6kL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-i