        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QHYD5ZP\",\"sku\":\"B07QHYD5ZP\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"hillman-mid-century-loveseat-sofa-with-wood-base-and-legs-62-w-ivory-b07qhyd5zp\",\"name\":\"Hillman Mid-Century Loveseat Sofa with Wood Base and Legs, 62&quot;W, Ivory\",\"description\":\"Wide, comfortable cushions are a hallmark of this mid-century inspired love seat. Easy-care ivory upholstery and reversible back cushions help keep this piece looking fresh. A hardwood frame connects to tapered wood legs and lends structure to the foam-padded cushions. High arms give additional support. 62&quot;W x 38&quot;D x 33&quot;H; seat height: 18&quot;H; seat depth: 21&quot;D; seat back height: 18&quot;H; arm height: 26&quot;H; leg height: 8&quot;H Solid hardwood frame, tapered wood legs, and 85% polyester and 15% acrylic performance fabric Removable and reversible back and throw cushions Classic shape and rearrangeable cushions make this love seat work in a variety of decors. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Hillman Mid-Century Loveseat Sofa with Wood Base and Legs, 62&quot;W, Ivory\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JxmIIYgML.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1WaxcGFsVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1WaxcGFsVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ssyEntTzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ssyEntTzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NKd-3CRnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NKd-3CRnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919NsLITPXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/pu