      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07BVHKPFS\",\"sku\":\"B07BVHKPFS\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-bowlyn-mid-century-modern-wood-tv-media-table-stand-64-walnut-b07bvhkpfs\",\"name\":\"Rivet Bowlyn Mid-Century Modern Wood TV Media Table Stand, 64&quot;, Walnut\",\"description\":\"The minimalist brass drawer pulls and curved metal legs make this media console a mid-century modern showpiece. Four drawers give you ample room for storing electronics, while open cubbies accommodate gaming consoles, cords and wires. 18&quot;L x 64&quot;W x 24&quot;H Hardwoods made of rubberwood and poplar; walnut finish; metal hardware Assembly in 30 minutes or less; bolt on legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Bowlyn Mid-Century Modern Wood TV Media Table Stand, 64&quot;, Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81iwjQUT97L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o4guz5-aL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o4guz5-aL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916waJ8j5WL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916waJ8j5WL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nfaJXp6KL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nfaJXp6KL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zIGOrgT1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zIGOrgT1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Vpbr1EzgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Vpbr1EzgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81veTgnpm0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-i