        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07JY2XNG6\",\"sku\":\"B07JY2XNG6\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"pinebrook-traditional-recliner-leather-39-w-charcoal-b07jy2xng6\",\"name\":\"Pinebrook Traditional Recliner, Leather, 39&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"description\":\"Kick back and relax in this simple and stylish recliner. The sturdy wood frame and top-grain leather upholstery make this a durable addition to your living room, and the push-back reclining mechanism makes relaxation easy. Sturdy wood frame with rich top-grain leather upholstery Push-back reclining mechanism No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you Overall: 39&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 41&quot;H; seat height: 21&quot;H; seat depth: 23&quot;D; seat back height: 41&quot;H; arm height: 22&quot;H; leg height: 4.5&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Pinebrook Traditional Recliner, Leather, 39&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81LcH0wjsGL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EkMUxnYuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EkMUxnYuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81d0zwj+pTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81d0zwj+pTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818g4hjSMxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818g4hjSMxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A11OO2qmTDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A11OO2qmTDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Osma8CgfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Osma8CgfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/