        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B071FJR479\",\"sku\":\"B071FJR479\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-west-mid-century-oak-distinct-grain-6-drawer-dresser-60-w-dark-oak-finish-b071fjr479\",\"name\":\"Rivet West, Mid-Century, Oak Distinct Grain, 6-Drawer Dresser, 60&quot;W, Dark Oak Finish\",\"description\":\"Add the perfect touch of originality to your bedroom with this mid-century dresser. The brass pulls and concealed glides under the six drawers provide a clean style. Veneer made from hand-selected quarter-sawn oak adds a distinctive grain. 60&quot;W x 19&quot;D x 35&quot;H Solid hardwoods with finish of wire-brushed matte dark oak Modern and simple yet distinctive design No assembly needed. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Drawers are suspended on easy opening, concealed, self-closing extension guides\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet West, Mid-Century, Oak Distinct Grain, 6-Drawer Dresser, 60&quot;W, Dark Oak Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915QNGcI0GL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918gsrqa1xL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918gsrqa1xL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A17f4Yu-NWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A17f4Yu-NWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Kd6X6zpyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Kd6X6zpyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Efaut9FPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Efaut9FPL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"35.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"