        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07MSWQR39\",\"sku\":\"B07MSWQR39\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-traditional-dining-chair-36-inch-height-charcoal-grey-b07mswqr39\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Traditional Dining Chair, 36 Inch Height, Charcoal Grey\",\"description\":\"Overall: 26.0&quot;W x 21.7&quot;D x 36.0&quot;H; seat height: 18.5&quot;H; seat depth: 21&quot;D; seat back height: 17.52&quot;H; arm height: 24.40&quot;H Dining chair framed in wood and manufactured wood; cushioned with high-density foam for comfort A clean-lined square back, elegant low-swoop arms, plush upholstery, and beautiful nailhead trim make this dining chair both convenient accent seating and a stunning decor accent. Brown-finished solid-wood legs balance the design and offer lasting durability. Soft, woven fabric upholstery is 100% polyester for easy cleaning and maintenance. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Use water-based cleaning agents or foam. Never use tap water. Use distilled water, as tap water contains minerals that may cause rings or fading.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Traditional Dining Chair, 36 Inch Height, Charcoal Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nJaB4gKZL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pL0VxBwhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pL0VxBwhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91LDOj+30oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91LDOj+30oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81n8gV2d37L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81n8gV2d37L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pwfthAQkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pwfthAQkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"