        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B086TGFT35\",\"sku\":\"B086TGFT35\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"solid-platform-bed-rustic-finish-no-box-spring-needed-strong-wood-slat-support-queen-b086tgft35\",\"name\":\"Solid Platform Bed - Rustic Finish - No Box Spring Needed - Strong Wood Slat Support, Queen\",\"description\":\"Queen platform bed with solid wood construction; 90% pine, 10% plywood (includes metal hardware) Mid-century modern meets sophisticated rustic design Durable wooden slats provide even support for mattress; noise-free construction elimiates squeaks Non-slip tape keeps mattress in place (mattress not included) Stress-free assembly with tools, hardware, and all components included Does not require a box spring; mattress sits directly on slats\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Solid Platform Bed - Rustic Finish - No Box Spring Needed - Strong Wood Slat Support, Queen\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ANj1VFksL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91sWcpZqWGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91sWcpZqWGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1c7LK5Pc0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1c7LK5Pc0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mKV4kNI-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mKV4kNI-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81DVNPvr1sL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81DVNPvr1sL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81eujVXO9nL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81eujVXO9nL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/912BPHTZx