      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSMYNYJ\",\"sku\":\"B07HSMYNYJ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-stevens-modern-2-drawer-bookcase-27-56-w-brushed-tundra-gray-b07hsmynyj\",\"name\":\"Rivet Stevens Modern 2-Drawer Bookcase, 27.56&quot;W, Brushed Tundra Gray\",\"description\":\"Update your home décor with this gorgeous modern-style bookcase. Made from solid acacia, this bookcase is highly durable, and its brushed tundra-gray finish blends well with most home-décor themes. Its 6 niches and 2 drawers offer helpful organization options. 27.56&quot;W x 13.78&quot;D x 66.93&quot;H Solid acacia with MDF acacia veneer Clean lines and rich gray finish create a modern design that's perfect for any contemporary-style home. This stylish bookcase has 6 niches and 2 drawers for storing and displaying books, pictures, and other treasures. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Stevens Modern 2-Drawer Bookcase, 27.56&quot;W, Brushed Tundra Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81icwU9+crL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71sc60I8hWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71sc60I8hWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81zSrdXwLZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81zSrdXwLZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Mb9KHSR5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Mb9KHSR5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91X5yv6+0SL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91X5yv6+0SL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/718IRnf5r-L.jpg\",\"u