      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X4PTBG\",\"sku\":\"B075X4PTBG\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"leila-tufted-velvet-living-room-sofa-couch-88-w-hunter-green-b075x4ptbg\",\"name\":\"Leila Tufted Velvet Living Room Sofa Couch, 88&quot;W, Hunter Green\",\"description\":\"This item is made to order just for you 88&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 31&quot;H Solid wood frame and legs with durable fabric upholstery. The tight, fixed back and removable/reversible cushions ensure durability and comfort. Treat yourself to luxury in this striking, vintage-look sofa. With solid wood legs in a dark walnut finish, plush velvet upholstery and a low, curved tufted back, it exudes opulence. Three removable/reversible seat cushions ensure many years of use. Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Leila Tufted Velvet Living Room Sofa Couch, 88&quot;W, Hunter Green\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811qIHAHiVL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Gsg749iLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Gsg749iLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-bOOqSbUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-bOOqSbUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JmjSmCKhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JmjSmCKhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91AV+e6eo8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91AV+e6eo8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1PAJJB4dAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1PAJJB4dAL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[