        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z8TDQ6\",\"sku\":\"B075Z8TDQ6\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-rustic-reclaimed-elm-round-accent-side-end-table-16-9-w-natural-b075z8tdq6\",\"name\":\"Modern Rustic Reclaimed Elm Round Accent Side End Table, 16.9&quot;W, Natural\",\"description\":\"Touches of modern and rustic intersect in this beautifully crafted side table. Uniform, reclaimed elm wood throughout the piece gives the appearance of being carved out of a single log. Its compact size makes it ideal for placing in tight spaces. 16.9&quot;Diameter x 18.1&quot;H Entire piece is made of reclaimed elm Modern design with a touch of rustic, thanks to reclaimed elm with an unfinished look A beautifully simple table compact enough to fit small spaces No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Rustic Reclaimed Elm Round Accent Side End Table, 16.9&quot;W, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-8pjgw87L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A146C45PAXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A146C45PAXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1zU5cLOiyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1zU5cLOiyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91BIci5F7fL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91BIci5F7fL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91h1fYJTDvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91h1fYJTDvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kH0CUdDZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kH0CUdDZL.jpg\"}],\"attributes