        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X5VCPW\",\"sku\":\"B075X5VCPW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-leather-wingback-chair-32-75-w-black-b075x5vcpw\",\"name\":\"Modern Leather Wingback Chair, 32.75&quot;W, Black\",\"description\":\"More modern and angular &quot;wings&quot; and arms give the classic wingback chair a modern refresh. Top grain leather and birch wood legs give this piece lasting style and quality. Firm cushions and a matching lumbar pillow provide comfort and support. 32.75&quot;W x 36.25''D x 38.75''H Sturdy wood frame and legs; 100% top grain leather. A modern take on the mid-century wingback style with quality leather and lumbar support Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Leather Wingback Chair, 32.75&quot;W, Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81T+MPuwdGL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91omWsJqxIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91omWsJqxIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TA34RcCtL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TA34RcCtL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91V4mgklQxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91V4mgklQxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HnAHFDGTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HnAHFDGTL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"38.75\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"32.75\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"36.25\",\"label\"