        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4W5S3J\",\"sku\":\"B07B4W5S3J\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bridgewater-curved-king-headboard-82-w-curious-charcoal-b07b4w5s3j\",\"name\":\"Bridgewater Curved King Headboard, 82&quot;W, Curious Charcoal\",\"description\":\"This headboard adds classic style to any space. Hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the headboards curved silhouette. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. This item is made to order just for you Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame The headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. 82&quot;W x 4&quot;D x 56&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bridgewater Curved King Headboard, 82&quot;W, Curious Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NJQiGiNpL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OROzlRajL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OROzlRajL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A15QoYZ3OnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A15QoYZ3OnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1UnB4L8+SL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1UnB4L8+SL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sVvPZ1kPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sVvPZ1kPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1tQlYlb+qL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1tQ