        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7H9VMM\",\"sku\":\"B07B7H9VMM\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-rustic-reclaimed-fir-wood-side-end-table-16-5-w-natural-b07b7h9vmm\",\"name\":\"Rivet Rustic Reclaimed Fir Wood Side End Table, 16.5&quot;W, Natural\",\"description\":\"At first glance, one might think this side table was carved from a tree stump, and that's not far from the truth: It's made of 95% reclaimed fir wood. Swooping angled sides make it even more eye-catching at the end of a sofa or beside a bed. 16.54&quot;W x 16.54&quot;D x 23.62&quot;H Reclaimed fir wood Rustic wood combines with modern geometric shaping for a transitional look A style statement piece that's a handy side table for a living space or bedroom No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Rustic Reclaimed Fir Wood Side End Table, 16.5&quot;W, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91HkKIAcG8L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qriqY19pL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qriqY19pL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DGWE-hBBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DGWE-hBBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ZDTlkgVvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ZDTlkgVvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1d-kz+nLbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1d-kz+nLbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71p4IQWYJiL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71p4IQWYJiL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91