        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4P1X7M\",\"sku\":\"B07B4P1X7M\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"edmunds-traditional-recliner-30-w-cream-b07b4p1x7m\",\"name\":\"Edmunds Traditional Recliner, 30&quot;W, Cream\",\"description\":\"Straight lines and narrow arms combine modern touches with classic fabric, making this chair an ideal transitional style -- AND it's a recliner that doesn't look like a recliner. This piece will last through years of movies and afternoon naps. 30&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 41&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 23&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 41&quot;H; Arm Height: 23&quot;H; Front legs: 4.5&quot;H; Back legs: 4.125&quot;H Stain-resistant polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame Streamlined silhouette combines modern style with a classic fabric for a transitional look Push back reclining mechanism No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Edmunds Traditional Recliner, 30&quot;W, Cream\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/815KvTL54lL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MnwEYGJQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MnwEYGJQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BthyvgjkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BthyvgjkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VZPudY9jL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VZPudY9jL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81paqrIserL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81paqrIserL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1JCQBqgn1S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1JCQBqgn1S.jp