      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07MSWZ5WC\",\"sku\":\"B07MSWZ5WC\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-trellis-pattern-upholstered-headboard-king-77-6-inch-grey-and-cream-b07mswz5wc\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Trellis Pattern Upholstered Headboard - King, 77.6 Inch, Grey and Cream\",\"description\":\"77.6&quot;W x 3.1&quot;D x 53.7&quot;H Well-constructed plywood and metal legs This king-size headboard with foam padding covered in gray-patterned fabric is a serene addition to your bedroom decor in a classic, transitional style. Padding and sturdy construction give extra comfort and support. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Trellis Pattern Upholstered Headboard - King, 77.6 Inch, Grey and Cream\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81bFFYNyl8L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+gxmsxeuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+gxmsxeuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TGoOjduFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TGoOjduFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81CU2Dv-+lL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81CU2Dv-+lL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yNSZHKP8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yNSZHKP8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71VXkWenL2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71VXkWenL2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71qH9UQldyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71qH9UQld