      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7GYMQ9\",\"sku\":\"B07B7GYMQ9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"alan-casual-wood-media-tv-console-table-74-w-washed-navy-and-gold-b07b7gymq9\",\"name\":\"Alan Casual Wood Media TV Console Table, 74&quot;W, Washed Navy and Gold\",\"description\":\"With its washed navy finish and gold hardware, this piece will add beauty to your room and help you keep organized. Six self-close drawers offer roomy storage, and the top two outer drawers both flip up and slide out to accommodate media essentials. 74&quot;W x 18&quot;D x 28.25&quot;H Hardwood and fiberboard; metal pulls with gold finish Casual transitional style Assembly in 30-60 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Two top outer drawers both flip up and slide out to accommodate electronics\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Alan Casual Wood Media TV Console Table, 74&quot;W, Washed Navy and Gold\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81v6xrTNLBL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1R78BlLnoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1R78BlLnoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KLwSmMlqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KLwSmMlqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pPBhtKa3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pPBhtKa3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81XDb5Tb1FL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81XDb5Tb1FL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Lo1OeAKcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Lo1OeAKcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/9