        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072ZKPK7J\",\"sku\":\"B072ZKPK7J\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-modern-round-black-wood-nesting-side-end-table-15-7-w-dark-oak-b072zkpk7j\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Round Black Wood Nesting Side End Table, 15.7&quot; W, Dark Oak\",\"description\":\"Suited for small spaces, each table is sold individually so it can be used on its own or nested as a pair. Park your remote control as you watch TV or use to serve snacks at your next party - they're just what you need beside your sofa or chair. 15.7&quot; Diameter x 18.1&quot;H Solid hardwood with dark oak finish Each round modern table has a classic look to blend with traditional and modern décor. Ideal for a tight corner next to a sofa, or for serving drinks and snacks No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Round Black Wood Nesting Side End Table, 15.7&quot; W, Dark Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81YAPPy05EL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/810kZsUY-TL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/810kZsUY-TL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91P-WU-SaEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91P-WU-SaEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19REpEfY3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19REpEfY3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81bQ9UQszcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81bQ9UQszcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/810vJnKSbQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/o