        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072Q1BNCD\",\"sku\":\"B072Q1BNCD\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bradbury-chesterfield-tufted-sofa-couch-92-9-w-navy-b072q1bncd\",\"name\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Tufted Sofa Couch, 92.9&quot;W, Navy\",\"description\":\"An updated twist on a classic Chesterfield, this handsome tufted sofa is as comfortable as it is eye-catching. Its sturdy design and high performance upholstery will bring enduring style and durability to your home. Dimensions: 92.9''W x 39”D x 30.3”H Solid and engineered hardwoods; polyester/nylon fabric Timeless and functional Refreshed design of a classic; extra wide seating capacity Minimal assembly; just attach legs Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Tufted Sofa Couch, 92.9&quot;W, Navy\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DEbtppQ9L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51fXrrrl8jL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51fXrrrl8jL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51E+L4Ht7YL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51E+L4Ht7YL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51BW6hjzBwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51BW6hjzBwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1RmZWjJGIS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1RmZWjJGIS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61q4wZ20oCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61q4wZ20oCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1v9w4PU2uS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/orig