      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7GQ1J2\",\"sku\":\"B07B7GQ1J2\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-rustic-reclaimed-fir-wood-coffee-table-39-w-natural-and-gold-b07b7gq1j2\",\"name\":\"Rivet Rustic Reclaimed Fir Wood Coffee Table, 39&quot;W, Natural and Gold\",\"description\":\"Rustic, modern, glitz and glamour: this coffee table has it all. The contemporary six-sided top features a beautiful wood grain finish. The wood?? base with gold finish adds the final captivating style touch to a piece that's a true style statement. 39.4&quot;W x 39.4&quot;D x 17&quot;H; Leg Height: 3.15&quot;H Reclaimed fir wood top; painted gold base This piece is an ideal style focal point for a transitional or modern room A style statement piece that functions well as a coffee table; for interior use only No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Rustic Reclaimed Fir Wood Coffee Table, 39&quot;W, Natural and Gold\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JFDiTc2aL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919SxKhlA6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919SxKhlA6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81puAuKB1FL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81puAuKB1FL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18RLoSpsgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18RLoSpsgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71DSNpcH7-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71DSNpcH7-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rd633YJZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rd633YJZL.jpg\"},{\"