        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QCQ33GW\",\"sku\":\"B07QCQ33GW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"canton-king-button-tufted-headboard-80-w-lagoon-b07qcq33gw\",\"name\":\"Canton King Button-Tufted Headboard, 80&quot;W, Lagoon\",\"description\":\"Button tufting gives this headboard a classic, homey look that is equally at home in shabby-chic or transitional surroundings. The soft lagoon-colored upholstery offers a restful place to lean back with a good book before sinking into a good night's sleep. 80&quot;W x 3&quot;D x 62&quot;H Polypropylene fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame This bed adds modern classic style to any space. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick layer of padding for extra comfort while you rest in bed with a good book. The headboard is fully upholstered on both the front and the back. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Vacuum, brush lightly, or spot clean only.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Canton King Button-Tufted Headboard, 80&quot;W, Lagoon\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71oZPqKrrTL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811vzqaft9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811vzqaft9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71GAnd5VZUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71GAnd5VZUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918EiKY3glL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918EiKY3glL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9148NsKZY-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9148NsKZY-L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"62.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\