        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0853VKX9H\",\"sku\":\"B0853VKX9H\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"lessing-leather-glider-32-7-w-marseille-coffee-b0853vkx9h\",\"name\":\"Lessing Leather Glider, 32.7&quot;W, Marseille Coffee\",\"description\":\"This high-back tufted glider in Marseille Coffee leather is the perfect addition to any home. Built for comfort, durability, and longevity, the gliding action makes it a supremely relaxing place to sit. Features leather upholstery, metal frame, and foam-filled cushions; no assembly required Product Dimensions: 32.7&quot;W x 36.6&quot;D x 42.5&quot;H Care Instructions: Avoid moisture; wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Lessing Leather Glider, 32.7&quot;W, Marseille Coffee\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/713l1tk26tL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71EaJDcbOKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71EaJDcbOKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/714UBdQQHfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/714UBdQQHfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61KTFzwmtLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61KTFzwmtLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cmj3INOJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cmj3INOJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/714Laxg84JL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/714Laxg84JL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814lvYHk2aL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814lvYHk2aL.