        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072ZLMBDX\",\"sku\":\"B072ZLMBDX\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-district-mid-century-expandable-tv-media-console-walnut-and-white-lacquer-b072zlmbdx\",\"name\":\"Rivet District Mid-Century Expandable TV Media Console, Walnut and White Lacquer\",\"description\":\"This TV stand literally expands to fit your needs. Pushed together, it's a butcher block-like top with white painted drawers underneath. Slide the two pieces apart, and it's multi-tiered, with surfaces for a TV, gaming console, or even a snack tray! 71.7&quot;L x 13.8&quot;W x 17.05&quot;/13.1&quot;H Top, console and legs all made of engineered wood Modern with classic touches Multi-function top as well as two large drawers Easy assembly in 30 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet District Mid-Century Expandable TV Media Console, Walnut and White Lacquer\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61HwRZSWiFL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81WKo0mOwcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81WKo0mOwcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1d4IDDuobL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1d4IDDuobL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1auRAbwaIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1auRAbwaIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61uNMrseaWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61uNMrseaWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71CElhRMDkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71CElhRMDkL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":