        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4Y45N1\",\"sku\":\"B07B4Y45N1\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"prudence-tufted-king-bed-84-w-spinnsol-iron-b07b4y45n1\",\"name\":\"Prudence Tufted King Bed, 84&quot;W, Spinnsol Iron\",\"description\":\"This bed adds classic style to any space. A hand-tufted headboard adds an interesting design detail. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. This item is made to order just for you 84&quot;W x 92&quot;D x 56&quot;H; Legs: 5.5&quot;H; Footboard: 18&quot;H Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame The bed is fully upholstered on the front and back of the headboard and footboard. Cross-slat support system with adjustable levelers included. Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Prudence Tufted King Bed, 84&quot;W, Spinnsol Iron\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81YgTHhHiNL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Jc94Qpa2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Jc94Qpa2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914PZu7PBLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914PZu7PBLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81QiqmKjFhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81QiqmKjFhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91BvR07ws2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91BvR07ws2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Eoh+GuM6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Eoh+GuM6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.