        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07JW75VPK\",\"sku\":\"B07JW75VPK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-rockwood-modern-sofa-fabric-93-3-w-light-gray-b07jw75vpk\",\"name\":\"Rivet Rockwood Modern Sofa, Fabric, 93.3&quot;W, Light Gray\",\"description\":\"This sofa offers contemporary spin on mid-century style, with splayed wooden legs, wooden detail work along the bottom, and comfortable polyester upholstery. It has a tight, released back and removable cushions. Overall: 93.3&quot;W x 37.4&quot;D x 33.5&quot;H; Seat Height: 18.5&quot;H; Seat Depth: 22&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 20.5&quot;H Arm Height: 28.7&quot;H; Leg Height: 6.3&quot;H Solid-wood frame and legs with 100% polyester upholstery The tight, released back and removable cushions ensure durability and comfort. Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Rockwood Modern Sofa, Fabric, 93.3&quot;W, Light Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pp-7An7JL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A13d4Hxu86L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A13d4Hxu86L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NhFBW6kiL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NhFBW6kiL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81A8uLMbjkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81A8uLMbjkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916MsejV7SL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916MsejV7SL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VUIx4iPvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/origina