      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07L6LL293\",\"sku\":\"B07L6LL293\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"classic-solid-wood-saddle-seat-kitchen-counter-stool-with-foot-plate-24-inch-walnut-set-of-2-b07l6ll293\",\"name\":\"Classic Solid Wood Saddle-Seat Kitchen Counter Stool with Foot Plate 24 Inch, Walnut, Set of 2\",\"description\":\"Set of two saddle-seat counter stools with foot rests Sturdy solid wood construction with A-frame design and square legs Contoured saddle-seat provides even weight distribution up to 220 pounds Ideal for counter-height surfaces such as kitchen islands, work tables, home bars, and more Classic design fits in with both contemporary and traditional decor Easy to assemble; includes all necessary hardware\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Classic Solid Wood Saddle-Seat Kitchen Counter Stool with Foot Plate 24 Inch, Walnut, Set of 2\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71rw42LnAWL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71P9QaXbg7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71P9QaXbg7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Tf62BcMoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Tf62BcMoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71lbpgopUSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71lbpgopUSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61V-9QPZauL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61V-9QPZauL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/912FpJto8IL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/912FpJto8IL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71vZLtc9xML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https:/