        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QCMB9WC\",\"sku\":\"B07QCMB9WC\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-maplewood-rocker-recliner-39-w-leather-dark-roast-b07qcmb9wc\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Maplewood Rocker Recliner, 39&quot;W, Leather, Dark Roast\",\"description\":\"39&quot;W x 41&quot;D x 43&quot;H; seat height: 20&quot;H; seat depth: 23&quot;D; back cushion height: 26&quot;H; arm height: 28&quot;H Leather upholstery on a frame of kiln-dried hardwood with metal seat braces and a steel rocker base This rocker recliner has a smooth-acting mechanism. Springs provide consistent support. Inside backs have sewn-in partitions to prevent fiber fall. Relax, read, or watch television in comfort in this classic recliner. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Wipe down with a damp cloth every month or so to remove any dirt or dust buildup. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Maplewood Rocker Recliner, 39&quot;W, Leather, Dark Roast\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81sEnmDajeL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PxWlkiutL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PxWlkiutL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81eJSkwQjrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81eJSkwQjrL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814j6A52ppL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814j6A52ppL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81vjVZT9NyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81vjVZT9NyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71MneEfU8QL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7