      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QF9Y23Z\",\"sku\":\"B07QF9Y23Z\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-claremont-contemporary-media-cabinet-with-tapered-legs-39-w-pale-wood-and-white-b07qf9y23z\",\"name\":\"Rivet Claremont Contemporary Media Cabinet with Tapered Legs, 39&quot;W, Pale Wood and White\",\"description\":\"This 2-toned contemporary media cabinet comes in a natural finish with 2 self-closing doors and pulls. Tall tapered legs add visual interest, while the clean lines keep the look sleek. The sturdy construction and casual style pairs well with most decor, making this cabinet a great choice. 39&quot;W x 16&quot;D x 36&quot;H 80% MDF, 20% solid wood Vintage tapered legs add interest to the clean lines of this media cabinet. This media cabinet offers 2 self-closing doors with pulls. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Claremont Contemporary Media Cabinet with Tapered Legs, 39&quot;W, Pale Wood and White\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tEgyklXXL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61-dt3Th2aL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61-dt3Th2aL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81gIMcDsj8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81gIMcDsj8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1S-4LGjLWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1S-4LGjLWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Q34g81+bL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Q34g81+bL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XROi8yhML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googl