      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSF45BX\",\"sku\":\"B07HSF45BX\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"kristy-tufted-dining-room-kitchen-chair-set-of-2-36-5-h-dove-grey-b07hsf45bx\",\"name\":\"Kristy Tufted Dining Room Kitchen Chair, Set of 2, 36.5&quot;H, Dove Grey\",\"description\":\"Diamond-patterned button tufting, a low arm profile, and sleek curved back legs make this dining chair stand out. The sand-washed legs and dove-gray fabric evoke a sense of style and class. Solid wood frame, fabric Back legs curve out for added flair without compromising support 24&quot;D x 22&quot;W x 36.5&quot;H, 2PCS/CTN\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Kristy Tufted Dining Room Kitchen Chair, Set of 2, 36.5&quot;H, Dove Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81NWAPSCgYL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B19l3AE7PGS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B19l3AE7PGS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ruqQAcVqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ruqQAcVqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lzzn748ML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lzzn748ML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81c2tQJRoqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81c2tQJRoqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91etM5Sd1iL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91etM5Sd1iL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"36.5\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"22.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"va