      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075YPKYM1\",\"sku\":\"B075YPKYM1\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-roger-set-of-2-mid-century-modern-2-tone-accent-dining-room-kitchen-chairs-34-8-inch-height-grey-and-navy-blue-b075ypkym1\",\"name\":\"Rivet Roger Set of 2 Mid-Century Modern 2-Tone Accent Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, 34.8 Inch Height, Grey and Navy Blue\",\"description\":\"Two-tone upholstery adds a modern flair to a classic mid-century design. Light padding on navy seats and curved grey backs add comfort to pieces that can multi-task at your dining room table, as extra seating in a living room, or as desk chairs. 19.3&quot;W x 23.4&quot;D x 34.8&quot;H. Seat height is 19.1&quot;. Polyester fabric on wood frame; metal legs with black finish A multi-tasking chair easily moved from room to room; durable finish on legs. Assemble in 10 minutes or less. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Roger Set of 2 Mid-Century Modern 2-Tone Accent Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, 34.8 Inch Height, Grey and Navy Blue\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TKh7TAQbL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A151ODtlIfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A151ODtlIfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91U2boGcX5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91U2boGcX5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1PtG3RJx2S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1PtG3RJx2S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/911vo2I5Z1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/911vo2I5Z1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91