        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0728KSP2T\",\"sku\":\"B0728KSP2T\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"parson-chest-of-drawers-38-w-natural-b0728ksp2t\",\"name\":\"Parson Chest of Drawers, 38&quot;W, Natural\",\"description\":\"This is modern farmhouse at its best. Oak veneer gives a distinctive grain to this this chest of drawers, and metal pulls complete the simple design. The natural beauty of this piece provides a relaxing tone to your bedroom. 38&quot;W x 19&quot;D x 52&quot;H Solid hardwood with hand-selected oak veneer This rustic dresser has the look of natural reclaimed wood with distressed finish. Self-closing drawers are suspended on concealed ball-bearing extension glides. No assembly needed. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Parson Chest of Drawers, 38&quot;W, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aUOchg9wL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A11tOdArmhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A11tOdArmhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Er7G2hoQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Er7G2hoQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hg9LUfSJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hg9LUfSJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sx4qGO9KL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sx4qGO9KL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"52.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"19.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"38.0\",\"label\":\"inches