      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072ZK887F\",\"sku\":\"B072ZK887F\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-meeks-round-side-table-with-fabric-storage-basket-24-h-walnut-and-grey-b072zk887f\",\"name\":\"Rivet Meeks Round Side Table with Fabric Storage Basket, 24&quot;H, Walnut and Grey\",\"description\":\"This clever piece is an all-in-one side table and a great place for guests to park keys and phones. Wood top and narrow legs provide a modern feel, while the cloth basket is handy for storage. 16.7&quot;L x 16.7&quot;W x 23.6&quot;H ; Color: Grey Engineered wood with walnut veneer; fabric basket Modern yet classic to blend with your existing style Convenient side table for any room needing extra storage Easy assembly Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Meeks Round Side Table with Fabric Storage Basket, 24&quot;H, Walnut and Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mTu+O0RqL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FKM0lrh4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FKM0lrh4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ely3w9oRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ely3w9oRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813TqskO18L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813TqskO18L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A14FZ-qC9cL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A14FZ-qC9cL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1veSB4ANVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1veSB4ANVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18OLZGEtcL.j