        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X5444P\",\"sku\":\"B075X5444P\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-oversized-upholstered-square-ottoman-38-w-rain-b075x5444p\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Oversized Upholstered Square Ottoman, 38&quot;W, Rain\",\"description\":\"This oversized square ottoman works well as a coffee table or a place to rest your tired feet after a busy day. Tall exposed wood legs and welted edging on the durable upholstery give it a clean, tailored look. Available in a range of fabric options. This item is made to order just for you 38&quot;W x 38&quot;D x 16&quot;H Solid hardwood frame, wood legs with a walnut finish and 100% polyester fabric Sturdy enough for use as a coffee table or extra seating Simple leg assembly. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Oversized Upholstered Square Ottoman, 38&quot;W, Rain\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mGmA5ZPkL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A10lB188m5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A10lB188m5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lQg2X4qQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lQg2X4qQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1J7P8Y6kQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1J7P8Y6kQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hZQSkWMFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hZQSkWMFL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"16.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"38.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"len