        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HZ5RT6C\",\"sku\":\"B07HZ5RT6C\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"carrigan-casual-sofa-chaise-95-w-navy-b07hz5rt6c\",\"name\":\"Carrigan Casual Sofa Chaise, 95&quot;W, Navy\",\"description\":\"Overall: 95&quot;W x 39&quot;D x 37&quot;H; seat height: 22.5&quot;H; seat depth: 28&quot;D; seat back height: 32.5&quot;H; arm height: 27&quot;H; leg height: 3&quot;H; chaise depth: 70.5&quot;D; chaise width: 34.5&quot;W Removable slipcover in 100% cotton fabric; fully padded solid-wood frame with mortise-and-tenon construction and 8-gauge sinuous spring support system Slipcover is removable for easy cleaning and refreshing. Loose back and seat cushions are removable and reversible to ensure durability and comfort. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Carrigan Casual Sofa Chaise, 95&quot;W, Navy\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tSO-fyn5L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1B1tcz7nNS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1B1tcz7nNS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71E+Dfda3SL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71E+Dfda3SL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TsS+CzuJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TsS+CzuJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71H2aU+wHLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71H2aU+wHLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1b-m8ALHNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1b-m8ALHNL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\"