      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z8KXW7\",\"sku\":\"B075Z8KXW7\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"coastal-breeze-rustic-farmhouse-coffee-table-55-1-w-natural-and-white-b075z8kxw7\",\"name\":\"Coastal Breeze Rustic Farmhouse Coffee Table, 55.1&quot;W, Natural and White\",\"description\":\"Bring a relaxing coastal feel into your home with the simple beauty of this coffee table. A top of recycled elm is paired with a poplar wood base and given a distressed white painted finish. This piece also blends with modern farmhouse décor. 55.1”W x 31.5”D x 16.1”H Reclaimed elm top on base of poplar wood Rustic wood makes this table work with coastal or modern farmhouse style A beautifully simple table great for magazines or snack trays Assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Coastal Breeze Rustic Farmhouse Coffee Table, 55.1&quot;W, Natural and White\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81uWmxePuML.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WLc7lEWJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WLc7lEWJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Yf0nWVdwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Yf0nWVdwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1K4k9JawML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1K4k9JawML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aIaGg6ahL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aIaGg6ahL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1EO9gV4jVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1EO9gV4jVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com