      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X4N3JH\",\"sku\":\"B075X4N3JH\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"laurel-rounded-accent-chair-29-5-w-sand-b075x4n3jh\",\"name\":\"Laurel Rounded Accent Chair, 29.5&quot;W, Sand\",\"description\":\"29.5&quot;W x 30.7”D x 31.9”H Sturdy hardwood frame with linen/viscose blend upholstery Elegant, vintage style with highly durable fabric for easy care and long life Curl up with a good book in this sleek round vintage chair. The exposed rustic wood frame and neutral linen-like upholstery allow it to blend with any décor while the tufted back and removable foam cushion promise good looks and durability. No assembly required. Wipe with a soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Laurel Rounded Accent Chair, 29.5&quot;W, Sand\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DTW12ArCL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1bdznxVlbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1bdznxVlbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VBu2Tuo8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VBu2Tuo8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A12MfGisPsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A12MfGisPsL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1QQds3WqVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1QQds3WqVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1hOSRdEynS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1hOSRdEynS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"31.9\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values