        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075YP38DX\",\"sku\":\"B075YP38DX\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-tina-mid-century-modern-curved-back-kitchen-dining-chairs-25-w-x-36-h-ash-grey-set-of-2-b075yp38dx\",\"name\":\"Rivet Tina Mid-Century Modern Curved Back Kitchen Dining Chairs, 25&quot;W x 36&quot;H, Ash Grey, Set of 2\",\"description\":\"A simple clean design makes these dining chairs blend with most any décor. Fabric is durable and easy to clean, while a high, curved back is stylish and comfortable. These versatile pieces are easily moved anywhere you need extra seating. 25&quot;W x 19&quot;D x 36&quot;H Fabric is 90% polyester/10% linen on wood frame, solid hardwood base Foam padding and elastic suspension system keep backs and seats firm and springy Two chairs included Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Tina Mid-Century Modern Curved Back Kitchen Dining Chairs, 25&quot;W x 36&quot;H, Ash Grey, Set of 2\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91AeYUua+4L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wuVMeTcrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wuVMeTcrL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1-U4PzJ+7S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1-U4PzJ+7S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91FU2CNdzJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91FU2CNdzJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91F+TIoxTOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91F+TIoxTOL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91SG6CY5HML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresig