      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075ZHP9V7\",\"sku\":\"B075ZHP9V7\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"nailhead-swivel-office-chair-with-wheels-28-4-w-fawn-b075zhp9v7\",\"name\":\"Nailhead Swivel Office Chair with Wheels, 28.4&quot;W, Fawn\",\"description\":\"A tall, streamlined back with nailhead trim gives this swivel chair a strong presence in a home office. An armless design and clean lines reflect classic mid-century influence. Firm cushioning and elastic webbing make it durable and comfortable. 28.4&quot;W x 25.2&quot;D x 39.8&quot;H Durable 98% polyester/2% linen upholstery. Wood and metal swivel base; five metal wheels. 360 degree swivel. Sturdy for up to 250 lb capacity. Top-grain leather shows unique markings. Easy assembly in 15 minutes. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Nailhead Swivel Office Chair with Wheels, 28.4&quot;W, Fawn\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81W-Y+mmefL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81E0xswvgTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81E0xswvgTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1oZMR22tqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1oZMR22tqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B11UjqvExoS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B11UjqvExoS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1C5MWMDY4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1C5MWMDY4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wXQL3e2jL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wXQL3e2jL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/p