        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QJ1X2QB\",\"sku\":\"B07QJ1X2QB\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"mid-century-wishbone-dining-chair-22-4-w-black-natural-b07qj1x2qb\",\"name\":\"Mid-Century Wishbone Dining Chair, 22.4&quot;W, Black / Natural\",\"description\":\"This dining chair combines Mid-Century modern and Scandinavian-inspired styles for beautiful form, function and comfort. With a woven rattan seat, solid beech wood frame and partially open-back this piece works for the dining room or anywhere you need extra seating. 22.4&quot;W x 22.8&quot;D x 28.75&quot;H. Seat height: 18&quot; Solid beech wood frame with a woven paper rattan seat. This versatile, transitional chair blends well with traditional and modern styles. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe away dust and debris with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Mid-Century Wishbone Dining Chair, 22.4&quot;W, Black / Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711eAKQbG1L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IP0KreB1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IP0KreB1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mK4yYBTeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mK4yYBTeL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Wyu9HQUGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Wyu9HQUGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71vV2YUBbzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71vV2YUBbzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/716-MT1-QOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/716-MT1-QOL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\"