    "dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Data": {
      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B084RZVHD2\",\"sku\":\"B084RZVHD2\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-erikson-vegan-leather-woven-dining-chair-set-of-2-18-w-beige-b084rzvhd2\",\"name\":\"Rivet Erikson Vegan Leather Woven Dining Chair, Set of 2, 18&quot;W, Beige\",\"description\":\"The retro feel of this dining room chair adds a hint of whimsy to your decor. The rattan backrest and woven vegan-leather seat contribute textural interest while also offering a comfortable place to sit, eat, and converse with friends and family. 18&quot;W x 21.5&quot;D x 35.75&quot;H; seat height: 18.5&quot;H; seat depth: 17&quot;D; seat back height: 17.5&quot;H; leg height: 15&quot;H The solid wood frame and rattan backrest are strong and durable, while the seat is woven from strips of vegan leather. As stylish as it is functional, the woven seat of this chair is exceptionally comfortable. The woven rattan back finds a stylish echo in the woven strips of vegan leather that form the seat of this striking wood-framed chair. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Erikson Vegan Leather Woven Dining Chair, Set of 2, 18&quot;W, Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71QRgEkmaeL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EE5lKraTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EE5lKraTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/8150LN4jysL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/8150LN4jysL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71qwpasTXnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71qwpasTXnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Szli8-rrL.jpg\",