      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7DKRW4\",\"sku\":\"B07B7DKRW4\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"anne-farmhouse-french-wood-desk-62-w-blue-b07b7dkrw4\",\"name\":\"Anne Farmhouse French Wood Desk, 62&quot;W, Blue\",\"description\":\"Bring a breezy French cottage look to your office with this desk. The washed navy finish gives it a vintage look, while the three drawers provide room for a tablet computer, pens and paper. Antiqued brass knobs add the perfect finishing touch. 28&quot;L x 62&quot;W x 30&quot;H Solid poplar and engineered hardwoods; metal knobs with antique finish A French country look that will add a nice vibe to your traditional or farmhouse décor The interior of each drawer has velvet-lined bottom Assembly in an hour or less; just screw legs to base Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Anne Farmhouse French Wood Desk, 62&quot;W, Blue\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81CGvUxI2qL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/819NqOc9omL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/819NqOc9omL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1R78BlLnoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1R78BlLnoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wZc-3fU-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wZc-3fU-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/8177RMVwYnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/8177RMVwYnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915fqhq4a6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915fqhq4a6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/8