      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0853VFWYX\",\"sku\":\"B0853VFWYX\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"lessing-tufted-upholstered-glider-32-7-w-cadet-blue-b0853vfwyx\",\"name\":\"Lessing Tufted Upholstered Glider, 32.7&quot;W, Cadet Blue\",\"description\":\"This high-back tufted glider in Cadet Blue fabric is the perfect addition to any home. Built for comfort, durability, and longevity, the gliding action makes it a supremely relaxing place to sit. Features stain-resistant fabric, metal frame, and foam-filled cushions; no assembly required Product Dimensions: 32.7&quot;W x 36.6&quot;D x 42.5&quot;H Care Instructions: Avoid moisture; wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Lessing Tufted Upholstered Glider, 32.7&quot;W, Cadet Blue\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817x8e1+x+L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818nyTEIuEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818nyTEIuEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71zovPf64wL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71zovPf64wL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81OiK5yIeyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81OiK5yIeyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1eO5uc6EEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1eO5uc6EEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81dAmVv8BjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81dAmVv8BjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/8111iffawwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/