      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QJLJRWW\",\"sku\":\"B07QJLJRWW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-campbell-mid-century-media-console-with-tapered-legs-20-w-pale-wood-and-white-b07qjljrww\",\"name\":\"Rivet Campbell Mid-Century Media Console with Tapered Legs, 20&quot;W, Pale Wood and White\",\"description\":\"Tall tapered legs add visual interest to this casual, 2-toned media console with a vintage flair that fits well in small spaces. The pull drawer provides necessary media storage for those on the go, while the engineered and solid wood construction offer a lasting durability. 20&quot;W x 16&quot;D x 22&quot;H 80% MDF, 20% solid wood Vintage tapered legs add interest to the clean lines of this console. A single drawer provides a needed storage solution. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Campbell Mid-Century Media Console with Tapered Legs, 20&quot;W, Pale Wood and White\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lz66td1wL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71CtIo70DjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71CtIo70DjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pbD8pIt4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pbD8pIt4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91caqofbryL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91caqofbryL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/610IW+GJWwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/610IW+GJWwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1dTmaZ3eTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/or