      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B08568VWSK\",\"sku\":\"B08568VWSK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-vern-contemporary-round-back-swivel-dining-chair-with-arms-23-w-graphite-b08568vwsk\",\"name\":\"Rivet Vern Contemporary Round Back Swivel Dining Chair with Arms, 23&quot;W, Graphite\",\"description\":\"This beautiful grey dining chair combines sophisticated contemporary style with timeless comfort and conversation-friendly swivel motion. A solid wood frame supports a cushioned seat with a full seat back. Overall: 24&quot;D x 23&quot;W x 32&quot;H. Seat height: 18.5&quot;, arm height: 23.6&quot; Fabric upholstery and foam padding on a solid wood frame with swivel mechanism. Supreme comfort and convenience meets contemporary style. Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Vern Contemporary Round Back Swivel Dining Chair with Arms, 23&quot;W, Graphite\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71GCkoZ7d+L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71EB9QRGPGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71EB9QRGPGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71K2h0k5r6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71K2h0k5r6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1zb1mbSWDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1zb1mbSWDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ZL93KPrAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ZL93KPrAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61etEe6XFRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61etEe6XFRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https: