        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4GQ7M9\",\"sku\":\"B07B4GQ7M9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"andover-sofa-couch-90-w-charcoal-leather-b07b4gq7m9\",\"name\":\"Andover Sofa Couch, 90&quot;W, Charcoal Leather\",\"description\":\"Complete your living space with this stylish sofa. With its charcoal-colored upholstery, this sofa is an ideal accent for transitional-style home decor. The solid-wood frame enhances durability and extends this sofa’s life. Overall: 90&quot;W x 38&quot;D x 33&quot;H; seat height: 21&quot;H; seat depth: 25&quot;D; seat back height: 28&quot;H; arm height: 28&quot;H; leg height: 4.25&quot;H Sturdy wood frame with rich top-grain leather upholstery Transitional style blends well with a variety of home-decor themes. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Andover Sofa Couch, 90&quot;W, Charcoal Leather\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71kzOG9GTuL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71QokMVWBqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71QokMVWBqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/819PLVB7QPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/819PLVB7QPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71wgQ2gzBKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71wgQ2gzBKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1gWtCwDtnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1gWtCwDtnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PkIrpUkhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PkIrpUkhL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"