        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072ZRPFJL\",\"sku\":\"B072ZRPFJL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-six-compartment-tv-media-console-walnut-b072zrpfjl\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Six-Compartment TV Media Console, Walnut\",\"description\":\"Enjoy years of watching TV on this modern stand. The top is long enough for a wide screen, and six handy compartments will store your other equipment. The walnut veneer provides a classic touch that allows this piece to blend with existing styles. 59&quot;L x 13.8&quot;W x 15.75&quot;H Engineered wood with walnut veneer Modern yet understated enough to blend with other styles Three open compartments and three drawers allow ample storage Easy assembly and care Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Six-Compartment TV Media Console, Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Y63Ikx+GL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71s3vEI+u5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71s3vEI+u5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Mbu5uFRML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Mbu5uFRML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91D4IBcoE4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91D4IBcoE4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mQjvk3lmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mQjvk3lmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jDdiLpjNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jDdiLpjNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71XvglJDLOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis