        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B08568X258\",\"sku\":\"B08568X258\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-decatur-modern-faux-leather-kitchen-bar-stool-41-h-black-b08568x258\",\"name\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Faux Leather Kitchen Bar Stool, 41&quot;H, Black\",\"description\":\"This beautiful modern barstool features a bold squared-off design for both the seat and legs. The metal frame, supported by an H-spreader bar encompasses a plush, backed, armless seat upholstered in durable faux leather. Overall: 22&quot;D x 18&quot;W x 41&quot;H. Seat height: 30&quot; Solid wooden frame and black metal legs combine for maximum style and support Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Arrives fully assembled. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Faux Leather Kitchen Bar Stool, 41&quot;H, Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/619NSdMOcBL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61iGYI-7szL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61iGYI-7szL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61c0TUoeGhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61c0TUoeGhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61xzmugX9rL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61xzmugX9rL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71D8y7L6rHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71D8y7L6rHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/21/21ByivCEGPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/21/21ByivCEGPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81O12IyWXQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://s