        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07M66SYGT\",\"sku\":\"B07M66SYGT\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"classic-adjustable-swivel-office-desk-chair-with-casters-and-twill-fabric-beige-b07m66sygt\",\"name\":\"Classic, Adjustable, Swivel Office Desk Chair with Casters and Twill Fabric, Beige\",\"description\":\"360 degree swiveling office chair for home or business use Set on a sturdy 5-point stainless steel base with chrome finish and rolling caster wheels Twill upholstery provides a classic look and long-lasting durability Foam cushioning for ergonomic comfort and support Adjustable lever allows you to set the chair to your ideal height, reducing posture-related strain BIFMA Certified Chair Dimensions: 25.8 x 23.6 x 32.3 inches; easy to assemble; hardware included\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Classic, Adjustable, Swivel Office Desk Chair with Casters and Twill Fabric, Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81r+fH50XRL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cYyT2QryL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cYyT2QryL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81l3bgDZZmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81l3bgDZZmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Eut+5Qc8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Eut+5Qc8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61XVxL7gl2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61XVxL7gl2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81uRC3aJcFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81uRC3aJcFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915hj+6pq5L.