      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0857JWWWS\",\"sku\":\"B0857JWWWS\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"wishbone-counter-height-barstool-35-5-h-natural-b0857jwwws\",\"name\":\"Wishbone Counter-Height Barstool, 35.5&quot;H, Natural\",\"description\":\"This stool is simple, unassuming, and traditional, and it also can blend with a variety of decor, whether it sits in your dining area, kitchen, living room, or den. What won't change is its comfort and usefulness. 22.4&quot;W x 22.8&quot;D x 35.5&quot;H Rubberwood legs with a woven paper-rope seat This stool's soft, handwoven rattan seat is comfortable, while the rubberwood construction can endure plenty of use near any countertop. The traditional style and natural finish make this stool matchable wherever you choose to place it. No assembly required Using a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the grain. Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Wishbone Counter-Height Barstool, 35.5&quot;H, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ZLjifXZVL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61y21jpXJ0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61y21jpXJ0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+60kDc2BL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+60kDc2BL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71U87KEj93L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71U87KEj93L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81WYvsZXvDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81WYvsZXvDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71qe4+jabuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original