        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07BWK59H7\",\"sku\":\"B07BWK59H7\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"andover-leather-left-facing-u-shaped-sectional-134-w-charcoal-b07bwk59h7\",\"name\":\"Andover Leather Left-Facing U-Shaped Sectional, 134&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"description\":\"Complete your living space with this stylish sectional. With its charcoal-colored upholstery, this sectional is an ideal accent for transitional-style home decor. The solid-wood frame enhances durability and extends this sectional’s life.. Overall: 134&quot;W x 96&quot;D x 33&quot;H; seat height: 21&quot;H; seat depth: 25&quot;D; seat back height: 28&quot;H; arm height: 28&quot;H; leg height: 4.25&quot;H; chaise depth: 23&quot;D; chaise width: 40&quot;W Sturdy wood frame with rich top-grain leather upholstery Transitional style blends well with a variety of home-decor themes. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Andover Leather Left-Facing U-Shaped Sectional, 134&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71XNQTkarNL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1t2OLbjiZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1t2OLbjiZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71zGlteB43L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71zGlteB43L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71S-y+0YPXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71S-y+0YPXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ni1W2xOvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ni1W2xOvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71meYjWuuA