      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0857JXC9D\",\"sku\":\"B0857JXC9D\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"beech-wishbone-counter-height-barstool-42-2-h-black-and-natural-b0857jxc9d\",\"name\":\"Beech Wishbone Counter-Height Barstool, 42.2&quot;H, Black and Natural\",\"description\":\"The graceful curves of this black- and natural-colored beech barstool mask its everyday durability. It's light, portable, and perfect for any place in the house where there's a countertop. The soft, comfortable woven paper-rope seat is 100% natural. 22.4&quot;W x 22.8&quot;D x 42.2&quot;H Beech frame with a woven seat The sturdy beech frame will stand the test of time, while the soft woven paper-rope seat is easy to sink into. Simple but fashionable, this black- and natural-colored wishbone-style curved design adds sophistication to any counter area. No assembly required Using a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the grain. Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Beech Wishbone Counter-Height Barstool, 42.2&quot;H, Black and Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61U9TDNrikL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71kk1X1lD6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71kk1X1lD6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61LIa2IX4IL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61LIa2IX4IL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mh4IRMQPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mh4IRMQPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51UyAaIjzgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51UyAaIjzgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61KApDIUI+L.jpg\",\