        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QC85ZKD\",\"sku\":\"B07QC85ZKD\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-marble-patterned-side-table-17-w-b07qc85zkd\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Marble-Patterned Side Table, 17&quot;W\",\"description\":\"The marble pattern that tops this side table will provide a touch of old-fashioned elegance wherever you place it. Sleek black legs add a modern, industrial air to the piece, truly making it the best of old and new. Solid metal construction makes this table a sturdy place for decorations or belongings. 17&quot;W x 17&quot;D x 21&quot;H Artificial marble and metal The marble-patterned top adds a touch of elegance. Metal legs provide stability. No assembly required Clean with a soft cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Marble-Patterned Side Table, 17&quot;W\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816CKcG6K0L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-PSj4-KDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-PSj4-KDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FY8YF1JPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FY8YF1JPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81gk0JargKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81gk0JargKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hkmk9oiYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hkmk9oiYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xa1eXvmzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xa1eXvmzL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"18.5\",\"label\":\"inches\"