      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z96L53\",\"sku\":\"B075Z96L53\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"coastal-breeze-accent-side-end-table-27-5-w-natural-and-white-b075z96l53\",\"name\":\"Coastal Breeze Accent Side End Table, 27.5&quot;W, Natural and White\",\"description\":\"Bring a relaxing coastal feel into your home with the simple beauty of this side table. A top of recycled elm is paired with a poplar wood base and given a distressed white painted finish. This piece also blends with modern farmhouse décor. 27.5&quot;W x 27.5&quot;D x 20&quot;H Reclaimed elm top on base of poplar wood Rustic wood makes this table work with coastal or modern farmhouse style A beautifully simple table perfect for placing beside a chair or sofa No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Coastal Breeze Accent Side End Table, 27.5&quot;W, Natural and White\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TivnKz+oL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91yzHtpHBTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91yzHtpHBTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81LQF2hMlGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81LQF2hMlGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VswDtuUVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VswDtuUVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1w0vCN6sIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1w0vCN6sIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rEu9lF6lL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rEu9lF6lL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"lab