      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075QDQXW1\",\"sku\":\"B075QDQXW1\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"nori-tufted-storage-bench-58-l-natural-b075qdqxw1\",\"name\":\"Nori Tufted Storage Bench, 58&quot;L, Natural\",\"description\":\"With a roomy interior and slow-close hinges, this upholstered storage bench is as functional as it is stylish. Lovely tufted fabric on the top offers a traditional look, giving your blankets and off-season clothes a stylish new home. 58&quot;L x 18&quot;W x 18&quot;H 100 polyester fabric on a hardwood frame Traditional style with neutral color fabric, blending with transitional and modern décor A stylish piece for storing blankets or clothes; slow-close hinges for safe closure No assembly needed. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Nori Tufted Storage Bench, 58&quot;L, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KfZGFsobL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wNTWNcFqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wNTWNcFqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1gcFWSUf1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1gcFWSUf1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KOxNSzvCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KOxNSzvCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1gOBVu2gES.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1gOBVu2gES.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1pKNUay3mL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1pKNUay3mL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"18.0\",\"la