      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07JD7RFRN\",\"sku\":\"B07JD7RFRN\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-amelia-modern-94-sofa-fabric-light-gray-b07jd7rfrn\",\"name\":\"Rivet Amelia Modern 94&quot; Sofa, Fabric, Light Gray\",\"description\":\"Every inch of this light-gray sofa says “comfort,” with its smooth polyester upholstery and squishable cushions. What’s more, the solid-wood frame and removable/reversible cushions make this sofa a durable choice for your living room. Overall: 93.7&quot;W x 46.5&quot;D x 34.6&quot;H; Seat Height: 19.3&quot;H; Seat Depth: 29.9&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 23.2&quot;H; Arm Height: 25.2&quot;H; Leg Height: 2&quot;H Solid-wood frame and legs with 100% polyester upholstery The tight, released back and removable/reversible cushions ensure durability and comfort. Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Amelia Modern 94&quot; Sofa, Fabric, Light Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91g-oZ+EqeL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o8SfNdG9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o8SfNdG9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lr2++mTAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lr2++mTAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1eCNsbxZoS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1eCNsbxZoS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Y05gLpxaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Y05gLpxaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91wIRgZgFiL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-p