        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B084MXXPK9\",\"sku\":\"B084MXXPK9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-farmhouse-solid-wood-nightstand-with-2-drawers-25-5-w-natural-finish-b084mxxpk9\",\"name\":\"Modern Farmhouse Solid Wood Nightstand with 2 Drawers, 25.5&quot;W, Natural Finish\",\"description\":\"This exceptionally durable nightstand is made of solid wood and has 2 convenient drawers. It has a natural finish that lets the beauty of the wood shine through. Made from recycled pine, this rustic nightstand goes well with farmhouse or contemporary decor. 25.5&quot;W x 17.75&quot;D x 23.5&quot;H; leg height: 7.75&quot;H Recycled pine; sturdy metal hardware Ball bearing metal glides on 2 drawers allow for ease of use. Made of recycled pine, each nightstand is unique and slightly different from the next. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Farmhouse Solid Wood Nightstand with 2 Drawers, 25.5&quot;W, Natural Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pUUjiVVQL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ZENx8xzBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ZENx8xzBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-V75LoZIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-V75LoZIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813SZIT+TDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813SZIT+TDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81l+TBU9lLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81l+TBU9lLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81VQXZ6IxRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.goog