      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QJXK4CD\",\"sku\":\"B07QJXK4CD\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-blanchard-living-room-chair-with-swivel-base-40-h-leather-cognac-b07qjxk4cd\",\"name\":\"Rivet Blanchard Living Room Chair with Swivel Base, 40&quot;H, Leather, Cognac\",\"description\":\"This contemporary high-backed living room chair offers the ease of conversation with a gunmetal-hued swivel base. The 100% leather upholstery in cognac adds a modern elegance to any room while also providing excellent durability, helping the chair to always look like new. 28&quot;W x 35&quot;D x 40&quot;H 100% leather with metal frame and swivel base High back with swivel base The high back and leather upholstery of this chair add a contemporary look to any room. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Blanchard Living Room Chair with Swivel Base, 40&quot;H, Leather, Cognac\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81A0FnPiHRL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+lUZ0R+0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+lUZ0R+0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813Kb57Qb+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813Kb57Qb+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WmVQsgmdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WmVQsgmdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81C5AZjahjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81C5AZjahjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81prBY0E-LL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/