      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07BWK7K1Z\",\"sku\":\"B07BWK7K1Z\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"hoffman-down-filled-performance-fabric-ottoman-41-w-dark-grey-tweed-b07bwk7k1z\",\"name\":\"Hoffman Down-Filled Performance Fabric Ottoman, 41&quot; W, Dark Grey Tweed\",\"description\":\"Whatever you need to accommodate kids, pets, spills and every other facet of a busy life, this ottoman has it all: Plush comfort, stain-resistant fabric, durable construction, and a timeless look to blend with your existing styles. 27.5&quot;W x 40.5&quot;D x 18.5&quot;H Solid hardwood frame with Revolution Performance Fabric Modern casual Exceptional comfort with high performance polypropylene fabric for heavy wear. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Hoffman Down-Filled Performance Fabric Ottoman, 41&quot; W, Dark Grey Tweed\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1r2Wok1D-L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91IInLn9LjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91IInLn9LjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1JATvPSNFS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1JATvPSNFS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1HZ8Ch6uuS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1HZ8Ch6uuS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1EIjwiHUdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1EIjwiHUdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918-Zrsq92L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918-Zrsq92L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lG2DC2qhL.jpg\"