        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B78LX2J\",\"sku\":\"B07B78LX2J\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"hughes-casual-upholstered-dining-room-kitchen-chairs-set-of-2-grey-wood-b07b78lx2j\",\"name\":\"Hughes Casual Upholstered Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, Set of 2, Grey, Wood\",\"description\":\"Simple lines, traditional fabric and an armless design make this chair an attractive yet practical choice for modern, transitional or farmhouse décor. Performance fabric and solid construction will enable them to last through years of family meals. 24&quot;L x 19&quot;W x 39&quot;H Polyester performance fabric on hardwood frame; hardwood legs A transitional style that can blend with most any décor Performance fabric makes it easy to care for; quality construction makes it last Assembly in 30 mintues or less; bolt on back and legs Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Hughes Casual Upholstered Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, Set of 2, Grey, Wood\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91c8qAlyJuL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B18j-IPDptS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B18j-IPDptS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GYvq9PtRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GYvq9PtRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81eftdG6s5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81eftdG6s5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91f1iaEmp9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91f1iaEmp9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Rid0RC-gL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Rid0RC-gL.jpg\