        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QD9BBRW\",\"sku\":\"B07QD9BBRW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"mid-century-round-coffee-table-38-98-diameter-fir-and-natural-b07qd9bbrw\",\"name\":\"Mid-Century Round Coffee Table, 38.98&quot; Diameter, Fir and Natural\",\"description\":\"This round, mid-century, solid fir coffee table touts a raised edge over 3 beautiful legs, reminiscent of a serving tray. A vintage design in a natural finish fits well with most decor, including farmhouse, rustic, and traditional. The solid construction offers added durability. 38.98“ diameter x 18.5&quot;H Solid fir A true mid-century flair, this solid fir round coffee table offers raised sides on top of 3 curved legs and mirrors a serving tray. This mid-century coffee table with a vintage flair offers the durability that comes from a solid construction. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Wipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Mid-Century Round Coffee Table, 38.98&quot; Diameter, Fir and Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81SBufVbvSL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81hHAvQT47L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81hHAvQT47L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81b-zyFn-TL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81b-zyFn-TL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813KEAl198L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813KEAl198L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1K3j2+ZIkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1K3j2+ZIkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91F2NAjzRsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"