        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075YP3BCY\",\"sku\":\"B075YP3BCY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-industrial-modern-4-post-rolling-bar-cart-table-with-wheels-25-2-w-natural-black-wood-metal-b075yp3bcy\",\"name\":\"Rivet Industrial Modern 4-Post Rolling Bar Cart Table with Wheels, 25.2&quot;W, Natural, Black, Wood, Metal\",\"description\":\"25.2&quot;W X 17.7&quot;D X31.72&quot;H Solid rubber wood shelves. Metal frame and casters have black finish. Two of the four rotating wheels lock to park the cart just where you want it Assembly is required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Two wooden shelves are anchored by curved metal posts for a modern industrial style. Fill with your favorite beverages and you're ready to host friends for a night of fun.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Industrial Modern 4-Post Rolling Bar Cart Table with Wheels, 25.2&quot;W, Natural, Black, Wood, Metal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71r-RxuZu3L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81AesMO2wsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81AesMO2wsL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71uBd7KgaIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71uBd7KgaIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71yGA9ZhucL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71yGA9ZhucL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71YYAMTlIQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71YYAMTlIQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-JCDmW4yL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-JCDmW4yL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.google