        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07SRCS5VL\",\"sku\":\"B07SRCS5VL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"solimo-betty-queen-size-engineered-wood-bed-espresso-finish-b07srcs5vl\",\"name\":\"Solimo Betty Queen Size Engineered Wood Bed (Espresso Finish)\",\"description\":\"Product Dimensions: Length (205 cm), Width (160 cm), Height (80 cm) Elegant design with curvilinear edges and premium finish made with European standard particle board that is resistant to stains and humidity Passed more than 20 tests to ensure quality and safety; Free from burrs & sharp edges for enhanced safety Underwent durability testing for 100kgs over 10,000 cycles Subjected to rigorous bed-edge testing for 100kgs and 1,000 cycles Made free from toxins or harmful chemicals to promise safe usage Warranty: 3-year warranty on manufacturing defects Do not move or push without dismantling. Avoid using wet cloth to wipe furniture for better care\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Solimo Betty Queen Size Engineered Wood Bed (Espresso Finish)\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71NaO4svX+L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/6145lciDEDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/6145lciDEDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61ah7QqmDGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61ah7QqmDGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71SB2QXvnnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71SB2QXvnnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711bE27BbhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711bE27BbhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61INdQOgaoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-p