        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X4N3FM\",\"sku\":\"B075X4N3FM\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-aiden-tufted-mid-century-modern-velvet-bench-seat-sofa-couch-86-6-w-otter-grey-b075x4n3fm\",\"name\":\"Rivet Aiden Tufted Mid-Century Modern Velvet Bench Seat Sofa Couch, 86.6&quot;W, Otter Grey\",\"description\":\"This sleek, Mid-century inspired velvet sofa is designed to impress. A long fixed bench seat cushion, two back cushions, and tapered wood legs provide just the right mix of sophistication with a contemporary edge. 86.6&quot;W x 36.2”D x 30.3”H 100% polyester; solid hardwood frame; tapered wood legs Removable and reversible back seat cushions for easy cleaning Simple leg assembly. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Aiden Tufted Mid-Century Modern Velvet Bench Seat Sofa Couch, 86.6&quot;W, Otter Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81zyONlBOCL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Jk-rADV1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Jk-rADV1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18VQD6WNML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18VQD6WNML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81B1yPr1WvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81B1yPr1WvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914jKSQcsEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914jKSQcsEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81PEv2QoRkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81PEv2QoRkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A