      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z8627Z\",\"sku\":\"B075Z8627Z\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"larson-industrial-wood-metal-side-end-table-27-w-walnut-b075z8627z\",\"name\":\"Larson Industrial Wood & Metal Side End Table, 27&quot;W, Walnut\",\"description\":\"This side table with a solid pine wood top and shelf has a natural distressed finish, while the metal legs and trim have a darker brown matte finish. The lower shelf provides ever-important space to store magazines, books, or your laptop. 27&quot;W x 20&quot;W x 24&quot;H Solid pine wood tops and shelves with walnut finish; metal legs Industrial and rustic touches allow this table to blend with many styles. Convenient lower shelf for extra storage Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Larson Industrial Wood & Metal Side End Table, 27&quot;W, Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Zr9QvZzOL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817UKd9u7oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817UKd9u7oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yiYGinz5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yiYGinz5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JHjCbYVWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JHjCbYVWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aqd3WKBML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aqd3WKBML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1f7OnN2Y7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1f7OnN2Y7L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\"