        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QD6TXXY\",\"sku\":\"B07QD6TXXY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-jaxon-rustic-round-side-table-16-diameter-natural-and-black-b07qd6txxy\",\"name\":\"Rivet Jaxon Rustic Round Side Table, 16&quot; Diameter, Natural and Black\",\"description\":\"Natural wood with knots, splits, color variations, repair patches, and other imperfections sits within a black metal base with 3 legs. The base forms a lip around the wood top, which creates a visual appeal and keeps things from rolling off the edge. This piece pairs well with modern decor. 16&quot; diameter x 27&quot;H Wood and metal This rustic tabletop touts knots, splits, repair patches, and natural imperfections and rests in a black metal base with 3 legs. The piece can be used as a side table or an accent table. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Jaxon Rustic Round Side Table, 16&quot; Diameter, Natural and Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71zFGPceGHL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Ou6mL68RL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Ou6mL68RL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cp939RKlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cp939RKlL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9132MCyTeNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9132MCyTeNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71VNSg00bdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71VNSg00bdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71pPv6Pw5QL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.g