        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B51H7B1\",\"sku\":\"B07B51H7B1\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-fisher-rustic-wood-queen-bed-frame-platform-with-headboard-63-w-reclaimed-look-rustic-wood-b07b51h7b1\",\"name\":\"Rivet Fisher Rustic Wood Queen Bed Frame Platform with Headboard, 63&quot;W, Reclaimed-Look Rustic Wood\",\"description\":\"63.25&quot;W x 86&quot;D x 51&quot;H Raise rails to use under-bed storage drawers without boxspring, or lower to use boxspring Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour with two people Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty Beautiful multi-toned wood planks on the headboard and footboard resemble rustic, reclaimed wood and could also blend with a coastal-theme decor. Side rails can be adjusted to accommodate optional under-bed storage drawers.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Fisher Rustic Wood Queen Bed Frame Platform with Headboard, 63&quot;W, Reclaimed-Look Rustic Wood\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hAq0Y2L+L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1c7pgeJnpL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1c7pgeJnpL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cWSayDjUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cWSayDjUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91UdKTzUs+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91UdKTzUs+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91yUKp0CbjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91yUKp0CbjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91FnJVTTf8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91FnJVTTf8L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Hei