      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7GYMQL\",\"sku\":\"B07B7GYMQL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-reclaimed-fir-wood-storage-coffee-table-43-w-natural-and-black-b07b7gymql\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Reclaimed Fir Wood Storage Coffee Table, 43&quot;W, Natural and Black\",\"description\":\"This beautifully simple rustic coffee table has extra function as storage. Just open the top to find convenient space for magazines, remotes and more. Metal legs add a modern touch to a piece ready to blend with any style room. 43.3&quot;W x 25.6&quot;D x 15.7&quot;H; Leg Height: 7.87&quot;H Reclaimed fir wood, metal legs Rustic, modern and industrial styles combine in a piece that will blend with most any room Interior storage space conceals magazines and remotes; for interior use only No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Reclaimed Fir Wood Storage Coffee Table, 43&quot;W, Natural and Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816MptJMiPL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ceZvjEhoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ceZvjEhoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CbJAcD67L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CbJAcD67L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MlLWkD26L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MlLWkD26L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jYqE7BFHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jYqE7BFHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aJrWunCbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aJrWunCbL.jpg\"}