        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSDWZ2L\",\"sku\":\"B07HSDWZ2L\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"wickstrom-upholstered-counter-height-bar-stool-with-arms-37-h-caribbean-sand-beige-b07hsdwz2l\",\"name\":\"Wickstrom Upholstered Counter-Height Bar Stool with Arms, 37&quot;H, Caribbean Sand Beige\",\"description\":\"This stylish counter-height barstool features a classic wingback design, complete with armrests and a curved seatback for all-around comfort. The plush seat and cushioned frame are upholstered in gorgeous neutral fabric, and dark wood legs complete the elegant appearance. Overall: 23&quot;D x 23&quot;W x 37&quot;H Solid wood frame and legs with metal kickplate Curved back legs add a flair of style without compromising strength Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Wickstrom Upholstered Counter-Height Bar Stool with Arms, 37&quot;H, Caribbean Sand Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mx9YW54sL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pPe3HYO3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pPe3HYO3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81bzNOYbqlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81bzNOYbqlL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yX6KEL3TL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yX6KEL3TL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yz262zBGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yz262zBGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OedGaQy8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OedGaQy8L.jpg\"}],\"attribut