        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07P5LP5MC\",\"sku\":\"B07P5LP5MC\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"lauren-down-filled-oversized-leather-living-room-accent-armchair-with-hardwood-frame-46-w-dark-brown-b07p5lp5mc\",\"name\":\"Lauren Down-Filled Oversized Leather Living Room Accent Armchair with Hardwood Frame, 46&quot;W, Dark Brown\",\"description\":\"Dimensions: 46&quot;W x 45&quot;D x 37&quot;H Soft down-filled cushions on a frame of solid hardwood mean this armchair offers plush support and security. Neutral dark-brown leather upholstery allows this piece to blend into your existing color scheme with ease. Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric made of 98% polyester, 2% nylon; down-filled seat and back cushions Removable and reversible seat cushion. Classic design will fit any space. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Lauren Down-Filled Oversized Leather Living Room Accent Armchair with Hardwood Frame, 46&quot;W, Dark Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Vu0GjSMAL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ep6jmHVSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ep6jmHVSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91x5u9LwmOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91x5u9LwmOL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91YLgxH0KYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91YLgxH0KYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NyOd9BtEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NyOd9BtEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/911Y3ZBy