      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QC861L7\",\"sku\":\"B07QC861L7\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-campbell-mid-century-coffee-table-with-tapered-legs-47-w-pale-wood-and-white-b07qc861l7\",\"name\":\"Rivet Campbell Mid-Century Coffee Table with Tapered Legs, 47&quot;W, Pale Wood and White\",\"description\":\"Tall tapered legs add visual interest to this casual, 2-toned coffee table with a vintage flair that fits well in small spaces. The pull drawer provides necessary storage for those on the go, while the engineered and solid wood construction offer a lasting durability. 51.2&quot;W x 24&quot;D x 17&quot;H 80% MDF, 20% solid wood Vintage tapered legs add interest to the clean lines of this coffee table. A single drawer provides a needed storage solution. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Campbell Mid-Century Coffee Table with Tapered Legs, 47&quot;W, Pale Wood and White\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71wIIX0tLaL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71vhf5DlpPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71vhf5DlpPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91LaEHvhbUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91LaEHvhbUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71RsgsULK8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71RsgsULK8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hlf13EqsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hlf13EqsL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61-8dx+xzqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/origi