        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QFP4WL1\",\"sku\":\"B07QFP4WL1\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-maplewood-rocker-recliner-39-w-leather-amber-b07qfp4wl1\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Maplewood Rocker Recliner, 39&quot;W, Leather, Amber\",\"description\":\"39&quot;W x 41&quot;D x 43&quot;H; seat height: 20&quot;H; seat depth: 23&quot;D; back cushion height: 26&quot;H; arm height: 28&quot;H Leather upholstery on a frame of kiln-dried hardwood with metal seat braces and a steel rocker base This rocker recliner has a smooth-acting mechanism. Springs provide consistent support. Inside backs have sewn-in partitions to prevent fiber fall. The leather upholstery and smooth reclining action make this chair as practical as it is beautiful. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Wipe down with a damp cloth every month or so to remove any dirt or dust buildup. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Maplewood Rocker Recliner, 39&quot;W, Leather, Amber\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81l6fVZb7ML.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cadxPKnBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cadxPKnBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nKE+YT4lL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nKE+YT4lL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91HpHGfx3jL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91HpHGfx3jL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KLps95T1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KLps95T1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9169ooRiOaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-image