        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X33SSW\",\"sku\":\"B075X33SSW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"elmore-pillow-top-armless-accent-chair-24-w-beige-b075x33ssw\",\"name\":\"Elmore Pillow-Top Armless Accent Chair, 24&quot;W, Beige\",\"description\":\"This armless pillow-top chair will add comfort and elegance to any modern or classic style space. Assembled in the U.S., it features a sturdy wood frame, reversible seat and back cushions. Metal casters on the solid wood legs make it easy to move. This item is made to order just for you 24&quot;W x 33&quot;D x 35&quot;H Sturdy wood frame and legs; 100% cotton fabric. A transitional piece that will blend with most any décor Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Elmore Pillow-Top Armless Accent Chair, 24&quot;W, Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ZPxPDUgtL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91fZLYo2jlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91fZLYo2jlL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tcJBIs7iL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tcJBIs7iL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81su9e2PaHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81su9e2PaHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91h0sZj4h7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91h0sZj4h7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1O8bHNcvbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1O8bHNcvbL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"35.0\",\