        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075YMW6VR\",\"sku\":\"B075YMW6VR\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"parson-wood-trestle-dining-table-78-96-l-oak-finish-b075ymw6vr\",\"name\":\"Parson Wood Trestle Dining Table, 78&quot;-96&quot;L, Oak Finish\",\"description\":\"Beautiful oak finish and simple classic lines make this dining table work in any style home. Between its sturdy construction and the additional leaf to expand its size, this table will accommodate a growing, busy family for years to come. 78&quot;L x 40&quot;D x 30&quot;H; expands to 96&quot;L with leaf Hardwood top and legs with oak finish An additional leaf allows it to expand to accommodate your friends and family Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Assembly is required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Parson Wood Trestle Dining Table, 78&quot;-96&quot;L, Oak Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Q97z9QD2L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Xt65NhKxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Xt65NhKxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Q1L-Y3H5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Q1L-Y3H5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DyplotwgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DyplotwgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1B4nIz3c6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1B4nIz3c6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81iT5PtSnLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81iT5PtSnLL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"30.0\",\"label\":\"