      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X5T6BR\",\"sku\":\"B075X5T6BR\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"norah-leather-and-wood-square-ottoman-b075x5t6br\",\"name\":\"Norah Leather and Wood Square Ottoman\",\"description\":\"This stylish square ottoman is designed to blend with most any decor. The wood frame has a light oak finish for a rustic touch, with a smooth top-grain leather upholstered top. Use as a foot stool or extra seat for guests. 39.75&quot;W x 39.75''D x 39.75&quot;W x 17.5''H 100% top-grain leather on wood frame. Use as a resting place for tired feet, a snack tray, or an extra guest No assembly required. Wipe with a soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Norah Leather and Wood Square Ottoman\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81WvCKBCsHL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-vBSbFDPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-vBSbFDPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1MCesN-faL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1MCesN-faL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BVU9sMG9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BVU9sMG9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KebVepGsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KebVepGsL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81gg8uvDj-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81gg8uvDj-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915kVjxbtML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915kVjxbtML.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"nam