        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4GSKS1\",\"sku\":\"B07B4GSKS1\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"andover-modern-square-ottoman-33-w-cream-b07b4gsks1\",\"name\":\"Andover Modern Square Ottoman, 33&quot;W, Cream\",\"description\":\"Wooden legs, clean lines, and box-edge cushions bring stylish sophistication to modern or transitional rooms. With a sturdy frame and springy cushioning, this ottoman is ready to withstand years as a footrest or extra seating for guests. 33&quot;W x 33&quot;D x 21&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 33&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 21&quot;H; Leg Height: 4.25&quot;H Stain-resistant polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame The streamlined shape is a hallmark of modern design Carefully crafted to ensure durability and years of use Easy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Andover Modern Square Ottoman, 33&quot;W, Cream\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EaHEBW-TL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81fZm2COaNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81fZm2COaNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71o-K4fn48L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71o-K4fn48L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81r0ISbttsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81r0ISbttsL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81zy35iSbUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81zy35iSbUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Ujn02itKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Ujn02itKL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"