      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073WRF56P\",\"sku\":\"B073WRF56P\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"foldable-14-metal-platform-bed-frame-with-tool-free-assembly-no-box-spring-needed-california-king-b073wrf56p\",\"name\":\"Foldable, 14&quot; Metal Platform Bed Frame with Tool-Free Assembly, No Box Spring Needed - California King\",\"description\":\"Product Dimensions: 84&quot; L x 72&quot; W x 14&quot; H | Weight: 50.8 pounds Designed for sleepers up to 250 pounds California King platform bed frame offers a quiet, noise-free, supportive foundation for a mattress. No box spring needed Folding mechanism makes the frame easy to store and move in tight spaces Provides extra under-the-bed storage space with a vertical clearance of about 13 inches Fast, easy setup—no tools required Made of durable steel with a sleek black finish\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Foldable, 14&quot; Metal Platform Bed Frame with Tool-Free Assembly, No Box Spring Needed - California King\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91395kFBwxL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Jw00EjbSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Jw00EjbSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/611vzqcCyoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/611vzqcCyoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yT70+dv6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yT70+dv6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61On-pKOumL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61On-pKOumL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71UNQCVF9sL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71UNQCVF9sL.jpg\"}