        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B085693MWK\",\"sku\":\"B085693MWK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-decatur-modern-faux-leather-kitchen-bar-stool-41-h-tan-brown-b085693mwk\",\"name\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Faux Leather Kitchen Bar Stool, 41&quot;H, Tan Brown\",\"description\":\"This beautiful modern barstool features a bold squared-off design for both the seat and legs. The metal frame, supported by an H-spreader bar encompasses a plush, backed, armless seat upholstered in durable faux leather. Overall: 22&quot;D x 18&quot;W x 41&quot;H. Seat height: 30&quot; Solid wooden frame and black metal legs combine for maximum style and support Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Arrives fully assembled. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Faux Leather Kitchen Bar Stool, 41&quot;H, Tan Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Amr8KTrOL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71q9D1oxwBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71q9D1oxwBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61YS7ocdaYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61YS7ocdaYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814hcvBLE1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814hcvBLE1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71hBuznLkwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71hBuznLkwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71T4WaC3ghL.jpg\",\"url\"