      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075QFCZ2J\",\"sku\":\"B075QFCZ2J\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-york-modern-extended-low-platform-king-bed-with-headboard-90-2-l-grey-b075qfcz2j\",\"name\":\"Rivet York Modern Extended Low Platform King Bed with Headboard, 90.2&quot;L, Grey\",\"description\":\"Mid-century modern meets comfy in this platform bed. Clean lines, tapered wood feet and a low profile footboard are combined with sides that extend beyond the mattress for a very contemporary effect. Silver grey fabric adds extra appeal. 90.2&quot;L x 87.8&quot;W x 42.3&quot;H Upholstered with 100% polyester herringbone fabric. Tapered wood legs. Mid-century modern headboard curves up and back for distinctive side silhouette No boxspring required. King mattress sold separately. Assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet York Modern Extended Low Platform King Bed with Headboard, 90.2&quot;L, Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nl9xI6PrL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B12tsbkjToS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B12tsbkjToS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JQOUJ0qoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JQOUJ0qoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1-TW58H4rS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1-TW58H4rS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sQPYgUesL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sQPYgUesL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81egNDsm8dL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81e