      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B071FJR3S6\",\"sku\":\"B071FJR3S6\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"glenwood-industrial-metal-dresser-60-w-oak-b071fjr3s6\",\"name\":\"Glenwood Industrial Metal Dresser, 60&quot;W, Oak\",\"description\":\"This industrial double dresser features robust metal pulls on its six drawers and a matching metal piece on the bottom. Solid hardwood construction is finished with quarter-sawn oak veneer and wire-brushed for a distressed look. 60&quot;W x 19&quot;D x 35&quot;H Solid hardwood with oak veneer and metal drawer pulls A bold industrial design is softened by a classic wood finish to blend with modern décor. Self-closing drawers are suspended on concealed ball-bearing extension glides. No assembly needed. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Glenwood Industrial Metal Dresser, 60&quot;W, Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lYK9RVovL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+1c9b6ELL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+1c9b6ELL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ybiI0Ek9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ybiI0Ek9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1ommZEKCNS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1ommZEKCNS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1W1lBFjGEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1W1lBFjGEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1kOSgvlTrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1kOSgvlTrL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value