        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QJLWJMC\",\"sku\":\"B07QJLWJMC\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"industrial-side-table-with-metal-base-19-69-w-gold-b07qjlwjmc\",\"name\":\"Industrial Side Table with Metal Base, 19.69&quot;W, Gold\",\"description\":\"This industrial-inspired side table touts an open, gold-finished metal base with a round marble top. The light and airy feel it adds to any room takes nothing away from its durability. Use it next to a favorite chair or couch and enjoy how it completes the room’s style with a modern flair. 19.69&quot;W x 19.69&quot;D x 22.24&quot;H A marble round top and an open metal base in a gold finish This industrial side table with a marble top and metal base with gold finish fits well with most modern decor. This side table looks great next to a couch or chair. No assembly required Wipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Industrial Side Table with Metal Base, 19.69&quot;W, Gold\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71zGl4i6q5L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Cub0lXtEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Cub0lXtEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91FKNEp3tEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91FKNEp3tEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qIgDHivmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qIgDHivmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/719JyXveBjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/719JyXveBjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81o2oVtefAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-