        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075QGK96V\",\"sku\":\"B075QGK96V\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"avondale-nailhead-trim-king-bed-with-headboard-79-5-w-stone-b075qgk96v\",\"name\":\"Avondale Nailhead Trim King Bed with Headboard, 79.5&quot;W, Stone\",\"description\":\"Vintage meets industrial in this magnificently styled bed. Roughened, dark espresso-finished metal borders the stone-colored linen fabric of the headboard and footboard. Decorative nail head trim completes the exquisite antique style. 86&quot;L x 79.5&quot;W x 52&quot;H 65% rayon/35% linen fabric is surrounded by nailhead trim and a dark metal border A vintage look with touches of industrial. Neutral color will blend in many rooms. Requires mattress and boxspring (sold separately) Assemble in 30 minutes to 1 hour. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Avondale Nailhead Trim King Bed with Headboard, 79.5&quot;W, Stone\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cnidWw0AL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1BknPstlUS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1BknPstlUS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81URKIaW1QL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81URKIaW1QL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Qb3hh9M7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Qb3hh9M7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81wkLYjUbPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81wkLYjUbPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GMJbC2tBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GMJbC2tBL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\