        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0853VNSCC\",\"sku\":\"B0853VNSCC\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"gabrieli-wood-framed-upholstered-swivel-chair-29-9-w-charcoal-b0853vnscc\",\"name\":\"Gabrieli Wood-Framed Upholstered Swivel Chair, 29.9&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"description\":\"This wood-framed swivel chair is upholstered in a usefully neutral charcoal gray, which makes it easy to work into your existing decor. As a place to work, converse, or relax, this chair is a stylish multitasker. 29.9&quot;W x 33.1&quot;D x 31.9&quot;H Wood frame and foam-filled cushions This swivel chair has an elegant wood base upholstered with a stain-resistant fabric. No assembly required Avoid moisture, and wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Gabrieli Wood-Framed Upholstered Swivel Chair, 29.9&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71dSF8htO2L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HVwbDnplL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HVwbDnplL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81tlqJlmOmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81tlqJlmOmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qtFXkKlDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qtFXkKlDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71bJZYWPtwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71bJZYWPtwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71N31hFdS2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71N31hFdS2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81teIhEceiL.jpg\",\"url\":\"h