    "dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Data": {
      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSGCNVB\",\"sku\":\"B07HSGCNVB\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"arlington-contemporary-bookcase-31-49-w-wood-and-dark-metal-b07hsgcnvb\",\"name\":\"Arlington Contemporary Bookcase, 31.49&quot;W, Wood and Dark Metal\",\"description\":\"Enhance your contemporary-style home décor with this beautiful bookshelf. The natural finish brings out the grain in the solid mango, and the steel frame adds stability. The bookshelf’s 6 sturdy shelves offer storage space for plenty of books and knickknacks. 16.85&quot;W x 31.49&quot;D x 78.74&quot;H The shelves are made of solid mango with a natural finish. The steel frame adds a contemporary industrial look to the piece. Modern styling that can blend with industrial-themed home décor as well This bookshelf has 6 fixed open shelves to house your favorite books, pictures, and collections. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Care: Clean as required with a soft, damp cloth; wipe completely dry. Avoid placing furniture near heat vents or open windows. Long periods of heat or excessive dampness can cause splitting, warping, and swelling in solid wood. Protect fine furniture finishes from hot dishes, alcohol, and excessive moisture or dampness. Safety: Always use the anti-tip hardware when applicable and follow directions. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Arlington Contemporary Bookcase, 31.49&quot;W, Wood and Dark Metal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71e-vE1tEtL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81NikHpvytL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81NikHpvytL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71C5sGJjBdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71C5sGJjBdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Y+TjXUvqL.j