      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4M6B3B\",\"sku\":\"B07B4M6B3B\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"alderman-mid-century-modern-accent-chair-29-9-w-dark-brown-leather-b07b4m6b3b\",\"name\":\"Alderman Mid-Century Modern Accent Chair, 29.9&quot;W, Dark Brown Leather\",\"description\":\"This chair adds the rustic touch of wooden arms to mid-century inspired lines and tufting, allowing it to blend with a wide range of decor. A taller back and generously sized cushion make it a comfortable addition to your family room. 29.9&quot;W x 35&quot;D x 36.2&quot;H; Seat Height: 17.7&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 20.8&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 22.4&quot;H; Arm Height: 22.4&quot;H; Leg Height: 9.8&quot; Genuine leather on sturdy wood frame; arms and legs have oak finish Various style influences combine to blend with transitional, modern or farmhouse décor Tall back and roomy seat cushion makes this chair a comfortable seat for guests No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Alderman Mid-Century Modern Accent Chair, 29.9&quot;W, Dark Brown Leather\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+8ZECeEbL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j6mtqU5TL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j6mtqU5TL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91M9+MIPXZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91M9+MIPXZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Zb015p2vL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Zb015p2vL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FU9kmNGNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FU9kmNGNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/or