      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QJ22326\",\"sku\":\"B07QJ22326\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-haraden-modern-rectangular-button-tufted-queen-bed-headboard-62-w-grey-b07qj22326\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Haraden Modern Rectangular Button-Tufted Queen Bed Headboard, 62&quot;W, Grey\",\"description\":\"62&quot;W x 3.5&quot;D x 50&quot;H Durable polyester fabric on wood frame; solid wood legs with a black finish Contemporary design with a wood frame upholstered in grey fabric; solid wood legs Foam padding and an elastic suspension system keep the headboard supportive and springy. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Haraden Modern Rectangular Button-Tufted Queen Bed Headboard, 62&quot;W, Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qzHiG8iQL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KV-nP8sYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KV-nP8sYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71HPynUAe1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71HPynUAe1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71q+0QpsLtL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71q+0QpsLtL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71TcRtcO1jL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71TcRtcO1jL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61jC5MMujoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61jC5MMujoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71UupUI5J-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googl