      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0768STTR7\",\"sku\":\"B0768STTR7\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"weston-wood-metal-nesting-tables-set-of-2-brown-b0768sttr7\",\"name\":\"Weston Wood & Metal Nesting Tables, Set of 2, Brown\",\"description\":\"Together or apart, these handsome wood and metal nesting tables will serve you well. Use side by side as coffee tables or as end tables on either side of a sofa or bed. Stored together, they're a great space-saving solution. Large table: 17.7&quot;W x 11.8&quot;D x 23.8&quot;H; Small table: 11.8&quot;W x 9.8&quot;D x 21.9&quot;H Solid fir wood top; metal frame with black finish Modern design with classic wood finish for a transitional look Use side by side as coffee tables, or as end tables No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Weston Wood & Metal Nesting Tables, Set of 2, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81uSEIfTjuL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81c67RIc4FL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81c67RIc4FL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A109kmWg3zL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A109kmWg3zL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1dfaAERjcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1dfaAERjcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817lu7h9LZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817lu7h9LZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1zULXu6zTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1zULXu6zTL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\"