        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSDY12Q\",\"sku\":\"B07HSDY12Q\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"mid-century-wishbone-dining-chair-22-4-w-white-natural-b07hsdy12q\",\"name\":\"Mid-Century Wishbone Dining Chair, 22.4&quot;W, White / Natural\",\"description\":\"This dining chair combines Mid-Century modern and Scandinavian-inspired styles for beautiful form, functionality and comfort. With a woven rattan seat, solid beech wood frame and partially open-back this piece works for the dining room or anywhere you need extra seating. 22.4&quot;W x 22.8&quot;D x 28.75&quot;H. Seat height: 18&quot; Solid beech wood frame with a woven paper rattan seat This versatile, transitional chair blends well with traditional and modern styles. Arrives fully assembled Avoid moisture. Wipe away dust and debris with a soft, dry cloth Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Mid-Century Wishbone Dining Chair, 22.4&quot;W, White / Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71zRxaWkQ2L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vZAPQityL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vZAPQityL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71qH++M21jL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71qH++M21jL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71czUt0FLqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71czUt0FLqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71T5crYahyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71T5crYahyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Tlrnq89nL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Tlrnq89nL.jpg\"}],\"attrib