      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSH4WFB\",\"sku\":\"B07HSH4WFB\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-chest-of-drawers-with-diamond-pattern-17-7-inch-width-natural-b07hsh4wfb\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Chest of Drawers with Diamond Pattern, 17.7 Inch Width, Natural\",\"description\":\"The diamond-pattern woodwork in this solid-hardwood cabinet gives it a bold, modern look. Gold metal legs and drawer pulls complement the natural warmth of the birch, and the smooth ball-bearing drawer glides make storage easy. 36.38&quot;W x 17.7&quot;D x 31.5&quot;H Solid hardwood cabinet with birch ply concave diamond designs in drawer fronts; gold metal legs and drawer pulls The clean styling and diamond pattern woodwork on drawer fronts give this a modern look. The three drawers are great to hide away items like clothes, table linens, and even board games. This piece features ball-bearing drawer glides. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Chest of Drawers with Diamond Pattern, 17.7 Inch Width, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QdK6Vgu9L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JZ-PrnIaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JZ-PrnIaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916ES8rBHlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916ES8rBHlL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91N11nn1LPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91N11nn1LPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hUoWmCRzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hUoWmCRzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/or