        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSL2HJZ\",\"sku\":\"B07HSL2HJZ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-swivel-desk-chair-25-7-h-adjustable-height-gray-b07hsl2hjz\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Swivel Desk Chair 25.7”H, Adjustable Height, Gray\",\"description\":\"Carefully crafted gray leather and a dark metal base set this swivel chair apart with a touch of class and sophistication. A height-adjustable seat adds comfort and functionality to this modern piece. 24.3&quot;W x 24.3&quot;D x 25.7&quot;H; Seat Height: 18.72-22.43”H; Seat Depth: 16.97”D; Seat Back Height: 15.6”H; Arm Height: 24.57”H 100% Genuine Leather Gray genuine leather adds the finishing touch to this modern, sophisticated office chair. The sturdy construction of the dark metal base makes for a strong foundation to this chair. Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes Wipes clean with a soft, dry cloth. Avoid moisture. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Swivel Desk Chair 25.7”H, Adjustable Height, Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Zh2h3rTcL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+o4C5r85L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+o4C5r85L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81fofKeQJKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81fofKeQJKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71oAZi2TTmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71oAZi2TTmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91yVy7vuFHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91yVy7vuFHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71P9DZHcd6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapi