        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075YZ16V4\",\"sku\":\"B075YZ16V4\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-stark-2-drawer-nightstand-24-h-walnut-b075yz16v4\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Stark 2-Drawer Nightstand, 24&quot;H, Walnut\",\"description\":\"This classic mid-century modern nightstand has angled lines and no-knob drawers for a minimalist look. Durable solid pine is built to last and sustainably sourced. A warm walnut finish and tapered legs add to the eye-catching retro style. 18&quot;W x 15&quot;D x 24&quot;H FSC-certified solid pine. Drawers feature wood runners and safety stops. Mid-century modern design will blend with a modern bedroom or home office Store your tissues or remote controls by the bed or small supplies in a home office Assemble in 15-30 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Stark 2-Drawer Nightstand, 24&quot;H, Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vjwcAPgwL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1leikd5RAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1leikd5RAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91z6LyLrZQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91z6LyLrZQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ufvWPwz6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ufvWPwz6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JtjnqtBLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JtjnqtBLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VLl7mOhZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VLl7mOhZL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"la