      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSBD885\",\"sku\":\"B07HSBD885\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-vern-contemporary-round-back-swivel-dining-chair-with-arms-23-w-canary-yellow-b07hsbd885\",\"name\":\"Rivet Vern Contemporary Round-Back Swivel Dining Chair with Arms, 23&quot;W, Canary Yellow\",\"description\":\"This beautiful yellow dining chair combines sophisticated contemporary style with timeless comfort and conversation-friendly swivel motion. A solid wood frame supports a cushioned seat with a full seat back. Overall: 24&quot;D x 23&quot;W x 32&quot;H. Seat height: 18.5&quot;, arm height: 23.6&quot; Fabric upholstery and foam padding on a solid wood frame with swivel mechanism. Supreme comfort and convenience meets contemporary style. Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Vern Contemporary Round-Back Swivel Dining Chair with Arms, 23&quot;W, Canary Yellow\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/815jVR1xwqL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1p8AntYtzS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1p8AntYtzS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81tOtNa2g3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81tOtNa2g3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ac+oVkBRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ac+oVkBRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A183sv76CmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A183sv76CmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/819kyMNa2qL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/819kyMNa2qL.jpg\"}]