      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07PBZVPH2\",\"sku\":\"B07PBZVPH2\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"lauren-down-filled-oversized-leather-loveseat-with-hardwood-frame-74-w-dark-brown-b07pbzvph2\",\"name\":\"Lauren Down-Filled Oversized Leather Loveseat with Hardwood Frame, 74&quot;W, Dark Brown\",\"description\":\"Dimensions: 74&quot;W x 45&quot;D x 37&quot;H Soft down-filled cushions on a frame of solid hardwood mean this loveseat offers plush support and security. Neutral dark-brown leather upholstery allows this piece to blend into your existing color scheme with ease. Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric made of 98% polyester, 2% nylon; down-filled seat and back cushions Removable and reversible seat cushion. Classic design will fit any space. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Lauren Down-Filled Oversized Leather Loveseat with Hardwood Frame, 74&quot;W, Dark Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ng6sCKxxL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XasjcNkZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XasjcNkZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71sDSR57U5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71sDSR57U5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/810HNQ2jR0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/810HNQ2jR0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91aKbSkSJXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91aKbSkSJXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71eGcR2UDoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresi