      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B08568W6MS\",\"sku\":\"B08568W6MS\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-decatur-modern-faux-leather-kitchen-counter-height-stool-37-h-tan-brown-b08568w6ms\",\"name\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Faux Leather Kitchen Counter-Height Stool, 37&quot;H, Tan Brown\",\"description\":\"This beautiful modern counter-height barstool features a bold squared-off design for both the seat and legs. The metal frame, supported by an H-spreader bar encompasses a plush, backed, armless seat upholstered in durable faux leather. Overall: 22&quot;D x 18&quot;W x 37&quot;H. Seat height: 26&quot; Solid wooden frame and black metal legs combine for maximum style and support Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Arrives fully assembled. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Faux Leather Kitchen Counter-Height Stool, 37&quot;H, Tan Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jjgHzpPgL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71nfnbHYSVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71nfnbHYSVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Rzl2MXmJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Rzl2MXmJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Bobv8szzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Bobv8szzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71rGQqyJU5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71rGQqyJU5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-