        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075ZBVZST\",\"sku\":\"B075ZBVZST\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-curved-wood-table-home-office-computer-desk-48-4-l-walnut-b075zbvzst\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Curved Wood Table Home Office Computer Desk, 48.4&quot;L, Walnut\",\"description\":\"48.4&quot;W x 22.2&quot;D x 31.1&quot;H Walnut veneer finish Simple, practical style with one-drawer storage A classic mid-century design, this desk features iconic clean lines and curves along the back edges for a style that blends with modern or contemporary décor. It features an open work area with a middle drawer underneath for storage. Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Curved Wood Table Home Office Computer Desk, 48.4&quot;L, Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KyTFN5HOL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91poU2S-DQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91poU2S-DQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rJoD0vMEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rJoD0vMEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cTj1yjlgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cTj1yjlgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81a544OYsdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81a544OYsdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cR6N4C5nL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cR6N4C5nL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Cwo4cvxeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https