    "dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Data": {
      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07RJFG6XB\",\"sku\":\"B07RJFG6XB\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"solimo-newport-leatherette-2-seater-sofa-black-b07rjfg6xb\",\"name\":\"Solimo Newport Leatherette 2 Seater Sofa (Black)\",\"description\":\"Comfortable two-seater sofa made from high-quality leatherette with a sleek design in black color Passed 30+ safety and quality tests and does not lose color with rubbing Passed durability testing with 100 kg on each seat and backrest for 25,000 cycles; Passed armrest stability testing with 40 kg dynamic loading for 10,000 cycles Meets Indian Standards IS 12674/ IS 5416 for performance and stringent European Safety Requirement Standard EN 12520 Warranty on manufacturing defects: 3 years Lightweight sofa for easy shifting and good ground clearance for easy cleaning below the sofa. Free from toxins and harmful chemicals like formaldehyde and AZO Dye Please note: Sofa is delivered with the legs in a detached condition. The cavity where sofa legs will be placed is protected by a plastic cap. This will be removed during assembly and replaced with sofa legs\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Solimo Newport Leatherette 2 Seater Sofa (Black)\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817EXX-ks1L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51EbZF+fRnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51EbZF+fRnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51TuYRB7HaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51TuYRB7HaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61mBf3eKuuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61mBf3eKuuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71lSmQCXBML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/origi