        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073G82B5L\",\"sku\":\"B073G82B5L\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-sweeping-arm-settee-51-w-emerald-b073g82b5l\",\"name\":\"Modern Sweeping Arm Settee, 51&quot;W, Emerald\",\"description\":\"This graceful settee will make a pleasing addition to any style of room. A soft sweep of the arms and clean lines make it modern, but beautiful woven fabric and turned wood-look legs with espresso-colored stain give it a classic look as well. 51”W x 29”D x 35”H Solid pine with polyester fabric Modern with classic touches Will blend with classic and transitional style rooms 4 easy-to-attach legs Made-to-order Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Sweeping Arm Settee, 51&quot;W, Emerald\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rjvZMbrzL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sZnCXgVbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sZnCXgVbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nVAS3DXwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nVAS3DXwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81y-InU7+5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81y-InU7+5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VO+fDO4NL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VO+fDO4NL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1sAM6J9FRS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1sAM6J9FRS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"35.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"51.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}