    "dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Data": {
      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QD6V1SY\",\"sku\":\"B07QD6V1SY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"industrial-nesting-tables-set-of-2-17-75-w-and-15-35-w-mango-wood-and-light-gray-b07qd6v1sy\",\"name\":\"Industrial Nesting Tables, Set of 2, 17.75&quot;W and 15.35&quot;W, Mango Wood and Light Gray\",\"description\":\"These industrial nesting tables tout open metal bases in a clear finish and a parquetry design in solid mango on top. A casual yet chic style, these tables look especially nice with a modern farmhouse decor but are versatile enough for use with contemporary and other decors as well. Table 1: 17.75&quot;W x 17.75&quot;D x 19.69&quot;H; table 2: 15.35&quot;W x 15.35&quot;D x 18.5&quot;H Solid mango with metal base These casual nesting tables with open metal bases and solid mango tops look great with most decor styles. Parquetry tops in solid mango add beauty to these functional tables. No assembly required Wipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Industrial Nesting Tables, Set of 2, 17.75&quot;W and 15.35&quot;W, Mango Wood and Light Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81V9jSTRl4L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81eyO+sSzHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81eyO+sSzHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/812ZM4+5qZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/812ZM4+5qZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KUaXYLIkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KUaXYLIkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nREr1-AwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nREr1-AwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"ht