        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075YP3881\",\"sku\":\"B075YP3881\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-3-tiered-rustic-metallic-rolling-wood-and-metal-bar-cart-29-9-w-natural-b075yp3881\",\"name\":\"Rivet 3-Tiered Rustic Metallic Rolling Wood and Metal Bar Cart, 29.9&quot;W, Natural\",\"description\":\"29.9&quot;W X14.2&quot; D X 31.7&quot;H Solid rubberwood trays on metal frame with gold plated finish Two of the four rotating wheels lock to park the cart just where you want it Assembly is required. Wipe with soft dry cloth Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty A metal frame with gold finish supports three wooden trays on this rustic bar cart. Fill with your favorite beverages and you're ready to host friends for a night of fun\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet 3-Tiered Rustic Metallic Rolling Wood and Metal Bar Cart, 29.9&quot;W, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71YDG9BmDjL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/716wffYChNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/716wffYChNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71bfzDwt6CL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71bfzDwt6CL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mAWwj4cNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mAWwj4cNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JvM6aALAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JvM6aALAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Uphre3ooL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Uphre3ooL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+ybsjhJ4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://