      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B071J7Q379\",\"sku\":\"B071J7Q379\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"lauren-down-filled-oversized-ottoman-with-hardwood-frame-46-5-w-fawn-b071j7q379\",\"name\":\"Lauren Down Filled Oversized Ottoman with Hardwood Frame, 46.5&quot;W, Fawn\",\"description\":\"Dimensions: 46.5&quot;W x 46.5&quot;D x 18.5&quot;H This ottoman combines a simple silhouette with sink-in comfort. Fabric that is stain and moisture-resistant makes this ottoman work as a footrest, an extra seat for company, or a place to park a tray of snacks. Sturdy hardwood frame; polyester/nylon stain-resistant fabric Timeless casual Exceptional comfort with high performance fabric for heavy wear. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Lauren Down Filled Oversized Ottoman with Hardwood Frame, 46.5&quot;W, Fawn\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EOvyrbIUL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81WvQthXtRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81WvQthXtRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16gbyiXi4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16gbyiXi4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1kK+ZTUfGS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1kK+ZTUfGS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+zWL1xLbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+zWL1xLbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1y6Li6mFHS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1y6Li6mFHS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"18.503937\",\"label\":