      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSHXVZX\",\"sku\":\"B07HSHXVZX\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-wood-kitchen-counter-barstool-29-5-h-natural-finish-b07hshxvzx\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Wood Kitchen Counter Barstool, 29.5&quot;H, Natural Finish\",\"description\":\"This modern barstool is made of sturdy solid birch with a natural finish; it features a contoured seat and no back for a classically minimalist profile with maximized style and sophistication. Sturdy, solid birch wood construction for stability 14.4&quot;D x 17.3”W x 29.5”H Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Avoid moisture. Wipe away dust and debris with a soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Wood Kitchen Counter Barstool, 29.5&quot;H, Natural Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71M3Ikg4maL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-lPg1TkOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-lPg1TkOL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TSWkzpnFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TSWkzpnFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71PPKjG-xHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71PPKjG-xHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1n3xIp0wVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1n3xIp0wVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71znG3mKE2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71znG3mKE2L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"29.5\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"val