      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B071FJR3T4\",\"sku\":\"B071FJR3T4\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"parson-queen-bed-64-5-w-natural-b071fjr3t4\",\"name\":\"Parson Queen Bed, 64.5&quot;W, Natural\",\"description\":\"This design is modern farmhouse at its best. Oak veneer gives a distinctive grain to the tall headboard and low-profile footboard. The natural beauty and cozy feel of this piece will have you looking forward to bedtime. 64.5&quot;W x 85.75&quot;L x 56&quot; H Solid hardwood with hand-selected oak veneer This rustic bed has the look of natural reclaimed wood with distressed finish. Five slats with two legs each sturdily support a mattress and boxspring (sold separately). Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Parson Queen Bed, 64.5&quot;W, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QIA-U2AfL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GEDFFP4wL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GEDFFP4wL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tCCHfObaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tCCHfObaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ML1JCC5NL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ML1JCC5NL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91t7hGIbTVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91t7hGIbTVL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"56.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"85.75\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"64.5\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"