      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4YXRQ6\",\"sku\":\"B07B4YXRQ6\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-brecken-modern-wood-tall-bedroom-dresser-drawers-42-inch-height-brass-hardware-brown-b07b4yxrq6\",\"name\":\"Rivet Brecken Modern Wood Tall Bedroom Dresser Drawers, 42 Inch Height, Brass Hardware, Brown\",\"description\":\"42&quot;W x 17&quot;D x 55&quot;H; Leg Height: 5.75&quot; Lavish storage with 6 drawers Assemble in 15 minutes or less; screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. With its six drawers, this handsome dresser will simplify your bedroom storage. Clean modern lines, a warm butterscotch finish and aged brass handles add to the contemporary style. Angled, tapered legs give it a polished look.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Brecken Modern Wood Tall Bedroom Dresser Drawers, 42 Inch Height, Brass Hardware, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BlTkXwGvL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lNiejwVlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lNiejwVlL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wJ3ogiP3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wJ3ogiP3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1TO3d3+uvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1TO3d3+uvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OGK5u1KFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OGK5u1KFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-cAqN8XQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-cAqN8XQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/912dgR5VXSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://sto