      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HYYBHFH\",\"sku\":\"B07HYYBHFH\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-goodwin-modern-ottoman-30-3-w-charcoal-fabric-b07hyybhfh\",\"name\":\"Rivet Goodwin Modern Ottoman, 30.3&quot;W, Charcoal Fabric\",\"description\":\"This striking ottoman will be the perfect finishing touch for your modern-style home decor. With its beautiful charcoal-colored upholstery, this ottoman will nicely complement your existing interior design, and its sleek, classy design adds elegance to any room. Overall: 30.3&quot;W x 26.8&quot;D x 18.5&quot;H; Leg Height: 6.3&quot;H Solid-wood frame and legs with 100% polyester upholstery Strong slim legs elevate this piece and add modern flair. This compact, durable ottoman is padded with high-density foam. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Goodwin Modern Ottoman, 30.3&quot;W, Charcoal Fabric\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91k4sVcONPL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916fweMLibL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916fweMLibL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IVSEcL2KL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IVSEcL2KL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1tIM5FKIHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1tIM5FKIHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1zXdJ-M7vL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1zXdJ-M7vL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1x07rPG6dL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1x07rPG6dL.jpg\