        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QHYCXTF\",\"sku\":\"B07QHYCXTF\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"faraday-down-filled-casual-sofa-102-w-charcoal-b07qhycxtf\",\"name\":\"Faraday Down-Filled Casual Sofa, 102&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"description\":\"This modern sofa comes with removable and reversible down-filled cushions for comfort. Roomy seating is nice with company or family, and the neutral tone matches most decor, making it a great choice for any room. The luxury of a cotton-blend upholstery helps keep everyone cool through the summer. 89''width x42.1''Depthx32.3''Height Solid hardwood frame with down-filled seat and back cushions Removable and reversible cushions This casual sofa offers down-filled cushions and a seat depth of 43&quot; for extra comfort. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Faraday Down-Filled Casual Sofa, 102&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tubBAumQL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71EmKXVAReL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71EmKXVAReL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91YFSCf9B5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91YFSCf9B5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jOYmJOe2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jOYmJOe2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91F4ujsELUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91F4ujsELUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ksrr0gzrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ksrr0gzrL.jpg\"}],\"attribut