        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QGSZ35F\",\"sku\":\"B07QGSZ35F\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"faraday-down-filled-casual-sofa-102-w-light-grey-b07qgsz35f\",\"name\":\"Faraday Down-Filled Casual Sofa, 102&quot;W, Light Grey\",\"description\":\"This modern sofa comes with removable and reversible down-filled cushions for comfort. Roomy seating is nice with company or family, and the neutral tone matches most decor, making it a great choice for any room. The luxury of a cotton-blend upholstery helps keep everyone cool through the summer. 102&quot; Width x 43&quot; Depth x 33&quot; Height Solid hardwood frame with down-filled seat and back cushions Removable and reversible cushions This casual sofa offers down-filled cushions and a seat depth of 43&quot; for extra comfort. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Faraday Down-Filled Casual Sofa, 102&quot;W, Light Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71D6SMadk4L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VDi9s84SL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VDi9s84SL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71YJRl5e8bL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71YJRl5e8bL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1eV29sdm2S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1eV29sdm2S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+HN0ZDvlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+HN0ZDvlL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Fco+YSC2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Fco+YSC