        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07DBD3G35\",\"sku\":\"B07DBD3G35\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-high-back-bistro-metal-bar-stool-40-25-inch-height-grey-set-of-4-b07dbd3g35\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home High Back Bistro Metal Bar Stool, 40.25 Inch Height, Grey, Set of 4\",\"description\":\"22&quot;Lx 17.25&quot;Wx 40.25&quot;H Durable metal bistro stool with supportive cross brace; stackable Convenient seating with chair back; low maintenance, easy to clean and stackable for storage Clean industrial design Set includes: Four (4) Stools Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home High Back Bistro Metal Bar Stool, 40.25 Inch Height, Grey, Set of 4\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lTAQ6QJPL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91IcDtr3UEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91IcDtr3UEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71LqjU4hrxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71LqjU4hrxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71OHtHQDe1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71OHtHQDe1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/810832MlokL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/810832MlokL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61mOIH6qGtL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61mOIH6qGtL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"40.25\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"17.25\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name