      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073GGGF37\",\"sku\":\"B073GGGF37\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"truve-modern-studded-ottoman-19-w-damask-navy-b073gggf37\",\"name\":\"Truve Modern Studded Ottoman, 19&quot;W, Damask Navy\",\"description\":\"This beautifully styled ottoman also serves as extra storage space. Its unique curved edges, covered in linen/cotton fabric and accentuated with brass nail-head trim, bring character and class to any room. 19&quot;W x 17&quot;D x 19&quot;H Strong wood frame with linen/cotton upholstery Casual and functional Provides stylish storage No assembly required Made-to-order Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Truve Modern Studded Ottoman, 19&quot;W, Damask Navy\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1DgHF66l5L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wG24HydjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wG24HydjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1jha40mwhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1jha40mwhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1+v1+StZyS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1+v1+StZyS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fEb8nq9ZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fEb8nq9ZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1r4buHVPOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1r4buHVPOL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913TIcRoxRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913TIcRoxRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/pures