  "payload": {
    "dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Data": {
      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QC85X8Y\",\"sku\":\"B07QC85X8Y\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"industrial-nesting-tables-set-of-2-19-69-w-and-14-96-w-antique-natural-and-black-b07qc85x8y\",\"name\":\"Industrial Nesting Tables, Set of 2, 19.69&quot;W and 14.96&quot;W, Antique Natural and Black\",\"description\":\"These industrial nesting tables tout iron bases in a black powder-coated finish and solid wood tops with an antique finish. The smaller table easily stores under the larger when not in use. The sturdiness of the bases adds durability. The modern style with a rustic flair looks great with most decor. Table 1: 19.69&quot;W x 17.72&quot;D x 21.65&quot;H; table 2: 14.96&quot;W x 17.72&quot;D x 19.29&quot;H Solid wood tops upon iron bases These casual nesting tables with iron legs and solid wood tops with an antique finish look great with most decor styles. The smaller table stores nicely under the larger table when not in use. No assembly required Wipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Industrial Nesting Tables, Set of 2, 19.69&quot;W and 14.96&quot;W, Antique Natural and Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yomkoHubL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1UFPSTzrmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1UFPSTzrmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tTfkIbDLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tTfkIbDLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81hOoBLGCeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81hOoBLGCeL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Rm8VZLQHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/orig