        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4NWFW7\",\"sku\":\"B07B4NWFW7\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-kaden-mid-century-modern-adjustable-headrest-living-room-accent-chair-35-8-w-light-grey-b07b4nwfw7\",\"name\":\"Rivet Kaden Mid-Century Modern Adjustable Headrest Living Room Accent Chair, 35.8&quot;W, Light Grey\",\"description\":\"This chair isn't just handsomely styled; it's cleverly functional, too. A headrest across the back adjusts upright for watching TV, then tilts back when you're ready to relax. Compactly sized for smaller spaces, it features modern metal legs. 35.8&quot;W x 39.3&quot;D x 37&quot;H; Seat Height: 16.9&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 21.2&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 17.77&quot;H; Arm Height: 23.2&quot;H; Leg Height: 5.5&quot; Quality upholstery with a cedar hardwood frame; metal legs Clean lines and streamlined design is thoroughly contemporary Unique headrest feature adjusts upward and backward Assembly in 30 minutes or less; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Kaden Mid-Century Modern Adjustable Headrest Living Room Accent Chair, 35.8&quot;W, Light Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1tn56dYrlL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16AFWhwz+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16AFWhwz+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1LfCAh-kZS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1LfCAh-kZS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1p6m3KuzQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1p6m3KuzQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o97-caXGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o97-caXGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\