      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07BWMSQC3\",\"sku\":\"B07BWMSQC3\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"hoffman-down-filled-performance-living-room-sectional-sofa-couch-127-w-dark-grey-tweed-b07bwmsqc3\",\"name\":\"Hoffman Down-Filled Performance Living Room Sectional Sofa Couch, 127&quot;W, Dark Grey Tweed\",\"description\":\"Whatever you need to accommodate kids, pets, spills and every other facet of a busy life, this sectional sofa has it all: Plush comfort, stain-resistant fabric, durable construction, and a timeless look to blend with your existing styles. 127&quot;W x 39.5&quot;D x 37&quot;H Solid hardwood frame with Revolution Performance Fabric Modern casual Exceptional comfort with high performance polypropylene fabric for heavy wear. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Hoffman Down-Filled Performance Living Room Sectional Sofa Couch, 127&quot;W, Dark Grey Tweed\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FoTwXu9KL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cSKJVwRrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cSKJVwRrL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B10WuL3PXxS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B10WuL3PXxS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1QRop09VyS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1QRop09VyS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/8199is3KBuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/8199is3KBuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1kQYLajYvS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1kQYLajYvS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.google