      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QFP4PV5\",\"sku\":\"B07QFP4PV5\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-brooker-down-filled-mid-century-sofa-76-w-quarry-b07qfp4pv5\",\"name\":\"Rivet Brooker Down-Filled Mid-Century Sofa, 76&quot;W, Quarry\",\"description\":\"This mid-century sofa with removable and reversible down-filled cushions offers comfort, while the hardwood frame and tapered legs increase its daily wear-and-tear durability. Whether used as a focus piece or a foundational piece, tufted back cushions add a touch of elegance to any room. 76&quot;W x 38&quot;D x 35&quot;H Solid hardwood frame, down-filled cushions, tapered wood legs Removable and reversible down-filled cushions This mid-century sofa adds elegance and comfort to any room. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Brooker Down-Filled Mid-Century Sofa, 76&quot;W, Quarry\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919hjxXvAwL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Yc-zDpMWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Yc-zDpMWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919lsexkqzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919lsexkqzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71JjOtHGK8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71JjOtHGK8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91FfSc48EzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91FfSc48EzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hKjGB6dLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hKjGB6dLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\