      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSKXDRL\",\"sku\":\"B07HSKXDRL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-decatur-modern-kitchen-counter-height-stool-37-h-chalk-b07hskxdrl\",\"name\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Kitchen Counter-Height Stool, 37&quot;H, Chalk\",\"description\":\"This beautiful modern counter barstool features a bold squared-off design for both the seat and legs. The metal frame, supported by an H-spreader bar, supports a plush, backed, armless seat covered in durable upholstery. Overall: 22&quot;D x 18&quot;W x 37&quot;H. Seat height: 26&quot; Solid wooden frame and black metal legs combine for maximum style and support Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Arrives fully assembled. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Kitchen Counter-Height Stool, 37&quot;H, Chalk\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EUUPJAR8L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81g2DX+LQwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81g2DX+LQwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71rA4BImmaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71rA4BImmaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JKZVSlMJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JKZVSlMJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91htO1wrXjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91htO1wrXjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Rufvu19PL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Rufvu19PL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"38.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"