        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073GBHLFS\",\"sku\":\"B073GBHLFS\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-sweeping-arm-settee-51-w-sea-blue-b073gbhlfs\",\"name\":\"Modern Sweeping Arm Settee, 51&quot;W, Sea Blue\",\"description\":\"This graceful settee will make a pleasing addition to any style of room. A soft sweep of the arms and clean lines make it modern, but beautiful woven fabric and turned wood-look legs with espresso-colored stain give it a classic look as well. 51”W x 29”D x 35”H Solid pine with polyester fabric Modern with classic touches Will blend with classic and transitional style rooms 4 easy-to-attach legs Made-to-order Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Sweeping Arm Settee, 51&quot;W, Sea Blue\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1TwKtdPiuL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1MwuYGhfwS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1MwuYGhfwS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tv2sH2cdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tv2sH2cdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1L1C0SvGZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1L1C0SvGZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81-OcWj6WmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81-OcWj6WmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B11povPL2XS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B11povPL2XS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"35.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"51.0\",\"label\":\"inches