      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B78LZQC\",\"sku\":\"B07B78LZQC\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-ian-modern-wood-round-dining-room-kitchen-table-42-w-brown-b07b78lzqc\",\"name\":\"Rivet Ian Modern Wood Round Dining Room Kitchen Table, 42&quot;W, Brown\",\"description\":\"Retro style meets practicality in this round kitchen table with inward slanted legs and a warm butterscotch finish. The minimalist silhouette is the epitome of mid-century modern style and perfect for small dining spaces. 42&quot;L x 42&quot;W x 30&quot;H Sturdy hardwoods with acacia veneer A casual transitional table for a small space or kitchen nook Comfortable seating for four Assembly in 30 minutes or less; bolt on legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Ian Modern Wood Round Dining Room Kitchen Table, 42&quot;W, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818LFcL0XBL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Cog+hc5AL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Cog+hc5AL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rLYX-Uv-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rLYX-Uv-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81w3yBT55mL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81w3yBT55mL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1FAithK9HS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1FAithK9HS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"30.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"42.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"42.0\",\"label\":\"inches