        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QHYF1M2\",\"sku\":\"B07QHYF1M2\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-brooker-down-filled-mid-century-sofa-76-w-marble-b07qhyf1m2\",\"name\":\"Rivet Brooker Down-Filled Mid-Century Sofa, 76&quot;W, Marble\",\"description\":\"This mid-century sofa with removable and reversible down-filled cushions offers comfort, while the hardwood frame and tapered legs increase its daily wear-and-tear durability. Whether used as a focus piece or a foundational piece, tufted back cushions add a touch of elegance to any room. 76&quot;W x 38&quot;D x 35&quot;H Solid hardwood frame, down-filled cushions, tapered wood legs Removable and reversible down-filled cushions This mid-century sofa adds elegance and comfort to any room. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Brooker Down-Filled Mid-Century Sofa, 76&quot;W, Marble\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pD1PbAZ0L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913d1LkQVrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913d1LkQVrL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1f5AhKz+qL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1f5AhKz+qL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A192PT7TdSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A192PT7TdSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B13mhwbI2xS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B13mhwbI2xS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91I5wgwS4nL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91I5wgwS4nL.jpg\"},{\"alt\