        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HZ6SBM5\",\"sku\":\"B07HZ6SBM5\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"clayton-reclining-contemporary-fabric-living-room-chair-30-w-stone-b07hz6sbm5\",\"name\":\"Clayton Reclining Contemporary Fabric Living-Room Chair, 30&quot;W, Stone\",\"description\":\"With an ideal blend of style and comfort, this recliner is made to order just for you. The tasteful fabric in Stone and wooden frame adds a contemporary flair, the perfect addition to any room. Sturdy wooden frame with stain-resistant fabric; no assembly required The tight, fixed back and seat cushions ensure durability and comfort; fits perfectly in a living-room corner or beside a couch or bed Product Dimensions: 30&quot;W x 39&quot;D x 41&quot;H; seat height: 20&quot;H; seat depth: 22&quot;D; seat back height: 41&quot;H; arm height: 24&quot;H; leg height: 6.5&quot;H Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Clayton Reclining Contemporary Fabric Living-Room Chair, 30&quot;W, Stone\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91KDqVz-vXL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91eqyeEH9XL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91eqyeEH9XL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KW8dsHHeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KW8dsHHeL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1HWk34F7uS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1HWk34F7uS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-M0n2WW+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-M0n2WW+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81o7dIGe4WL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-im