      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4L56TX\",\"sku\":\"B07B4L56TX\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"andover-modern-loveseat-sofa-67-w-linen-b07b4l56tx\",\"name\":\"Andover Modern Loveseat Sofa, 67&quot;W, Linen\",\"description\":\"With sturdy frames and reversible cushions, the furniture in this collection will withstand years of fun and cuddles with family and pets. Features such as track arms and box-edge lines bring stylish sophistication to modern or transitional rooms. 67&quot;W x 38&quot;D x 35&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 25&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 28&quot;H; Arm Height: 28&quot;H; Leg Height: 4.25&quot;H Cotton/polyester blend fabric on hardwood pine frame Track arms and a streamlined shape are hallmarks of modern design Back and seat cushions are reversible; individual pieces can be configured in many ways Easy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Andover Modern Loveseat Sofa, 67&quot;W, Linen\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81x7y0mF+pL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811eNfSf0NL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811eNfSf0NL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81E6mUGzNUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81E6mUGzNUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OP87BTSaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OP87BTSaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91A9AMXEmmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91A9AMXEmmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j0TVP4-SL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/