        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07JY32YHK\",\"sku\":\"B07JY32YHK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"wolcott-swivel-chair-fabric-33-w-charcoal-b07jy32yhk\",\"name\":\"Wolcott Swivel Chair, Fabric, 33&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"description\":\"This charcoal-colored swivel chair is the perfect way to add one more comfy seat to your living room. It’s also built to last, with a sturdy wood frame, a tight fixed back, a reversible seat cushion, and stain-resistant fabric upholstery. Sturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric The tight, fixed back and reversible seat cushions ensure durability and comfort. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you. Overall: 33&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 33&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H; Seat Depth: 23&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 33&quot;H; Arm Height: 25&quot;H;\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Wolcott Swivel Chair, Fabric, 33&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rcms3m5oL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JVk9bKwIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JVk9bKwIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1noCY5Fl3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1noCY5Fl3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1beHVUyYpS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1beHVUyYpS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1C+JqOxlZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1C+JqOxlZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1QcgqT1BsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1QcgqT1BsL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"