        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4MDHXM\",\"sku\":\"B07B4MDHXM\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"andover-modern-sofa-couch-93-w-charcoal-b07b4mdhxm\",\"name\":\"Andover Modern Sofa Couch, 93&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"description\":\"With sturdy frames and reversible cushions, the furniture in this collection will withstand years of fun and cuddles with family and pets. Features such as track arms and box-edge lines bring stylish sophistication to modern or transitional rooms. 93&quot;W x 38&quot;D x 35&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 25&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 28&quot;H; Arm Height: 28&quot;H; Leg Height: 4.25&quot;H Stain-resistant polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame Track arms and a streamlined shape are hallmarks of modern design Back and seat cushions are reversible; individual pieces can be configured in many ways Easy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Andover Modern Sofa Couch, 93&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91u1j7dH7xL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1CdxUGOOcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1CdxUGOOcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1qy-l59IWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1qy-l59IWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cWhOuMnHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cWhOuMnHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hRSMpl-lL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hRSMpl-lL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91bq58uur1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.c