      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4ZFD13\",\"sku\":\"B07B4ZFD13\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"prudence-tufted-queen-bed-66-w-curious-indigo-b07b4zfd13\",\"name\":\"Prudence Tufted Queen Bed, 66&quot;W, Curious Indigo\",\"description\":\"This bed adds classic style to any space. A hand-tufted headboard adds an interesting design detail. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. This item is made to order just for you 66&quot;W x 92&quot;D x 56&quot;H; Legs: 5.5&quot;H; Footboard: 18&quot;H Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame The bed is fully upholstered on the front and back of the headboard and footboard. Cross-slat support system with adjustable levelers included. Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Prudence Tufted Queen Bed, 66&quot;W, Curious Indigo\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WdMgozzbL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1I9WflVU2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1I9WflVU2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MUYqn6R0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MUYqn6R0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1e2qJAbbyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1e2qJAbbyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919V89ZgOWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919V89ZgOWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fuLQ1P0bL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fuLQ1P0bL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"hei