        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07121RM99\",\"sku\":\"B07121RM99\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-ventura-mid-century-louvered-chest-of-drawers-38-w-brown-b07121rm99\",\"name\":\"Rivet Ventura Mid-Century Louvered Chest of Drawers, 38&quot;W, Brown\",\"description\":\"Clean, simple lines are the hallmark of this casual Mid-century modern chest of drawers. The striking louvered design provides ample storage and will ensure enjoyment for years to come. The sleek look includes concealed glides under the drawers. 38&quot;W x 19&quot;D x 52&quot;H Solid hardwoods with mid-tone cherry finish A clean Mid-century modern style No assembly needed. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Drawers are suspended on easy opening, concealed, self-closing extension guides\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Ventura Mid-Century Louvered Chest of Drawers, 38&quot;W, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91IcXq9QKVL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91SI+htPchL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91SI+htPchL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vtUJZakGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vtUJZakGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lf-ECmQrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lf-ECmQrL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fjbAnXK8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fjbAnXK8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919aXQQ5c6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919aXQQ5c6L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\