        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSKB7C8\",\"sku\":\"B07HSKB7C8\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-whit-contemporary-upholstered-bar-stool-with-gold-accents-41-h-flannel-grey-b07hskb7c8\",\"name\":\"Rivet Whit Contemporary Upholstered Bar Stool with Gold Accents, 41&quot;H, Flannel Grey\",\"description\":\"The dual-height stretcher bars that lend this high-rise barstool additional support double as a comfort-enhancing footrest. The rounded, open-backed design, upholstered in gorgeous flannel grey, lends an air of contemporary chic and modern sensibility to any setting. 20&quot;D x 20&quot;W x 41&quot;H; Seat Height: 30&quot; Solid wood frame & legs with dark brown finish with gold accents Dual-height stretcher bars add stability and double as a convenient footrest Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Whit Contemporary Upholstered Bar Stool with Gold Accents, 41&quot;H, Flannel Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81hGfgdaoQL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818pKxnyzcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818pKxnyzcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81LLBtX1LwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81LLBtX1LwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1pLPGF3-MS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1pLPGF3-MS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91r6uLj8dHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91r6uLj8dHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81uLLIQdCLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/