      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072PWGSZL\",\"sku\":\"B072PWGSZL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-ventura-mid-century-louvered-queen-bed-86-l-cherry-b072pwgszl\",\"name\":\"Rivet Ventura Mid-Century Louvered Queen Bed, 86&quot;L, Cherry\",\"description\":\"A warm cherry finish and striking louvered design will ensure enjoyment for years to come. Clean, simple lines are the hallmark of the casual Mid-century modern Ventura collection. Slat-roll construction means that a box spring is not required. 63&quot; W x 86&quot;L x 50&quot; H Solid hardwoods with mid-tone cherry finish A clean Mid-century modern style Sturdy mortise-and-tenon construction; slat roll makes box spring optional Assemble in 30 minutes or less. Wipe with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Ventura Mid-Century Louvered Queen Bed, 86&quot;L, Cherry\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81uzJT0QXSL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mk9DcN5vL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mk9DcN5vL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81e3eZekYML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81e3eZekYML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xiN7qWDnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xiN7qWDnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tRAmNGyuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tRAmNGyuL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"50.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"86.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\"