        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QJ22WQH\",\"sku\":\"B07QJ22WQH\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"aikins-modern-nightstand-32-w-glazed-mocha-b07qj22wqh\",\"name\":\"Aikins Modern Nightstand, 32&quot;W, Glazed Mocha\",\"description\":\"Make your evenings even more serene with a lovely nightstand. No bedroom set is complete without a nightstand of similar style and quality—it turns a bed into a bower. 32&quot;W x 18&quot;D x 23&quot;H Glazed mocha finish, oak veneers, select solids, champagne hardware The casual contemporary style of this collection makes it the perfect addition or update to your bedroom. One drawer offers plenty of storage for any bedside essentials. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Aikins Modern Nightstand, 32&quot;W, Glazed Mocha\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71JMnrOUqXL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71JtiKfncgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71JtiKfncgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71gKDu5QGDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71gKDu5QGDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/511qB7iyGoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/511qB7iyGoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81odLcp58aL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81odLcp58aL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71wlDznoJkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71wlDznoJkL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"23.0\",\"label\":\"in