        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07RG6ZBK6\",\"sku\":\"B07RG6ZBK6\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"solimo-dual-toned-leatherette-3-seater-sofa-red-black-b07rg6zbk6\",\"name\":\"Solimo Dual-Toned Leatherette 3 Seater Sofa (Red & Black)\",\"description\":\"Comfortable three-seater sofa made from high-quality leatherette with a sleek design in dual-toned red and black color Passed 30+ safety and quality tests and does not lose color with rubbing Passed durability testing with 100 kg on each seat and backrest for 25,000 cycles; Passed armrest stability testing with 40 kg dynamic loading for 10,000 cycles Meets Indian Standards IS 12674/ IS 5416 for performance and stringent European Safety Requirement Standard EN 12520 Warranty on manufacturing defects: 3 years Lightweight sofa for easy shifting and good ground clearance for easy cleaning below the sofa. Free from toxins and harmful chemicals like formaldehyde and AZO Dye Please note: Sofa is delivered with the legs in a detached condition. The cavity where sofa legs will be placed is protected by a plastic cap. This will be removed during assembly and replaced with sofa legs\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Solimo Dual-Toned Leatherette 3 Seater Sofa (Red & Black)\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81XiR7KrjAL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41mISu9qJkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41mISu9qJkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51jftHyo9lL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51jftHyo9lL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/619baI3ZtnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/619baI3ZtnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61ssL6cF7-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://sto