        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QHKPD2Q\",\"sku\":\"B07QHKPD2Q\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"industrial-marble-side-table-with-metal-base-18-9-w-charcoal-finish-with-a-white-top-b07qhkpd2q\",\"name\":\"Industrial Marble Side Table with Metal Base, 18.9&quot;W, Charcoal finish with a White Top\",\"description\":\"This industrial-inspired side table touts an open, charcoal finished metal base with a round marble top. The light and airy feel it adds to any room takes nothing away from its durability. Use it next to a favorite chair or couch and enjoy how it completes the room’s style with a modern flair. 18.9&quot;W x 18.9&quot;D x 22.24&quot;H This industrial side table with a round marble top and metal base in charcoal finish fits well with most modern decor. This side table looks great next to a couch or chair. No assembly required Wipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Industrial Marble Side Table with Metal Base, 18.9&quot;W, Charcoal finish with a White Top\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/713TLVUymNL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71lnRivSDBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71lnRivSDBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81o2oVtefAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81o2oVtefAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71kRjU1Wt-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71kRjU1Wt-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71fpsfBkyRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71fpsfBkyRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91oiA9QPBmL.jpg\",\"