      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B084W2RK1Z\",\"sku\":\"B084W2RK1Z\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"morgan-faux-leather-memory-swivel-barstool-42-1-h-brown-b084w2rk1z\",\"name\":\"Morgan Faux Leather Memory-Swivel Barstool, 42.1&quot;H, Brown\",\"description\":\"This barstool features a memory swivel that returns the seat to its proper position every time. The brown faux leather upholstery and button-tufted chair back give this barstool a touch of class. 20.5&quot;W x 24&quot;D x 42.1&quot;H; seat height: 29.9&quot;H; seat depth: 16.9&quot;D; seat back height: 16.1&quot;H; leg height: 26&quot;H Solid hardwood frame with vegan leather A memory-swivel mechanism means this barstool always looks tidy. Button-tufting makes this barstool stand out. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Morgan Faux Leather Memory-Swivel Barstool, 42.1&quot;H, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ALuDqqAxL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71VEIL88MwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71VEIL88MwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71WzzaY7uvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71WzzaY7uvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71SW0PXWCIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71SW0PXWCIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71WaSPkXz3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71WaSPkXz3L.jpg\"}],\"attribu