      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z8M2BW\",\"sku\":\"B075Z8M2BW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"roland-x-frame-coffee-table-36-w-pine-b075z8m2bw\",\"name\":\"Roland X-Frame Coffee Table, 36&quot;W, Pine\",\"description\":\"36&quot;L x 36&quot;W x 18&quot;H Solid pine top with metal frame Industrial, rustic and modern touches come together in a piece that blends with most décor This sturdy piece will last through years of family movie nights and entertaining guests Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This wood and metal coffee table combines elements of industrial and rustic, allowing it to blend with many styles. The solid pine wood top has a natural distressed finish, while the metal base has modern &quot;x&quot; frames on either end.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Roland X-Frame Coffee Table, 36&quot;W, Pine\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81VDBfCPBcL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-1ryXBHkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-1ryXBHkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1NoB1LtzML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1NoB1LtzML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Sz+ccwWlL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Sz+ccwWlL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B16uXDdnSYS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B16uXDdnSYS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QmWPbj-VL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QmWPbj-VL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Jxp-