      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QGWNLTV\",\"sku\":\"B07QGWNLTV\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"channel-back-leather-dining-chairs-40-h-cognac-set-of-2-b07qgwnltv\",\"name\":\"Channel-Back Leather Dining Chairs, 40&quot;H, Cognac, Set of 2\",\"description\":\"These modern dining chairs feature cognac-colored top grain leather upholstered in a ribbed design. A distinctive trim of brass nailheads embellishes the sides of these impressive chairs. 20&quot;W x 26&quot;D x 40&quot;H; seat height: 20&quot;H; seat depth: 18&quot;D; seat back height: 20&quot;H Set of 2 Top grain leather seat on a solid wood frame Open sides allow for maximum freedom of movement. This contemporary chair features a heavy filled-channel back with a decorative side trim of brass nailheads. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Channel-Back Leather Dining Chairs, 40&quot;H, Cognac, Set of 2\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81PPxGxUFSL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81QR0wQKjHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81QR0wQKjHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jRUcOjpmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jRUcOjpmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WmVQsgmdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WmVQsgmdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Clb+K6SpL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Clb+K6SpL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mWRb1iNUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mWRb