      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B086VLQ6WF\",\"sku\":\"B086VLQ6WF\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"heavy-duty-non-slip-bed-frame-with-steel-slats-easy-assembly-18-h-queen-b086vlq6wf\",\"name\":\"Heavy Duty Non-Slip Bed Frame with Steel Slats, Easy Assembly - 18&quot; H, (Queen)\",\"description\":\"Queen heavy-duty platform bed frame for use with single mattress (no box spring required); 500 pound weight capacity Durable steel slats with noise-dampening covers offer firm, evenly-placed mattress support for a quiet night's sleep 11 legs for extra support and durability; plastic protective feet and corners prevent bumps and floor damage Non-slip double-sided adhesive tape applies to slats to keep mattress in place Mattress sits directly on frame with 5mm recessed edge; 18 inch height with 16.5 inches open underneath for extra storage Easy assembly with all required tools and hardware included\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Heavy Duty Non-Slip Bed Frame with Steel Slats, Easy Assembly - 18&quot; H, (Queen)\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81aNnZWsVCL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71m9xp24LYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71m9xp24LYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71IFnYvZFZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71IFnYvZFZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81c4pLHBlKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81c4pLHBlKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81834i49dSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81834i49dSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61trZpXKULL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/pures