        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4M597B\",\"sku\":\"B07B4M597B\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"andover-modern-square-ottoman-33-w-tan-b07b4m597b\",\"name\":\"Andover Modern Square Ottoman, 33&quot;W, Tan\",\"description\":\"Wooden legs, clean lines, and box-edge cushions bring stylish sophistication to modern or transitional rooms. With a sturdy frame and springy cushioning, this ottoman is ready to withstand years as a footrest or extra seating for guests. 33&quot;W x 33&quot;D x 21&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 33&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 21&quot;H; Leg Height: 4.25&quot;H Stain-resistant polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame The streamlined shape is a hallmark of modern design Carefully crafted to ensure durability and years of use Easy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Andover Modern Square Ottoman, 33&quot;W, Tan\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1gmsiGW3RL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1h+l7F1bSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1h+l7F1bSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1557qotk0S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1557qotk0S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/910CkbXMQuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/910CkbXMQuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1R6ZLxh5SL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1R6ZLxh5SL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"36.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"24.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{