        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QGWNP4C\",\"sku\":\"B07QGWNP4C\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-contemporary-cut-out-dining-chair-33-h-pepper-b07qgwnp4c\",\"name\":\"Rivet Contemporary Cut-Out Dining Chair, 33&quot;H, Pepper\",\"description\":\"Dimensions: 22&quot;W x 23&quot;D x 33&quot;H | Seat height: 19&quot;H; seat depth: 18&quot;D; seat back height: 15&quot;H The cut-out back gives this modern chair a classic look. Stain-resistant and moisture-repellant pepper-colored fabrics blend with any color scheme and make cleanup simple. Plenty of padding and a hardwood frame with tapered legs combine into secure seating suitable for any dining room or kitchen. 98% polyester, 2% nylon fabric on solid hardwood frame A cut-out back and tapered legs give this accent chair a classic mid-century modern design. Plenty of padding makes it sturdy and comfortable to use in the dining room or anywhere else extra seating is needed. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Contemporary Cut-Out Dining Chair, 33&quot;H, Pepper\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81URCMCcqPL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Z+rxWfKZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Z+rxWfKZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KJZR+uZGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KJZR+uZGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81O5vXVntFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81O5vXVntFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nLTnkGB1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nLTnkGB1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https:/