        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075ZBW1NL\",\"sku\":\"B075ZBW1NL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-modern-microfiber-no-back-saddle-kitchen-counter-bar-stools-set-of-2-32-3-inch-height-brown-black-metal-b075zbw1nl\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Microfiber No-Back Saddle Kitchen Counter Bar Stools, Set of 2, 32.3 Inch Height, Brown, Black Metal\",\"description\":\"19.9&quot;W x 17.9&quot;D x 32.3&quot;H Microfiber fabric over hardwood frame; metal legs have black finish Along with seating, these chairs bring retro fun to your bar area Assemble in 15 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Simple no-back seats are paired with tall black metal bases for a classic Mid-century style. The microfiber has a distressed finish to give these bar stools a hint of vintage style -- but with the modern conveniences of easy cleaning and durability.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Microfiber No-Back Saddle Kitchen Counter Bar Stools, Set of 2, 32.3 Inch Height, Brown, Black Metal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71EPi5hoKaL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61eenVYTKyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61eenVYTKyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61xAsST3vqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61xAsST3vqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A11b3kmFO1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A11b3kmFO1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61H-KqlCeWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61H-KqlCeWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lHNioJWAL.jpg\"