        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z8THYY\",\"sku\":\"B075Z8THYY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bateman-casual-rustic-wood-bedroom-dresser-55-inch-wide-brown-b075z8thyy\",\"name\":\"Bateman Casual Rustic Wood Bedroom Dresser, 55 Inch Wide, Brown\",\"description\":\"55&quot;W x 17&quot;D x 35&quot;H; Leg Height: 5.75&quot; Acacia veneer, rubberwood and poplar hardwoods Mix of wood and metals create casual, rustic style Four roomy drawers for clothing; three smaller top drawers hold keys and change Easy assembly; just screw on legs Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty Let this casual dresser add the perfect touch to your rustic bedroom décor. Roomy drawers provide ample storage while the warm butterscotch finish gives the wood a reclaimed look. Aged brass hardware adds a hint of vintage style.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bateman Casual Rustic Wood Bedroom Dresser, 55 Inch Wide, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913EgYm4lTL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j8b21aYpL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j8b21aYpL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1uvZZg8ylL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1uvZZg8ylL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Kh1FGVU1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Kh1FGVU1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Q971ibXWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Q971ibXWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DgGFVsAPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DgGFVsAPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/or