      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSBJDQP\",\"sku\":\"B07HSBJDQP\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"industrial-mango-wood-round-dining-table-48-w-gunmetal-finish-b07hsbjdqp\",\"name\":\"Industrial Mango Wood Round Dining Table, 48&quot;W, Gunmetal Finish\",\"description\":\"The multi-stage French onyx finish brings depth and life to the wooden top of this round industrial dining table. The simple crossed-beam frame is coated in a gunmetal finish for a beautiful, minimalist effect. Mango wood and metal The table allows for 4 chairs comfortably, one in each section (quarter) of the base. Clean as required with a soft, damp cloth; wipe completely dry. Avoid heat vents or open windows. 48&quot;D x 48&quot;W x 30&quot;H Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Industrial Mango Wood Round Dining Table, 48&quot;W, Gunmetal Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71uJ0HsFBEL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/712dt1N0LeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/712dt1N0LeL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IgeXe7knL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IgeXe7knL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816tXslJuoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816tXslJuoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A17W6GyDi1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A17W6GyDi1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lMsB6FhpL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lMsB6FhpL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"30.0\",\"label\":\"in