        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B084ZBX1YH\",\"sku\":\"B084ZBX1YH\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rustic-solid-pine-platform-bed-queen-63-15-w-gray-b084zbx1yh\",\"name\":\"Rustic Solid Pine Platform Bed, Queen, 63.15&quot;W, Gray\",\"description\":\"This traditional platform bed provides a welcome place for rest and relaxation without the fuss of a headboard—it's perfect in the master bedroom or to use as a guest bed. The gray finish adds rustic charm to complement your decor. 63.15&quot;W x 83.15&quot;D x 12.01&quot;H Made of solid wood, manufactured wood, and metal This bed needs no box spring. This rustic design is made with natural reclaimed wood in a gray finish. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rustic Solid Pine Platform Bed, Queen, 63.15&quot;W, Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51JhsmCrZRL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81IZuFQ7NXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81IZuFQ7NXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51cHJs9o08L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51cHJs9o08L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51yP0QQwDBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51yP0QQwDBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61oGdXCqCRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61oGdXCqCRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ZDP93WdvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ZDP93WdvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71gJxY9AB