      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B071W5VCVB\",\"sku\":\"B071W5VCVB\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bradbury-chesterfield-oversized-tufted-accent-arm-chair-50-w-navy-b071w5vcvb\",\"name\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Oversized Tufted Accent Arm Chair, 50&quot;W, Navy\",\"description\":\"An updated twist on the classic Chesterfield design, this handsome tufted arm chair is as comfortable as it is eye-catching. Its sturdy design and high performance upholstery will hold up to your busy family. Solid and engineered hardwoods; polyester/nylon fabric Timeless and functional Refreshed design of a classic; extra wide seating capacity Minimal assembly; just attach legs Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Dimensions: 50&quot;W x 39&quot;D x 30.3&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Oversized Tufted Accent Arm Chair, 50&quot;W, Navy\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919rXpgiq1L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1XoUGSnXCS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1XoUGSnXCS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91a4kdy+ESL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91a4kdy+ESL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A17gFbJdkVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A17gFbJdkVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1+TuhdJnDS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1+TuhdJnDS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1gGIYQzmvS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1gGIYQzmvS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"30.31496\",\"label\":\"inche