  },
  "payload": {
    "dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Data": {
      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B08B6C3684\",\"sku\":\"B08B6C3684\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-celine-upholstered-home-office-task-chair-22-25-w-beige-with-wood-finish-renewed-b08b6c3684\",\"name\":\"Rivet Celine Upholstered Home Office Task Chair, 22.25&quot;W, Beige with Wood Finish (Renewed)\",\"description\":\"Softly tufted beige fabric is surrounded by carefully molded pale wood in a recognizable and welcome modern style that will suit home or office with equal ease. The seat merges both into the gently sloped back and the low arms. 22.25&quot;W x 26.25&quot;D x 35.75&quot;–38.75&quot;H; seat height: 19.75&quot;–22.75&quot; Molded chair accented in oak is upholstered in a neutral stone-colored fabric. This chair has a 360-degree swivel mechanism with height and tension adjustments to accommodate your work style. The tufted barrel-back design of this chair looks equally stylish in the office or in the living room as occasional seating. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Always use on firm, level ground. Do not stand on the seat or let children play with this chair. Check (and if necessary, tighten) all screws every 90 days. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Celine Upholstered Home Office Task Chair, 22.25&quot;W, Beige with Wood Finish (Renewed)\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nGI1sSbtL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91L0XK1MErL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91L0XK1MErL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81im1ZWNf3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81im1ZWNf3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cP4yyD6eL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cP4yyD6eL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage