        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QBMQB3X\",\"sku\":\"B07QBMQB3X\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-adrienne-swivel-base-contemporary-living-room-chair-29-w-leather-cognac-b07qbmqb3x\",\"name\":\"Rivet Adrienne Swivel-Base Contemporary Living-Room Chair, 29&quot;W, Leather, Cognac\",\"description\":\"Complete the contemporary ambience in your living room or office with this attractively simple swivel chair. With an eye-catching design and unique swivel base, this chair is the ideal combination of style and comfort. 29&quot;W x 30&quot;D x 32&quot;H; seat height: 18&quot;H; seat depth: 19&quot;D; seat back height: 14&quot;H; arm height: 23&quot;H; leg height: 11&quot;H Hardwood frame and metal base with 100% leather upholstery The swivel base allows you to place this chair anywhere in the room. Elegant design adds a contemporary flair to any room. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Adrienne Swivel-Base Contemporary Living-Room Chair, 29&quot;W, Leather, Cognac\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81jFBYrGeZL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81saPvFf47L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81saPvFf47L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pQe32dJwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pQe32dJwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Q+NBeur9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Q+NBeur9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VTzjIG87L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VTzjIG87L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-i