      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QBQBXV7\",\"sku\":\"B07QBQBXV7\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-contemporary-curved-back-dining-chair-35-h-aqua-b07qbqbxv7\",\"name\":\"Rivet Contemporary Curved-Back Dining Chair, 35&quot;H, Aqua\",\"description\":\"The curved back and outside channel of this dining chair create an elegant touch in any room while providing comfortable support. Aqua fabric allows a pop of color in a number of decor schemes. The solid wood frame creates a sturdy dining seat. 24&quot;W x 26&quot;D x 35&quot;H; seat height: 19&quot;H; seat depth: 18&quot;D; seat back height: 15&quot;H 100% polyester fabric on solid wood frame Curved back with outside channel No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Contemporary Curved-Back Dining Chair, 35&quot;H, Aqua\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81k8KSVuWML.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81O25kXPsuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81O25kXPsuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OSC6vpHzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OSC6vpHzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1WiQJVOAeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1WiQJVOAeL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81UK44iWXAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81UK44iWXAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HNrv5-MDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HNrv5-MDL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":