      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QFRSC83\",\"sku\":\"B07QFRSC83\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-contemporary-curved-channel-back-dining-chair-35-h-otter-grey-b07qfrsc83\",\"name\":\"Rivet Contemporary Curved Channel-Back Dining Chair, 35&quot;H, Otter Grey\",\"description\":\"The curved back of this dining chair provides support, while the channel design creates a textured look that will enhance the decor of many dining spaces. Otter-grey upholstery fits any number of design themes, and durable fabric means easy care. A solid wood frame creates a stable seat. 23&quot;W x 25&quot;D x 35&quot;H; seat height: 19&quot;H; seat depth: 18&quot;D; seat back height: 16&quot;H 100% polyester fabric on solid wood frame Curved back with outside channel design No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Contemporary Curved Channel-Back Dining Chair, 35&quot;H, Otter Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81NeyNDPniL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91msARJmtCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91msARJmtCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711O0vJgCGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711O0vJgCGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1t2y6gCgIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1t2y6gCgIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/812ZkbXrFxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/812ZkbXrFxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/712AVpzveaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/712AVpzv