        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4W5WY7\",\"sku\":\"B07B4W5WY7\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"prudence-tufted-queen-bed-66-w-curious-charcoal-b07b4w5wy7\",\"name\":\"Prudence Tufted Queen Bed, 66&quot;W, Curious Charcoal\",\"description\":\"This bed adds classic style to any space. A hand-tufted headboard adds an interesting design detail. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. This item is made to order just for you 66&quot;W x 92&quot;D x 56&quot;H; Legs: 5.5&quot;H; Footboard: 18&quot;H Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame The bed is fully upholstered on the front and back of the headboard and footboard. Cross-slat support system with adjustable levelers included. Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Prudence Tufted Queen Bed, 66&quot;W, Curious Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91SZBS938jL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91eHAp+uXjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91eHAp+uXjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1NRVDY2D6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1NRVDY2D6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1lFqn9b9NL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1lFqn9b9NL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A11uv5ghCkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A11uv5ghCkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qmJ7RtWDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qmJ7RtWDL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\"