        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7HFYKH\",\"sku\":\"B07B7HFYKH\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"alicia-contemporary-wood-office-desk-chair-with-wheels-38-h-oak-b07b7hfykh\",\"name\":\"Alicia Contemporary Wood Office Desk Chair with Wheels, 38&quot;H, Oak\",\"description\":\"A mid-century inspired chair is refreshed with warm wood finishes that handsomely accent the upholstered back and seat. A wooden pedestal on casters completes the look. Modern updates include adjustments for height and tilt as well as 360 degree swivel. 24.2&quot;W x 28&quot;D x 38.4&quot;-41.3&quot;H Hardwood frame and base; foam cushion with linen upholstery; metal casters Mid-century minimalist, retro style 360 degree swivel function; height and tilt of chair can be adjusted Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Assembly in 30 minutes or less; insert casters onto base\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Alicia Contemporary Wood Office Desk Chair with Wheels, 38&quot;H, Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91w6JPQMZAL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MggScnIiL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MggScnIiL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1F9qw0YWRS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1F9qw0YWRS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fBuh+WzaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fBuh+WzaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vZep0HtEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vZep0HtEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yLrJ95RjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yLrJ95RjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\"