      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSHTN13\",\"sku\":\"B07HSHTN13\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"classic-spindle-back-wood-counter-height-barstool-37-5-h-set-of-2-black-b07hshtn13\",\"name\":\"Classic Spindle-Back Wood Counter-Height Barstool, 37.5&quot;H, Set of 2, Black\",\"description\":\"This set of 2 traditional counter-height bar stools features an updated take on the classic spindle-backed style, lending an air of homespun charm to any setting. The beautiful glossy black finish adds the final touch of sophistication. Overall: 19”W x 22.5”D x 37.5”H; seat height 24&quot;, seat depth 15.37&quot; Comfortable, curved wood spindle back, flat seat and sturdy legs made of solid rubber wood. Avoid moisture. Wipe away dust and debris with a soft dry cloth. Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Free returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Classic Spindle-Back Wood Counter-Height Barstool, 37.5&quot;H, Set of 2, Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71HrywAPiDL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tpDhNrBvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tpDhNrBvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71XYKY2z3wL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71XYKY2z3wL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71A9yKvJDhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71A9yKvJDhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GzA7TYiYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GzA7TYiYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81tAtqCBviL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81tAtqCBviL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{