      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HZ5N1YK\",\"sku\":\"B07HZ5N1YK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"clayton-reclining-contemporary-fabric-living-room-chair-30-w-blue-b07hz5n1yk\",\"name\":\"Clayton Reclining Contemporary Fabric Living-Room Chair, 30&quot;W, Blue\",\"description\":\"With an ideal blend of style and comfort, this recliner is made to order just for you. The tasteful fabric in Blue and wooden frame adds a contemporary flair, the perfect addition to any room. Sturdy wooden frame with stain-resistant fabric; no assembly required The tight, fixed back and seat cushions ensure durability and comfort; fits perfectly in a living-room corner or beside a couch or bed. Product Dimensions: 30&quot;W x 39&quot;D x 41&quot;H; seat height: 20&quot;H; seat depth: 22&quot;D; seat back height: 41&quot;H; arm height: 24&quot;H; leg height: 6.5&quot;H Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Clayton Reclining Contemporary Fabric Living-Room Chair, 30&quot;W, Blue\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91UUCgWGPDL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KD9vNhPuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KD9vNhPuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91faaMjtByL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91faaMjtByL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9115qCIodkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9115qCIodkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1+wGGkRG8S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1+wGGkRG8S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18hAoPht6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-image