      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z8KXDT\",\"sku\":\"B075Z8KXDT\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"larson-industrial-wood-metal-round-coffee-table-33-d-walnut-b075z8kxdt\",\"name\":\"Larson Industrial Wood & Metal Round Coffee Table, 33&quot;D, Walnut\",\"description\":\"This round coffee table with a solid pine wood top and shelf has a natural distressed finish, while the metal legs and trim have a darker brown matte finish. The lower shelf provides you with ever-important space to store a laptop and remotes. 18&quot;H x 33&quot;Diameter Solid pine wood top and shelf with walnut finish; metal legs Industrial and rustic touches allow this table to blend with many styles. Convenient lower shelf for extra storage Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Larson Industrial Wood & Metal Round Coffee Table, 33&quot;D, Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91inh1mXkNL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yiYGinz5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yiYGinz5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PwyroSMSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PwyroSMSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1bWiTB1O1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1bWiTB1O1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cSU4hXYtL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1cSU4hXYtL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9193vJmKXNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9193vJmKXNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresig