        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073GBFBR9\",\"sku\":\"B073GBFBR9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-sweeping-arm-accent-chair-28-w-oxford-stripe-b073gbfbr9\",\"name\":\"Modern Sweeping Arm Accent Chair, 28&quot;W, Oxford Stripe\",\"description\":\"This graceful chair will make a pleasing addition to any style of room. A soft sweep of the arms and clean lines make it modern, but striped linen-look fabric and turned wood legs with espresso-colored stain give it a classic look as well. 28”W x 29”D x 34”H Solid pine with linen/cotton fabric Modern with classic touches Will blend with classic and transitional style rooms 4 easy-to-attach legs Made-to-order Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Sweeping Arm Accent Chair, 28&quot;W, Oxford Stripe\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+-Phvzf3L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1618Xpdo9S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1618Xpdo9S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A150okceM+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A150okceM+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B18lV2QMQDS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B18lV2QMQDS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1L+ddxmxfS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1L+ddxmxfS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1L6OF6-p4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1L6OF6-p4L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"34.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"va