      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X43FDK\",\"sku\":\"B075X43FDK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-lawson-modern-angled-ottoman-27-w-dove-b075x43fdk\",\"name\":\"Rivet Lawson Modern Angled Ottoman, 27&quot;W, Dove\",\"description\":\"You'll enjoy kicking up your tired feet, as well as always having a handy extra seat, with this sophisticated ottoman. Sleek lines with tapered legs give it urbane, mid-century influenced style. Available in leather and fabric upholstery. This item is made to order just for you 27&quot;W x 20&quot;D x 16&quot;H Sturdy hardwood frame and legs with 100% polyester upholstery. Firm nylon webbing makes cushion resilient Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. No assembly. Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. If needed, spot clean with a damp cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Lawson Modern Angled Ottoman, 27&quot;W, Dove\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91sklHfFHXL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1XYPC-HNdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1XYPC-HNdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IkF+otxBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1IkF+otxBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919ps+MYc0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919ps+MYc0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kV1AWe0UL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kV1AWe0UL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"16.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"27.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"20.0\",