        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QDNRBC8\",\"sku\":\"B07QDNRBC8\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"leather-parsons-dining-chair-39-h-black-set-of-2-b07qdnrbc8\",\"name\":\"Leather Parsons Dining Chair, 39&quot;H, Black, Set of 2\",\"description\":\"This parsons-style chair features an eye-catching brushed-brass nail border along the sides and seat. Chic black leather upholstery can blend into a number of decoration schemes or become a standout feature of a dining space. A solid hardwood frame offers stability and durability to the piece. 20&quot;W x 25&quot;D x 39&quot;H; seat height: 19&quot;H; seat depth: 19&quot;D; seat back height: 16&quot;H Set of 2 Solid wood frame; top grain leather Simple parsons chair with brushed-brass nails No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Leather Parsons Dining Chair, 39&quot;H, Black, Set of 2\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71h-LE-IQYL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816BSqax-rL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816BSqax-rL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7167UO98YmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7167UO98YmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mjKiIw4yL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mjKiIw4yL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71SGgkRe1fL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71SGgkRe1fL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71w3rDRkUuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71w3rDRkUuL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"