      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0856F5NYC\",\"sku\":\"B0856F5NYC\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-solid-pine-wood-platform-bed-queen-59-92-w-antique-espresso-b0856f5nyc\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Solid Pine Wood Platform Bed, Queen, 59.92&quot;W, Antique Espresso\",\"description\":\"A modern reimagining of a classic design, this queen-sized bed is as comfortable as it is eye-catching. This platform bed offers strong lines and uncluttered appeal, suggesting restful nights and bright mornings. 59.92&quot;W x 80.08&quot;L x 14.02&quot;H; underbed clearance: 12&quot; Made of solid wood, manufactured wood, and metal This bed needs no box spring. Espresso-stained pine blends antique style with modern appeal. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Solid Pine Wood Platform Bed, Queen, 59.92&quot;W, Antique Espresso\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71D+CrJfzKL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jCNYIi5JL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jCNYIi5JL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BHoFbU8oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BHoFbU8oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71faqsNaBSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71faqsNaBSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XEem1HxbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XEem1HxbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71HxCfeUHjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71HxCfeUHjL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\