      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B082Q981GL\",\"sku\":\"B082Q981GL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"troy-upholstered-accent-chair-33-w-ash-gray-b082q981gl\",\"name\":\"Troy Upholstered Accent Chair, 33&quot;W, Ash Gray\",\"description\":\"This gray upholstered accent chair brings a stylish charm to any room. Durable fabric-covered foam seat cushions provide lasting comfort, and the modern design complements any decor. This will be your favorite spot to curl up and read a book or enjoy your favorite hot beverage. This item is made to order just for you. Overall: 33&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 34&quot;H; seat height: 22&quot;H; seat depth: 20&quot;D; seat back height: 12&quot;H; arm height: 24&quot;H; leg height: 5.625&quot;H Sturdy wood frame and legs; life-friendly performance fabric; foam seat cushions Removable and reversible seat and back cushions ensure durability and comfort. Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. Spot clean if needed. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Troy Upholstered Accent Chair, 33&quot;W, Ash Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Knzv3gzPL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nXBtDOmWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nXBtDOmWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816t-3d3y6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816t-3d3y6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81muwqwDgyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81muwqwDgyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81w59q-8QDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81w59q-8QDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916oR5x7MWL.jpg\