      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QFRS812\",\"sku\":\"B07QFRS812\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-contemporary-dining-chair-35-h-pepper-set-of-2-b07qfrs812\",\"name\":\"Rivet Contemporary Dining Chair, 35&quot;H, Pepper, Set of 2\",\"description\":\"These contemporary upholstered dining chairs feature a high, curved back for maximum comfort and support. Sleek, pepper-gray seats contrast with walnut-brown legs. 20&quot;W x 24&quot;D x 35&quot;H; seat height: 20&quot;H; seat depth: 17&quot;D; seat back height: 15&quot;H Set of 2 Stain-resistant upholstered fabric over a solid hardwood frame This chair has open sides for ease of movement and sturdy hardwood legs for support and stability. A distinctive contemporary design is seen in the curved back and sleek upholstery of this chair. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Contemporary Dining Chair, 35&quot;H, Pepper, Set of 2\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Tt1dN9TBL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wLRUq+8vL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wLRUq+8vL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+lY5dvZCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+lY5dvZCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/912osC0-ztL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/912osC0-ztL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ir+B+HOWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ir+B+HOWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711Eug8ZufL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/or