      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X4VWF9\",\"sku\":\"B075X4VWF9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"leila-tufted-living-room-sofa-couch-88-w-smoky-teal-b075x4vwf9\",\"name\":\"Leila Tufted Living Room Sofa Couch, 88&quot;W, Smoky Teal\",\"description\":\"This item is made to order just for you 88&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 31&quot;H Solid wood frame and legs with durable fabric upholstery. The tight, fixed back and removable/reversible cushions ensure durability and comfort. Treat yourself to luxury in this striking, vintage look sofa. With solid wood legs in a dark walnut finish, plush upholstery and a low, curved tufted back, it exudes opulence. Three removable/reversible seat cushions ensure many years of use. Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Leila Tufted Living Room Sofa Couch, 88&quot;W, Smoky Teal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91UMjSs5XgL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91LlW4o+tXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91LlW4o+tXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A11i7JV5oxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A11i7JV5oxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B17PiPFEdfS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B17PiPFEdfS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1I1JSeKUkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1I1JSeKUkL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"31.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"88.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"lab