      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSJY1JM\",\"sku\":\"B07HSJY1JM\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-decatur-modern-faux-leather-kitchen-counter-height-stool-37-h-grey-b07hsjy1jm\",\"name\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Faux Leather Kitchen Counter-Height Stool, 37&quot;H, Grey\",\"description\":\"This beautiful modern counter-height barstool features a bold squared-off design for both the seat and legs. The metal frame, supported by an H-spreader bar encompasses a plush, backed, armless seat upholstered in durable faux leather. Overall: 22&quot;D x 18&quot;W x 37&quot;H. Seat height: 26&quot; Solid wooden frame and black metal legs combine for maximum style and support Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Arrives fully assembled. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Faux Leather Kitchen Counter-Height Stool, 37&quot;H, Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71sxticGd4L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7133XK+gGYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7133XK+gGYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91HIzXYYjbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91HIzXYYjbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71MfTquZCqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71MfTquZCqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RZP-aDM4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RZP-aDM4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Jv0HiPnCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Jv0HiPnCL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values