      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSNQW37\",\"sku\":\"B07HSNQW37\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rylee-modern-acacia-wood-6-drawer-bedroom-dresser-61-w-gray-wash-acacia-b07hsnqw37\",\"name\":\"Rylee Modern Acacia Wood 6-Drawer Bedroom Dresser, 61&quot;W, Gray-Wash Acacia\",\"description\":\"Add a modern flair to your home with this beautiful dresser. Made from solid acacia with a subtle gray-wash finish, this dresser perfectly complements most home-décor styles. Its 4 elegant but strong legs keep the dresser sturdy, and its 6 drawers provide plenty of storage options. 61&quot;W x 17.7&quot;D x 31.5&quot;H Subtle gray-washed distressed finish and clean lines create an attractive modern look. This dresser has 6 soft-closing drawers. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Solid acacia with acacia veneer on back panel, shelves, and drawer bottoms\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rylee Modern Acacia Wood 6-Drawer Bedroom Dresser, 61&quot;W, Gray-Wash Acacia\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Zunj4DLFL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916Bpa0WR3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/916Bpa0WR3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-mVGeGH2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-mVGeGH2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1ShIdV8OMS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1ShIdV8OMS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91V-lIsUM-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91V-lIsUM-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OPc50RVTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A