        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z8629N\",\"sku\":\"B075Z8629N\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-global-hexagonal-elm-dining-table-47-2-w-natural-wood-b075z8629n\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Global Hexagonal Elm Dining Table, 47.2&quot;W, Natural Wood\",\"description\":\"Serve up a side dish of amazing style to any guests who dine at this six-sided table. Handcrafted of sustainably sourced materials, the table top and pedestal add distinctive rustic, modern and global touches to your home. 47.2&quot;W x 47.2&quot;D x 29.9&quot;H Sustainably sourced elm wood A handsome piece that blends with modern, rustic or industrial decor Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Global Hexagonal Elm Dining Table, 47.2&quot;W, Natural Wood\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vzLr7nHNL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kkEoY7VLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kkEoY7VLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vTb6maZXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91vTb6maZXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sspFeaE0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1sspFeaE0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1cR89cpI5S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1cR89cpI5S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914djlwEgIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914djlwEgIL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"29.9\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width