        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4GXWZZ\",\"sku\":\"B07B4GXWZZ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"canfield-traditional-recliner-30-w-espresso-b07b4gxwzz\",\"name\":\"Canfield Traditional Recliner, 30&quot;W, Espresso\",\"description\":\"30.3&quot;W x 36.6&quot;D x 41.3&quot;H Polyester fabric on wood frame Modern and classic touches come together for a transitional style A push-back recliner that's attractive when fully upright, too. Assembly in 15 minutes or less; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Traditional button tufting combined with modern straight arms results in a transitional style. This recliner is comfy and soft to sit in when upright, then pushes back, with a pop-up foot rest, when you're ready to truly relax.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Canfield Traditional Recliner, 30&quot;W, Espresso\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1t++Fk6L-S.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1W-Q+qXK3S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1W-Q+qXK3S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1bxUHLi1gL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1bxUHLi1gL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mYt0X5tLL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mYt0X5tLL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1-wSWWqu+S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1-wSWWqu+S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1dZSFq+y1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1dZSFq+y1L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"33.25\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"