        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B5127YK\",\"sku\":\"B07B5127YK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bridgewater-scalloped-queen-headboard-71-w-curious-pearl-b07b5127yk\",\"name\":\"Bridgewater Scalloped Queen Headboard, 71&quot;W, Curious Pearl\",\"description\":\"This headboard adds classic style to any space. The scalloped corners and top stitch detailing complete the look. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. This item is made to order just for you Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame The headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. 71&quot;W x 5&quot;D x 51&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bridgewater Scalloped Queen Headboard, 71&quot;W, Curious Pearl\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Nj95+maWL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1YFwTi2KqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1YFwTi2KqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A148q98va0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A148q98va0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91eYPFCD0lL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91eYPFCD0lL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-Y3fyikuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-Y3fyikuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1P49M6umeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1P49M6umeL