        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073GGGF7H\",\"sku\":\"B073GGGF7H\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-martin-modern-storage-bench-39-w-scopic-black-b073gggf7h\",\"name\":\"Rivet Martin Modern Storage Bench, 39&quot;W, Scopic Black\",\"description\":\"You're having friends over, but didn't have time to clean first. No problem - this storage ottoman is a great place to quickly stash clutter. In addition to its functionality, it's a stylish piece when closed. NOTE: This item is made-to-order, please expect an increased shipping time. 39” W x 19” D x 19” H Solid pine wood with a linen/cotton blend fabric Contemporary but classic A great ottoman for the living room or storage for blankets in a bedroom Simple assembly; just attach legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Martin Modern Storage Bench, 39&quot;W, Scopic Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91pp+JkNlbL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1gREVsXCIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1gREVsXCIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1NIvF4CM6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1NIvF4CM6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qhmBy7w7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qhmBy7w7L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"19.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"19.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"39.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"weight\",\"label\":\"Weight\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"38.0\",\"label\":\"pounds\"}]},{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"label\":\"Keywords\",\"values\":[{\