        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B082QCW3NJ\",\"sku\":\"B082QCW3NJ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-bigelow-modern-sofa-with-square-legs-89-4-w-light-grey-b082qcw3nj\",\"name\":\"Rivet Bigelow Modern Sofa with Square Legs, 89.4&quot;W, Light Grey\",\"description\":\"Clean lines and a light-grey color combine to give this sofa a timeless feel sure to become the key feature in any space. You won’t sacrifice comfort for style with this piece. The solid wood frame and square legs form a sturdy foundation, and foam-padded cushions slope for added back support. 89.4&quot;W x 37.4&quot;D x 30.7&quot;H; seat height: 18.1&quot;H; seat depth: 22.8&quot;D; seat back height: 18.1&quot;H; arm height: 24&quot;H; leg height: 5.9&quot;H Solid wood frame, plinth, and tapered legs A sturdy, solid wood frame and soft, foam-padded cushions bring a mix of comfort and support to any seating area. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Bigelow Modern Sofa with Square Legs, 89.4&quot;W, Light Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71uNcjnzLEL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1zPK0B5FmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1zPK0B5FmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91weRj8fA-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91weRj8fA-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JDkBlrgEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JDkBlrgEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71AZ8WOVX2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71AZ8WOVX2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/