      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B78G443\",\"sku\":\"B07B78G443\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"jon-casual-farmhouse-expandable-wood-dining-table-90-w-birch-b07b78g443\",\"name\":\"Jon Casual Farmhouse Expandable Wood Dining Table, 90&quot;W, Birch\",\"description\":\"40&quot;L x 74-90&quot;W x 30&quot;H Solid hardwood made of poplar; birch veneer A simple design and rustic finish make it casual and ideal for a modern farmhouse décor A great table for dining or homework; self-storing leaf Assembly in 30 minutes or less; attach base to top Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This handsome rustic rectangular table is ideal for a lake house -- or for adding a warm natural touch to your home. Solid hardwood and sturdy construction will last through many family dinners. An extra leaf allows you to accommodate more guests.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Jon Casual Farmhouse Expandable Wood Dining Table, 90&quot;W, Birch\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81jWpEUA5JL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71k1zbYtLSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71k1zbYtLSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913XtEx5rrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913XtEx5rrL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ErsZVGcWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ErsZVGcWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B10qGdxh2kS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B10qGdxh2kS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919m6Hzjl6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919m6Hzjl6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.google