        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B074KLFZRM\",\"sku\":\"B074KLFZRM\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"parson-wood-side-end-table-26-l-oak-b074klfzrm\",\"name\":\"Parson Wood Side End Table, 26&quot;L, Oak\",\"description\":\"26&quot;L x 24&quot;W x 24&quot;H Solid wood with beautiful oak finish Clean modern lines and rustic finish combined for a transitional style The roomy drawer is perfect for holding extra keys, chargers, and pens. No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Enjoy years of use with this attractive and practical solid wood end table, complete with a smooth gliding drawer and an open shelf underneath. Offering both pleasing design and function, it is the perfect side table for a reading lamp or framed photos.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Parson Wood Side End Table, 26&quot;L, Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kuKSi1OTL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Nzl2hNrfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Nzl2hNrfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rqMyHZiaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rqMyHZiaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Er7G2hoQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Er7G2hoQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jbxQV0CeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jbxQV0CeL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"26.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"24.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"24.0\",\"label\":\"inche