        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X33SNC\",\"sku\":\"B075X33SNC\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"leila-tufted-living-room-loveseat-sofa-couch-69-w-charcoal-b075x33snc\",\"name\":\"Leila Tufted Living Room Loveseat Sofa Couch, 69&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"description\":\"This item is made to order just for you 69&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 31&quot;H Solid wood frame and legs with durable fabric upholstery. The tight, fixed back and removable/reversible cushions ensure durability and comfort. Treat yourself to luxury in this striking, vintage look loveseat. With solid wood legs in a dark walnut finish, plush upholstery and a low, curved tufted back, it exudes opulence. Two removable/reversible seat cushions ensure many years of use. Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Leila Tufted Living Room Loveseat Sofa Couch, 69&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j2WEOvRmL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1nG2ez5HaS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1nG2ez5HaS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91q2s0P+0KL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91q2s0P+0KL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cwNfNJEHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cwNfNJEHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1NkuWNG1fS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1NkuWNG1fS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"31.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"69.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"