        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B086VY51CS\",\"sku\":\"B086VY51CS\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rowena-upholstered-swivel-chair-38-w-blue-b086vy51cs\",\"name\":\"Rowena Upholstered Swivel Chair, 38&quot;W, Blue\",\"description\":\"This sleek and modern swivel chair will be a welcome and comfortable addition to a living room or den. The smooth gliding function and low-sloping arms allow maximum freedom of movement. Plush blue upholstery offers durability and easy cleaning. The seat cushion is reversible for longer wear. This item is made to order just for you 38&quot;W x 39&quot;D x 34&quot;H; seat height: 19&quot;H; seat depth: 24&quot;D; back height: 31&quot;H; arm height: 16&quot;H Sturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric Smooth swivel function makes this chair more versatile. Seat cushion is removable and reversible. No assembly required Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. Spot clean if needed. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rowena Upholstered Swivel Chair, 38&quot;W, Blue\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91iWg6V3QhL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91KknGkH60L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91KknGkH60L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811G0XiBJUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811G0XiBJUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kVlPryu+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91kVlPryu+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91iL5JrQTFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91iL5JrQTFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1rDNGcMuVS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage