      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X65R5M\",\"sku\":\"B075X65R5M\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"cameron-classic-ottoman-31-w-natural-b075x65r5m\",\"name\":\"Cameron Classic Ottoman, 31&quot;W, Natural\",\"description\":\"This classic ottoman provides elegant style along with a place to rest tired feet or a tray of snacks. Turned wood spindle legs, smooth fabric and rounded edges are finished off with metal casters, making it easy to move from room to room. This item is made to order just for you 31&quot;W x 26&quot;D x 18&quot;H 55% linen/45% rayon fabric; wood legs with dark walnut finish and metal casters. A handsome piece that functions as a foot rest or place for a snack tray Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Cameron Classic Ottoman, 31&quot;W, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/911oX+g0YqL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91dyQMrqUNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91dyQMrqUNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BUnZnBbaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BUnZnBbaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914aVKtb7JL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914aVKtb7JL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1tSEKG3z2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1tSEKG3z2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91oVkc8QdVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91oVkc8QdVL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"18.0\"