        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B78M4C4\",\"sku\":\"B07B78M4C4\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-ian-mid-century-modern-industrial-wood-dining-table-storage-brown-b07b78m4c4\",\"name\":\"Rivet Ian Mid-Century Modern Industrial Wood Dining Table, Storage, Brown\",\"description\":\"Retro style meets practicality in this dining chair. With no fabric to stain, it's easy to keep clean. The rounded back is curved for comfort, while slanted legs complete a silhouette that is the epitome of mid-century modern style. 22.125&quot;L x 19.5&quot;W x 32.5&quot;H Hardwood legs and seat; plywood back is reinforced with steel Fun retro design is a style statement Easy to care for and durable Assembly in 15-30 minute; just bolt on legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Ian Mid-Century Modern Industrial Wood Dining Table, Storage, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81z85xwwZPL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816l0jsT+ML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816l0jsT+ML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91S7KB6hNBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91S7KB6hNBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1DaPF-hjRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1DaPF-hjRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rLYX-Uv-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rLYX-Uv-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HxgTfYzdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HxgTfYzdL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"32