      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075YP3BD8\",\"sku\":\"B075YP3BD8\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bergen-tufted-kitchen-dining-room-table-farmhouse-chairs-38-6-h-set-of-2-slate-grey-wood-oak-b075yp3bd8\",\"name\":\"Bergen Tufted Kitchen Dining Room Table Farmhouse Chairs, 38.6&quot;H, Set of 2, Slate Grey, Wood Oak\",\"description\":\"These lovely chairs combine Mid-century tufted backs with traditional elegantly curved legs. Performance fabric makes them easy to clean and durable for a busy family's wear and tear, and solid catalpa legs are sturdy and stable. 25.2&quot;W x 21.3&quot;D x 38.6&quot;H 95% polyester/5% nylon on hardwood frame; solid rubberwood legs; firm resilient padding Foam padding and elastic suspension system helps keep seat firm and resilient No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bergen Tufted Kitchen Dining Room Table Farmhouse Chairs, 38.6&quot;H, Set of 2, Slate Grey, Wood Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81uIUVnPcTL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B10ZhoHTHJS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B10ZhoHTHJS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1kwMP7ZDEL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1kwMP7ZDEL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91EtHxn9-3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91EtHxn9-3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814etBlyOmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814etBlyOmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1OVMZU+PeS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/orig