        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B081HMS8YK\",\"sku\":\"B081HMS8YK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bonded-leather-big-tall-executive-office-computer-desk-chair-350-pound-capacity-black-b081hms8yk\",\"name\":\"Bonded Leather Big & Tall Executive Office Computer Desk Chair, 350-Pound Capacity - Black\",\"description\":\"High-back executive chair for big and tall users; commercial-grade components; supports up to 350 pounds Upholstered in bonded brown leather, curved arm rests Comfortable tilt with infinite locking adjustment for setting chair to preferred angle; 360-degree swivel; smooth-rolling casters Pneumatic control handle for raising/lowering the seat; seat adjusts from 18.75 to 22.25 inches high Measures 27.25 by 29.5 by 47 inches overall (WxDxH); assembly required; 1 year limited warranty BIFMA Certified\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bonded Leather Big & Tall Executive Office Computer Desk Chair, 350-Pound Capacity - Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/31/31K1IYrkoQL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/31/31HA1hjOIeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/31/31HA1hjOIeL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41F6hJdiLGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41F6hJdiLGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41me5mGRXTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41me5mGRXTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41jBk5pXH+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41jBk5pXH+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41i8LEHxQ7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41i8LEHxQ7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.