      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QC85YBY\",\"sku\":\"B07QC85YBY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-upholstered-high-back-swivel-chair-25-2-w-beige-b07qc85yby\",\"name\":\"Modern Upholstered High-Back Swivel Chair, 25.2&quot;W, Beige\",\"description\":\"With a tall back and low-sloping arms, this modern captain's chair in a usefully neutral beige brings a distinctive flair to your desk or to the conference room. The adjustable height and tilt mechanism provide maximum comfort. 25.2&quot;W x 24.4&quot;D x 41.3–44.3&quot;H Fabric upholstery over plywood and metal frame; metal legs with rollers This modern chair with adjustable height has a 360-degree swivel mechanism; a tilt lock; and waterproof and stain-resistant fabric upholstery. The beige linen upholstery lends an air of refinement to this high-backed modern swivel chair. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Upholstered High-Back Swivel Chair, 25.2&quot;W, Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81MBbt7HQyL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1flT29Kz7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1flT29Kz7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711yhPEE9hL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711yhPEE9hL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91aLSzE9OnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91aLSzE9OnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81T6qCK8FOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81T6qCK8FOL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qFhrGlXcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://s