      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X4R4LM\",\"sku\":\"B075X4R4LM\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-aiden-tufted-mid-century-velvet-bench-seat-sofa-without-side-pillows-86-6-w-hunter-green-b075x4r4lm\",\"name\":\"Rivet Aiden Tufted Mid-Century Velvet Bench Seat Sofa, Without Side Pillows, 86.6&quot;W, Hunter Green\",\"description\":\"This sleek, Mid-century inspired velvet sofa is designed to impress. A long fixed bench seat cushion, two back cushions, and tapered wood legs provide just the right mix of sophistication with a contemporary edge. 86.6&quot;W x 36.2”D x 30.3”H 100% polyester; solid hardwood frame; tapered wood legs Removable and reversible back cushions for easy cleaning Simple leg assembly. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Aiden Tufted Mid-Century Velvet Bench Seat Sofa, Without Side Pillows, 86.6&quot;W, Hunter Green\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FxtXFTPPL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18BrRtjNjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18BrRtjNjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81IPWwkHZxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81IPWwkHZxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1vVyruoBfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1vVyruoBfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Izabmw72L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Izabmw72L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1PAJJB4dAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1PAJJB4dAL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\