        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7B4JTW\",\"sku\":\"B07B7B4JTW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"jon-casual-farmhouse-wood-dining-chair-40-h-pack-of-2-beige-b07b7b4jtw\",\"name\":\"Jon Casual Farmhouse Wood Dining Chair, 40&quot;H, Pack of 2, Beige\",\"description\":\"24.6&quot;W x 23.5&quot;D x 40&quot;H; Seat Height: 19&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 18.6&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 21&quot;H; Arm Height: 25&quot;H Made of hardwood comprised of 100% reclaimed fir A simple, natural style that works with modern farmhouse décor A dining chair that can be used at the kitchen table or used for extra seating Assembly in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Reclaimed fir has been fashioned into a dining chair that defines simple rustic beauty. Natural wood tones will make your space warm and inviting, while sturdy construction will last through many gatherings. Pairs perfectly with the Woodsy Dining Table.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Jon Casual Farmhouse Wood Dining Chair, 40&quot;H, Pack of 2, Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QVA80k5fL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1I2m0dNi6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1I2m0dNi6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91z+KEFgxKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91z+KEFgxKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1M-TF-sbVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1M-TF-sbVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91len5hGlZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91len5hGlZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919cH9MA0RL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapi