      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073WR319C\",\"sku\":\"B073WR319C\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"foldable-14-metal-platform-bed-frame-with-tool-free-assembly-no-box-spring-needed-twin-b073wr319c\",\"name\":\"Foldable, 14&quot; Metal Platform Bed Frame with Tool-Free Assembly, No Box Spring Needed - Twin\",\"description\":\"Product Dimensions: 75&quot; L x 39&quot; W x 14&quot; H | Weight: 26.3 pounds Designed for sleepers up to 250 pounds Twin platform bed frame offers a quiet, noise-free, supportive foundation for a mattress. No box spring needed Folding mechanism makes the frame easy to store and move in tight spaces Provides extra under-the-bed storage space with a vertical clearance of about 13 inches Fast, easy setup—no tools required Made of durable steel with a sleek black finish\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Foldable, 14&quot; Metal Platform Bed Frame with Tool-Free Assembly, No Box Spring Needed - Twin\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/719rtWQoQYL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51k8TFkcjrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51k8TFkcjrL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51SO-f2+SGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51SO-f2+SGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61dJgRQBq0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61dJgRQBq0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71zbnU9gmmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71zbnU9gmmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61bbJA9+VvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61bbJA9+VvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/p