      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7GNFYW\",\"sku\":\"B07B7GNFYW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-edgemont-contemporary-office-desk-swivel-chair-24-h-zebra-chevron-b07b7gnfyw\",\"name\":\"Rivet Edgemont Contemporary Office Desk Swivel Chair, 24&quot;H, Zebra Chevron\",\"description\":\"At first glance, this mid-century modern-inspired piece appears to be a simple chair, but it actually swivels 360 degrees on a wood base with angled legs. A grey and white chevron pattern that will blend with modern decor. 21.3&quot;W x 22.8&quot;D x 24.3&quot;H Hardwood base with polyester upholstery Mid-century minimalist, retro style 360 degree swivel function Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Assembly in 15 minutes or less; simply screw seat cushion to seat plate\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Edgemont Contemporary Office Desk Swivel Chair, 24&quot;H, Zebra Chevron\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Nh-x+boJL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1HPUu+qXAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1HPUu+qXAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1vF5FvVfIS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1vF5FvVfIS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91J9v4gnh4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91J9v4gnh4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1pns29Th2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1pns29Th2L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"34.25\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"21.26\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"va