        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7GB7BZ\",\"sku\":\"B07B7GB7BZ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-modern-white-marble-and-metal-side-end-table-17-w-black-amp-marble-b07b7gb7bz\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern White Marble and Metal Side End Table, 17&quot;W, Black &amp; Marble\",\"description\":\"Two iron trapezoids form a sturdy base for the lovely white marble top. This side table will be a handsome conversation piece along with providing a place for a small lamp or a few favorite photos. Its compact design will fit nicely in small spaces. 17.88&quot;W x 17.88&quot;D x 17&quot;H Marble top with iron base Stark contrasting colors and geometric design give this a totally modern flair A compact design great for a small space beside a sofa No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern White Marble and Metal Side End Table, 17&quot;W, Black &amp; Marble\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81CijUMMC7L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1p6m3KuzQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1p6m3KuzQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81g4ncSZ9KL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81g4ncSZ9KL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81rey5DCyCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81rey5DCyCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yDK7GT5nL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yDK7GT5nL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81G2BwDoIwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81G2BwDoIwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\