        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4GSNB1\",\"sku\":\"B07B4GSNB1\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"andover-modern-rectangle-ottoman-32-w-linen-b07b4gsnb1\",\"name\":\"Andover Modern Rectangle Ottoman, 32&quot;W, Linen\",\"description\":\"Wooden legs, clean lines, and box-edge cushions bring stylish sophistication to modern or transitional rooms. With a sturdy frame and springy cushioning, this ottoman is ready to withstand years as a footrest or extra seating for guests. 32&quot;W x 25&quot;D x 21&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 25&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 21&quot;H; Leg Height: 4.25&quot;H Cotton/polyester blend fabric on hardwood pine frame The streamlined shape is a hallmark of modern design Carefully crafted to ensure durability and years of use Easy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Andover Modern Rectangle Ottoman, 32&quot;W, Linen\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FPTL0TQHL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16xvVn+sQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A16xvVn+sQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91awsZXr7rL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91awsZXr7rL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KbB6w56mL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1KbB6w56mL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OF3sqVpOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OF3sqVpOL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91AIJw5t0LL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91AIJw5t0LL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\