      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X2CVQK\",\"sku\":\"B075X2CVQK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-leather-headboard-queen-platform-wood-bed-65-w-mahogany-b075x2cvqk\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Leather Headboard Queen Platform Wood Bed, 65&quot;W, Mahogany\",\"description\":\"This handsome platform bed's headboard is upholstered in top grain leather. It will acquire a beautiful patina over time, and attractive stitching adds visual interest for now. Tapered wood legs provide the ultimate mid-century modern touch. 65&quot;W x 91&quot; L x 46&quot; H Solid hardwood frame. Top grain leather covers front of headboard. Mid-century modern style with classic leather and mahogany finish can blend with most styles Slat roll included; no boxspring required. Mattress sold separately. Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Leather Headboard Queen Platform Wood Bed, 65&quot;W, Mahogany\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81PZZ8H3XwL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1XFvLaU05L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1XFvLaU05L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81J+dqcUO1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81J+dqcUO1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A159Kd9VEDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A159Kd9VEDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81jssNSHV2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81jssNSHV2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Otqmo+U-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original