        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B084W2RZQN\",\"sku\":\"B084W2RZQN\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"morgan-faux-leather-memory-swivel-counter-height-barstool-38-2-h-brown-b084w2rzqn\",\"name\":\"Morgan Faux Leather Memory-Swivel Counter-Height Barstool, 38.2&quot;H, Brown\",\"description\":\"This counter-height barstool features a memory swivel that returns the seat to its proper position every time. The brown faux leather upholstery and button-tufted chair back give this barstool a touch of class. 20.5&quot;W x 24&quot;D x 38.2&quot;H; seat height: 26&quot;H; seat depth: 16.9&quot;D; seat back height: 16.1&quot;H; leg height: 22&quot;H Solid hardwood frame with vegan leather A memory-swivel mechanism means this barstool always looks tidy. Button-tufting makes this barstool stand out. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Morgan Faux Leather Memory-Swivel Counter-Height Barstool, 38.2&quot;H, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71eXI-euZYL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7119f5AVMNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7119f5AVMNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61InPLFwjwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61InPLFwjwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/710hPOHWm-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/710hPOHWm-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71D6AsQbXCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/pure