        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075QMHYVD\",\"sku\":\"B075QMHYVD\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-brecken-modern-wood-nightstand-bedside-table-24-inch-brown-b075qmhyvd\",\"name\":\"Rivet Brecken Modern Wood Nightstand Bedside Table, 24 Inch, Brown\",\"description\":\"Transform your bedroom with this eye-catching modern wood nightstand. The geometric design on two drawer fronts makes a dramatic statement, and sturdy tapered metal legs complete the simple look. 24&quot;W x 17&quot;D x 24&quot;H; LegHeight: 7&quot; Poplar and rubberwood hardwoods with acacia veneer, brass legs Dramatic modern design Two storage drawers with square knobs No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Brecken Modern Wood Nightstand Bedside Table, 24 Inch, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91xy6+YnpoL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Sm2VAxjgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Sm2VAxjgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Iu2Kq+xSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Iu2Kq+xSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-iTxKnpWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-iTxKnpWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1iQ8GK1k7S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1iQ8GK1k7S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91d6Cp7HqDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91d6Cp7HqDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1kifQx1U0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/origi