        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07RKK943W\",\"sku\":\"B07RKK943W\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"solimo-costa-engineered-wood-queen-bed-with-storage-walnut-b07rkk943w\",\"name\":\"Solimo Costa Engineered Wood Queen Bed with Storage (Walnut)\",\"description\":\"Product Dimensions: Length (156.5cm), Width (206cm), Height (88.7cm) Ideal mattress size: 75*66 Humidity-resistant design to ensure strength throughout changing seasons Over 20 tests conducted to ensure quality and safety Underwent dynamic loading tests for 21000 cycles for durability and for 10,000 cycles for edge stability Load bearing capacity of 360kgs to provide proper support Free from burrs & sharp edges for enhanced safety Made free from toxins or harmful chemicals to promise safe usage Includes a 3-year warranty on manufacturing defects Do not move or push without dismantling. Avoid using wet cloth to wipe furniture for better care\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Solimo Costa Engineered Wood Queen Bed with Storage (Walnut)\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81WdZ3If3WL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71UxBDYZkeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71UxBDYZkeL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71McWPXYPfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71McWPXYPfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lJfkKgznL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lJfkKgznL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71k3COxA0IL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71k3COxA0IL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71jUVI2J4dL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-image