        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSF15FW\",\"sku\":\"B07HSF15FW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-solid-wood-buffet-with-wine-rack-and-iron-base-33-86-h-brushed-natural-black-gold-b07hsf15fw\",\"name\":\"Rivet Solid Wood Buffet with Wine Rack and Iron Base, 33.86&quot;H, Brushed Natural, Black, Gold\",\"description\":\"On the outside of this transitional buffet, deep brushed texture on natural fir doors combine with an antique black top and sides for a mid-century feel, while an iron base in a golden hue touts an industrial design. An interior shelf and wine rack provide ample storage for liquor or dinnerware. 37.4&quot;W x 17.72&quot;D x 33.86&quot;H 90% solid fir, 10% iron This buffet has 2 doors with a shelf and wine rack inside. A deep brushed texture on the natural fir doors combine with antique black for a mid-century feel, while the iron base shows an industrial design. Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes Avoid moisture. Wipe up spills immediately. Clean with a soft, lint-free cotton cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Solid Wood Buffet with Wine Rack and Iron Base, 33.86&quot;H, Brushed Natural, Black, Gold\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lqukCAZZL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GAqwt8hYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GAqwt8hYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gIJflPehL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gIJflPehL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MCMoyEUTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91MCMoyEUTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81P835HTR2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-