      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X4YDCR\",\"sku\":\"B075X4YDCR\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"st-cloud-modern-armless-accent-chair-32-w-bear-b075x4ydcr\",\"name\":\"St. Cloud Modern Armless Accent Chair, 32&quot;W, Bear\",\"description\":\"A straight back and sloping, low-profile arms are the highlights of this mid-century inspired chair. Assembled in the U.S., it features a sturdy wood frame upholstered with durable, tightly woven fabric for a handsome design that's built to last. This item is made to order just for you 32&quot;W x 33&quot;D x 38&quot;H. Seat height is 19&quot;. Sturdy wood frame, durable polyester fabric, wood legs with walnut finish A Mid-century inspired design that will add elegance to a modern or transitional room Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"St. Cloud Modern Armless Accent Chair, 32&quot;W, Bear\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1uRlOGVHXS.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aiMgOBzVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aiMgOBzVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aQIhrw33L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1aQIhrw33L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Vm2OAT8TL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Vm2OAT8TL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1CWdIeH8PS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1CWdIeH8PS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1oyPFg4YHS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1oyPFg4YHS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\