      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HZ1RWZJ\",\"sku\":\"B07HZ1RWZJ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"genesse-ottoman-28-w-smoky-blue-b07hz1rwzj\",\"name\":\"Genesse Ottoman, 28&quot;W, Smoky-Blue\",\"description\":\"Complete your interior design with this beautiful smoky-blue ottoman. Its performance-fabric upholstery offers comfortable seating and leg support, and its clean lines and modern thin-leg design make this ottoman an ideal addition to transitional-style home decor. Overall: 28&quot;W x 23&quot;D x 18&quot;H; Seat Height: 19.68&quot;H; Seat Depth 23&quot;D; Leg Height: 5.51&quot;H Solid-wood frame and legs with performance fabric upholstery Slim-leg design with wooden plinth Foam cushions provide lasting comfort Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Genesse Ottoman, 28&quot;W, Smoky-Blue\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81r31Ps8W1L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+Xra-W2HL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+Xra-W2HL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TQdb5-ckL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TQdb5-ckL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FyK4UiYsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FyK4UiYsL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1H+eUdsQjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1H+eUdsQjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91HJM+3GhYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91HJM+3GhYL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"25.0\",\"labe