      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07MCBK6XT\",\"sku\":\"B07MCBK6XT\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-traditional-dining-chair-36-inch-height-cream-b07mcbk6xt\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Traditional Dining Chair, 36 Inch Height, Cream\",\"description\":\"Overall: 26.0&quot;W x 21.7&quot;D x 36.0&quot;H; seat height: 18.5&quot;H; seat depth: 21&quot;D; seat back height: 17.52&quot;H; arm height: 24.40&quot;H Dining chair framed in wood and manufactured wood; cushioned with high-density foam for comfort A clean-lined square back, elegant low-swoop arms, plush upholstery, and beautiful nailhead trim make this dining chair both convenient accent seating and a stunning decor accent. Brown-finished solid-wood legs balance the design and offer lasting durability. Soft, woven fabric upholstery is 100% polyester for easy cleaning and maintenance. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Use water-based cleaning agents or foam. Never use tap water. Use distilled water, as tap water contains minerals that may cause rings or fading.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Traditional Dining Chair, 36 Inch Height, Cream\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914EOOBlpoL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81c2ryeS+xL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81c2ryeS+xL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WO2Mey+JL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WO2Mey+JL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1YVMJdvFpL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1YVMJdvFpL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9135B4EaPsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9135B4EaPsL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleap