      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7FH3S6\",\"sku\":\"B07B7FH3S6\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"gazelle-rustic-metal-nesting-tables-52-w-set-of-3-weathered-taupe-gray-b07b7fh3s6\",\"name\":\"Gazelle Rustic Metal Nesting Tables, 52&quot;W, Set of 3, Weathered Taupe Gray\",\"description\":\"This set of three rustic tables includes one coffee table and end tables. To change the look, or save space, the two smaller ones fit underneath the largest. Distressed-finish wood is paired with minimalist metal bases for a modern farmhouse style. 52&quot;W x 26&quot;D x 20&quot;H Hardwood tops with metal bases Touches of rustic, modern and industrial Can be stored together to save space, or to just change up the look Assembly in 30 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Gazelle Rustic Metal Nesting Tables, 52&quot;W, Set of 3, Weathered Taupe Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81GIO8NuojL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81R2R7jNpqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81R2R7jNpqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B19jGe+hQGS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B19jGe+hQGS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1THteDBqbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1THteDBqbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/815YoS-9IDL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/815YoS-9IDL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1HBMv91mSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1HBMv91mSL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[