      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z1NM6N\",\"sku\":\"B075Z1NM6N\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-stark-modern-wood-starburst-stitch-queen-bed-with-headboard-82-3-w-antique-espresso-b075z1nm6n\",\"name\":\"Rivet Stark Modern Wood Starburst Stitch Queen Bed with Headboard, 82.3&quot;W, Antique Espresso\",\"description\":\"Starburst stitching on the upholstered headboard brings visual interest to this modern bed. Warm antique espresso finish enhances the sustainably-sourced wood. Neutral fabric and classic finish help it blend with transitional or modern styles. 82.3&quot;W x 61.5&quot;D x 45.3&quot;H FSC-certified solid pine with natural fabric. Modern design with warm finish and neutral-color fabric to blend with most styles No boxpring required; mattress sold seperatly. Assemble in 30-40 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Stark Modern Wood Starburst Stitch Queen Bed with Headboard, 82.3&quot;W, Antique Espresso\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81aWQggZekL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1RdTE0MJnS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1RdTE0MJnS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81t0oZfxnfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81t0oZfxnfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-hdXMn7nL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-hdXMn7nL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81o1LpGcr1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81o1LpGcr1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ONyn3EAqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1ON