        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07P8ST9TY\",\"sku\":\"B07P8ST9TY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"charles-classic-oversized-upholstered-sofa-92-w-dove-b07p8st9ty\",\"name\":\"Charles Classic Oversized Upholstered Sofa, 92&quot;W, Dove\",\"description\":\"Let yourself be wrapped in comfort by this generously plush sofa. Traditional rolled arms and turned wood legs are combined with modern upholstery for a welcome update on a classic piece. 92&quot;W x 39&quot;D x 38&quot;H Solid hardwood frame; upholstery: 95% polyester, 5% nylon Removable back and seat cushions make upkeep a breeze. A traditional silhouette is paired with modern, stain-resistant fabric, making this the perfect addition to a busy home. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. Spot clean if needed. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Charles Classic Oversized Upholstered Sofa, 92&quot;W, Dove\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71CVfoS6mGL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711kHg3MqXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711kHg3MqXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71OqluZrHiL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71OqluZrHiL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71NvFG3sLHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71NvFG3sLHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91xGhB-rOcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91xGhB-rOcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71IcBB8GqGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71IcBB8GqGL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\