      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HYYCT75\",\"sku\":\"B07HYYCT75\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"carrigan-casual-living-room-chair-45-w-navy-b07hyyct75\",\"name\":\"Carrigan Casual Living-Room Chair, 45&quot;W, Navy\",\"description\":\"Overall: 45&quot;W x 39&quot;D x 37&quot;H; seat height: 22.5&quot;H; seat depth: 28&quot;D; seat back height: 32.5&quot;H; arm height: 27&quot;H; leg height: 3&quot;H Removable slipcover in 100% cotton fabric; fully padded solid-wood frame with mortise-and-tenon construction and 8-gauge sinuous spring support system Slipcover is removable for easy cleaning and refreshing. Loose back and seat cushions are removable and reversible to ensure durability and comfort. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Carrigan Casual Living-Room Chair, 45&quot;W, Navy\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814z1-Xk6WL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OSWmOlHAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1OSWmOlHAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yQ9q+Fm-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yQ9q+Fm-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1dmCb3P1sL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1dmCb3P1sL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1f3BHfpcjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1f3BHfpcjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1050JImgoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1050JImgoL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\