        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QC85TNQ\",\"sku\":\"B07QC85TNQ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"side-table-with-drawer-19-w-ash-veneer-walnut-and-antique-bronze-finish-b07qc85tnq\",\"name\":\"Side Table with Drawer, 19&quot;W, Ash Veneer, Walnut and Antique Bronze Finish\",\"description\":\"This vintage side table with a modern flair offers extra storage with a single drawer; never lose the remote again. Use it in a living room or bedroom or as an accent piece. The bronze-toned base and drawer pull with the walnut finish match most decors from traditional to contemporary. 19&quot;W x 15.75&quot;D x 24&quot;H 60% MDF, 30% metal, ash veneer A vintage look with a modern flair gives this side table an elegance that fits most decor. This side table comes with a single storage drawer. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Wipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Side Table with Drawer, 19&quot;W, Ash Veneer, Walnut and Antique Bronze Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91JC5v6duBL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81a+jFxqi6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81a+jFxqi6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VIRSENY6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VIRSENY6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91iZbYJ8u8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91iZbYJ8u8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91wFHDrS6PL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91wFHDrS6PL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818o2lMwOqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com