        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B8HYSLD\",\"sku\":\"B07B8HYSLD\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bruckner-casual-wood-coffee-table-50-w-brown-b07b8hysld\",\"name\":\"Bruckner Casual Wood Coffee Table, 50&quot;W, Brown\",\"description\":\"This handsome coffee table features simple lines and a warm finish that's ideal for any casual room next to your favorite chair or sofa. It's the perfect perch for your page-turner book or a serving tray. 28&quot;L x 50&quot;W x 20&quot;H Rubber and poplar hardwoods; birch veneer A transitional piece with touches of modern, rustic and global styles Rattan adds texture to your room along with storage space Assembly in 30 minutes or less; assemble and attach bases Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bruckner Casual Wood Coffee Table, 50&quot;W, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81kmdHq5kPL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81dERZMNEaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81dERZMNEaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91KkSy2CwoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91KkSy2CwoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1vBbjyiwXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1vBbjyiwXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B10qGdxh2kS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B10qGdxh2kS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nc++yFPfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91nc++yFPfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91WJ0uvSbuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/pure