      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X3SHY9\",\"sku\":\"B075X3SHY9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-lawson-mid-century-modern-angled-leather-arm-chair-33-w-driftwood-b075x3shy9\",\"name\":\"Rivet Lawson Mid-Century Modern Angled Leather Arm Chair, 33&quot;W, Driftwood\",\"description\":\"This item is made to order just for you 33&quot;W x 34&quot;D x 34&quot;H Sturdy hardwood frame and legs with 100% leather upholstery. Tight, padded back with a removable seat cushion makes it functional and comfortable. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. You'll enjoy snuggling up with a good book on this sophisticated chair. A sleek back, angled arms, a removable seat cushion and tapered legs give it urbane, mid-century influenced style. Available in leather and fabric upholstery. No assembly. Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. If needed, spot clean with a damp cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Lawson Mid-Century Modern Angled Leather Arm Chair, 33&quot;W, Driftwood\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PuZxFQTFL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mM56eo0aL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mM56eo0aL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Jwxp0eGiL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Jwxp0eGiL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1zec8KS5BS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1zec8KS5BS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+IPqXHqyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+IPqXHqyL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"34.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"v