        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QGFYLKT\",\"sku\":\"B07QGFYLKT\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"mid-century-chair-23-6-w-charcoal-b07qgfylkt\",\"name\":\"Mid-Century Chair, 23.6&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"description\":\"This elegant mid-century-design upholstered chair is perfect for a study or home office. The contour back and open sides allow for maximum comfort and freedom of movement. 23.6&quot;W x 22.8&quot;D x 33.9&quot;H Fabric upholstery on solid wood frame; foam padding; solid wood legs This mid-century accent chair features contour shaping and an opening in the back. Distinctive copper nailhead trim on charcoal linen upholstery give this chair a bold, striking appearance. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Mid-Century Chair, 23.6&quot;W, Charcoal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81SCT-t+dUL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915FUgABJmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915FUgABJmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-X+2n1s4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-X+2n1s4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81xt-T+uT4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81xt-T+uT4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TJmPmtyaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TJmPmtyaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HSotKe85L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HSotKe85L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"33.9\",\"label\":