        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7GZTNR\",\"sku\":\"B07B7GZTNR\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"alan-casual-wood-bookcase-23-navy-and-gold-b07b7gztnr\",\"name\":\"Alan Casual Wood Bookcase, 23&quot;, Navy and Gold\",\"description\":\"With its lovely washed navy finish and gold hardware, this vertical piece will add beauty to your room as well as a way to keep organized. Two self-close drawers offer roomy storage. Use alone or with the Teal Story entertainment center. 23&quot;W x 18&quot;D x 68&quot;H Hardwood and fiberboard; metal pulls with gold finish Casual transitional style Features two felt-lined drawers and two shelves Assembly in 30-60 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Alan Casual Wood Bookcase, 23&quot;, Navy and Gold\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81byJ63olhL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QJDyYcHgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91QJDyYcHgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KRH5GP3oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81KRH5GP3oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tBS-tEzIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tBS-tEzIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/911m6RMtANL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/911m6RMtANL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91c5gnt3CxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91c5gnt3CxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71MEfwje5vL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71MEfwje5vL.jpg\