        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B8FN8TP\",\"sku\":\"B07B8FN8TP\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"traditional-oak-wood-media-tv-console-table-59-walnut-finish-b07b8fn8tp\",\"name\":\"Traditional Oak Wood Media TV Console Table, 59&quot;, Walnut Finish\",\"description\":\"A traditional console table takes on modern functionality, whether used behind a sofa, against a wall in a hallway, or even as a desk. A narrow top is anchored on a single turned-wood leg on either end, making it compact for small spaces. 17.7&quot;W x 59.1&quot;D x 31.5&quot;H Made of solid oak with a walnut finish. Traditional design with walnut veneer Compact design for small spaces No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Traditional Oak Wood Media TV Console Table, 59&quot;, Walnut Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61Fcu4jYyrL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7146QFrCieL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7146QFrCieL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71M-k5IbEnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71M-k5IbEnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-cOZxvMmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-cOZxvMmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BB5leu-OL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BB5leu-OL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/618loiX0-3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/618loiX0-3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BOYSGGNuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-p