        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0857JZKYB\",\"sku\":\"B0857JZKYB\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"birch-wishbone-counter-height-barstool-35-5-h-natural-b0857jzkyb\",\"name\":\"Birch Wishbone Counter-Height Barstool, 35.5&quot;H, Natural\",\"description\":\"The graceful curves of this natural-colored birch barstool mask its everyday durability. It's light, portable, and perfect for any place in the house where there's a countertop. The soft, comfortable woven paper-rope seat is 100% natural. 22.4&quot;W x 22.8&quot;D x 35.5&quot;H Birch frame with a woven seat The sturdy birch frame will stand the test of time, while the soft woven paper-rope seat is easy to sink into. Simple but fashionable, this natural-colored wishbone-style curved design adds sophistication to any counter area. No assembly required Using a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the grain. Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Birch Wishbone Counter-Height Barstool, 35.5&quot;H, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61A55tk4AQL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71mSUCmmtYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71mSUCmmtYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81J1x6d3OFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81J1x6d3OFL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61R9u4S6ttL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61R9u4S6ttL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71MPwLlvZ-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71MPwLlvZ-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71NrmPHE-fL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pi