        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073G6DCF9\",\"sku\":\"B073G6DCF9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-sweeping-arm-accent-chair-28-w-damask-navy-b073g6dcf9\",\"name\":\"Modern Sweeping Arm Accent Chair, 28&quot;W, Damask Navy\",\"description\":\"This graceful chair will make a pleasing addition to any style of room. A soft sweep of the arms and clean lines make it modern, but linen-look fabric and turned wood legs with espresso-colored stain give it a classic look as well. 28”W x 29”D x 34”H Solid pine with linen/cotton fabric Modern with classic touches Will blend with classic and transitional style rooms 4 easy-to-attach legs Made-to-order Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Sweeping Arm Accent Chair, 28&quot;W, Damask Navy\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A13ceodeSDL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Mq9R-FK7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Mq9R-FK7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1Uy3jyG6eS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1Uy3jyG6eS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BcSWsJLhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81BcSWsJLhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Q2M14h--L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Q2M14h--L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1ljVbE-ScS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1ljVbE-ScS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"34.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"28.0\"