        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7HVCMB\",\"sku\":\"B07B7HVCMB\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-white-marble-and-metal-side-end-table-nightstand-18-w-silver-amp-marble-b07b7hvcmb\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern White Marble and Metal Side End Table Nightstand, 18&quot;W, Silver &amp; Marble\",\"description\":\"Two iron trapezoids form a sturdy base for the lovely white marble top. This side table will be a handsome conversation piece along with providing a place for a small lamp or a few favorite photos. Its compact design will fit nicely in small spaces. 17.88&quot;W x 17.88&quot;D x 22&quot;H Marble top with silver metal base A compact design great for a small space beside a sofa No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Shiny silver base and geometric design give this a totally modern flair\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern White Marble and Metal Side End Table Nightstand, 18&quot;W, Silver &amp; Marble\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81wJ87gS+KL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813rHsK+YgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813rHsK+YgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TnJ18Q01L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81TnJ18Q01L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918w7oRIcgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918w7oRIcgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nxnjS2lQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nxnjS2lQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81G2BwDoIwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81G2BwDoIwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":