      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B085565X2N\",\"sku\":\"B085565X2N\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-wood-counter-height-kitchen-bar-stool-24-h-natural-b085565x2n\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Wood Counter-Height Kitchen Bar Stool, 24&quot; H, Natural\",\"description\":\"This modern counter-height barstool is made of sturdy solid birch with a natural finish; it features a contoured seat and no back for a classically minimalist, Scandinavian-inspired profile with maximized style and sophistication. Sturdy, solid birch wood construction for stability. 14.4&quot;D x 17.3”W x 24.2”H Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe away dust and debris with a soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Wood Counter-Height Kitchen Bar Stool, 24&quot; H, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61hw8jrwYOL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/710cMCcT4mL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/710cMCcT4mL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61iZBSgmQCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61iZBSgmQCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71nKM+Xk-FL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71nKM+Xk-FL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81xESi5a0WL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81xESi5a0WL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61Yy-fljLAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61Yy-fljLAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/714iMNH6iQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/pu