        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X29QYK\",\"sku\":\"B075X29QYK\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"newport-arced-headboard-queen-bed-63-w-oak-b075x29qyk\",\"name\":\"Newport Arced Headboard Queen Bed, 63&quot;W, Oak\",\"description\":\"A backward-arcing headboard gives this bed an elegant side silhouette. Light grey upholstery on the headboard is combined with a warm oak finish on the footboard and side rails. The padded headboard is cozy to lean against while reading. 63&quot;W x 92&quot; L x 48.5&quot; H Hardwood headboard with upholstery on front and back; hardwood footboard and side rails Clean modern lines combine with traditional-look fabric for a transitional style. Slat roll included; no boxspring required. Mattress sold separately. Assemble in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Newport Arced Headboard Queen Bed, 63&quot;W, Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Lk3fEzGiL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817to06mlbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817to06mlbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1I2m0dNi6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1I2m0dNi6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fCTEAsB8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fCTEAsB8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qVD0q+42L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qVD0q+42L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91HvQakBomL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91HvQakBomL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/p