      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSG8DPZ\",\"sku\":\"B07HSG8DPZ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-emerly-contemporary-media-console-center-storage-cabinet-57-w-wood-b07hsg8dpz\",\"name\":\"Rivet Emerly Contemporary Media Console Center Storage Cabinet, 57&quot;W, Wood\",\"description\":\"Update your home décor while keeping your media devices organized with this attractive contemporary-style media console. Made from solid mango and sealed with a French gray finish, this media table blends perfectly in any room. The geometric design on its cabinet doors adds interest to the piece. 13.7&quot;W x 57&quot;D x 20.8&quot;H Solid hardwood with a wooden honeycomb design on the door fronts and a French gray finish Modern styling that will blend well with most home décor. This TV cabinet has a fixed shelf on the right side and a removable shelf behind the doors. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Care: Clean as required with a soft, damp cloth; wipe completely dry. Avoid placing furniture near heat vents or open windows. Long periods of heat or excessive dampness can cause splitting, warping, and swelling in solid wood. Protect fine furniture finishes from hot dishes, alcohol, and excessive moisture or dampness. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Emerly Contemporary Media Console Center Storage Cabinet, 57&quot;W, Wood\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816cWTn1XVL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LwzUlsAyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LwzUlsAyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915wKOv4fvL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915wKOv4fvL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/813AZUA-XtL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-im