        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07KW12DWX\",\"sku\":\"B07KW12DWX\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-tufted-vinyl-upholstered-headboard-full-black-b07kw12dwx\",\"name\":\"Modern Tufted Vinyl Upholstered Headboard - Full, Black\",\"description\":\"Contemporary bed headboard for bedrooms and guest rooms Sleek faux leather vinyl upholstery with classic tufted detailing Sturdy plywood and fiberboard frame that’s built to last Stuffed with dense 100% polyester filling for a firm, supportive back rest Complements both traditional and modern interior design aesthetics Durable and easy to dust or wipe clean with a damp cloth Hardware for bed frame mounting and wall mounting not included Suggested screw size for wall mounting: 8mm carriage bolts, 3&quot; in length.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Tufted Vinyl Upholstered Headboard - Full, Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818mcvnUY9L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Ot4jIkCfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Ot4jIkCfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71U0220PQ2L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71U0220PQ2L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81vj4mTJ0oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81vj4mTJ0oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81rQyvYYsRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81rQyvYYsRL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"55.75\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"4.25\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"55.63\",\"label\":\