        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4W2FFY\",\"sku\":\"B07B4W2FFY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-jonathan-mid-century-modern-wood-bedside-nightstand-20-walnut-b07b4w2ffy\",\"name\":\"Rivet Jonathan Mid-Century Modern Wood Bedside Nightstand, 20&quot;, Walnut\",\"description\":\"This classic mid-century nightstand will keep you organized at your bedside while adding retro style to your oom. Two drawers with brass-toned knobs provide room for storing your phone charger, on a base of four slanted legs. 20&quot;W x 17&quot;D x 24&quot;H; LegHeight: 12.125&quot; Two drawers provide storage for phone chargers and extra keys Easy assembly in 15 minutes; just bolt on base Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Jonathan Mid-Century Modern Wood Bedside Nightstand, 20&quot;, Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91YSDAgGXOL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o4guz5-aL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1o4guz5-aL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1PZ157+AjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1PZ157+AjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RO7I5vmqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RO7I5vmqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1dm0lK38JL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1dm0lK38JL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FYhJo8cgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81FYhJo8cgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/917-doMmwTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresi