        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HZ81V76\",\"sku\":\"B07HZ81V76\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bagley-sectional-component-left-facing-corner-sofa-fabric-90-w-dove-b07hz81v76\",\"name\":\"Bagley Sectional Component, Left-Facing Corner Sofa, Fabric, 90&quot;W, Dove\",\"description\":\"This dove-colored sectional sofa boasts a smooth polyester-nylon blend that’s a dream to sit or lie on. This is the left-facing corner sofa component—put several pieces together to arrange your seating in a way that brings the most possible comfort to your living room. Sturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric Attached back and reversible seat cushions add lasting style. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you. Overall: 90&quot;W x 40&quot;D x 36&quot;H; Seat Height: 22&quot;H; Seat Depth: 24&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 36&quot;H; Arm Height: 24&quot;H; Leg Height: 2.125&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bagley Sectional Component, Left-Facing Corner Sofa, Fabric, 90&quot;W, Dove\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61ZIsCchksL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ZfpDgWlBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ZfpDgWlBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81LCyja-R-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81LCyja-R-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LVE1Sy7IL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LVE1Sy7IL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hhsZzC7zL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hhsZzC7zL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81e-iBjdSwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https:/