        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7B94D8\",\"sku\":\"B07B7B94D8\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bradhurst-rustic-wood-dining-table-86-6-l-brown-b07b7b94d8\",\"name\":\"Bradhurst Rustic Wood Dining Table, 86.6&quot;L, Brown\",\"description\":\"You'll enjoy years of making family memories around this modern rustic table. With a natural finish that shows off the wood's natural grain, it will add simple beauty to a farmhouse-style room. Angular cross-tied legs give it a modern touch. 86.6&quot;L x 37.4&quot;D x 30&quot;H Hardwood made from fir A simple natural style that works with modern farmhouse or transitional décor A handsome table that can also be used in home office or as a craft table Assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bradhurst Rustic Wood Dining Table, 86.6&quot;L, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ngwCSQnhL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1lolP7T9nL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1lolP7T9nL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RNW5BeT1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RNW5BeT1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TydjqqGpL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TydjqqGpL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1M-TF-sbVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1M-TF-sbVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91uvPe2HNxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91uvPe2HNxL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"29.9\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\