        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072ZRPFNM\",\"sku\":\"B072ZRPFNM\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-hairpin-wood-and-metal-tall-29-5-console-bar-table-walnut-and-black-b072zrpfnm\",\"name\":\"Rivet Hairpin Wood and Metal Tall 29.5&quot; Console Bar Table, Walnut and Black\",\"description\":\"This modern console appears to float on dark metal legs shaped much like hairpins. The wood top with walnut veneer gives a classic touch that helps this piece blend with your existing styles. 47.2&quot;L x 15.7&quot;W x 29.5&quot;H.Package Weight:48.95 pounds Engineered wood; dark painted metal legs Modern with classic touches A sleek, narrow piece to display photographs and other special items Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Hairpin Wood and Metal Tall 29.5&quot; Console Bar Table, Walnut and Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/7111aT6PLrL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rT98rq6SL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91rT98rq6SL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Z47YYdL6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Z47YYdL6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1y7n3iV-MS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1y7n3iV-MS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71QUu7uEXJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71QUu7uEXJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1vBvsU3b4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1vBvsU3b4L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"15.