        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07L1D95DC\",\"sku\":\"B07L1D95DC\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"solimo-aquilla-engineered-wood-chest-of-drawer-wenge-finish-b07l1d95dc\",\"name\":\"Solimo Aquilla Engineered Wood Chest of Drawer (Wenge Finish)\",\"description\":\"Premium-quality engineered wood chest of drawers which has undergone more than 20 safety and quality tests Material: European Standard Particle Board Smooth and curved edges for protection against scrapes and cuts Sleek Wenge finish that gives it an appealing look and makes it easy to clean Durable drawers that have been tested over 5,000 cycles Tested for resistance against humidity, stains and hot water Free from harmful carcinogens like lead, formaldehyde and pentachlorophenol (PCP) Comes with a 3-year warranty on manufacturing defects\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Solimo Aquilla Engineered Wood Chest of Drawer (Wenge Finish)\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71oYDJJRi7L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61cxGOXk05L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61cxGOXk05L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71kWiQfLIjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71kWiQfLIjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61fVo3b-k0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61fVo3b-k0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71lQez8u0zL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71lQez8u0zL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71bYv7Z5KtL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71bYv7Z5KtL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/origi