      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B82WF6G\",\"sku\":\"B07B82WF6G\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-modern-wood-round-dining-kitchen-table-43-3-w-beige-b07b82wf6g\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Wood Round Dining Kitchen Table, 43.3&quot;W, Beige\",\"description\":\"A neutral, natural wood finish is married with three crossed, angular modern legs for a transitional style that works with most any decor. Its compact size makes it ideal for smaller spaces. Quality materials and construction make it durable. 43.3&quot;W x 43.3&quot;D x 29.5&quot;H Solid hardwood with oak veneer A transitional look that works in any style room where clean, compact design is needed Use for eating, crafting or catching up on work on your laptop Assembly in 30 minutes or less; just screw on legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Wood Round Dining Kitchen Table, 43.3&quot;W, Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81qCOOPGAxL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XwFOXZJhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XwFOXZJhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81OOeRXgmgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81OOeRXgmgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tbVWWIkJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tbVWWIkJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wsCjKemgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1wsCjKemgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JZ1wc+ZBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JZ1wc+ZBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"http