        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4MM4PL\",\"sku\":\"B07B4MM4PL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-edgewest-modern-ottoman-32-w-slate-brown-b07b4mm4pl\",\"name\":\"Rivet Edgewest Modern Ottoman, 32&quot;W, Slate Brown\",\"description\":\"Features such as box-edge framing and metal legs make this ottoman look sharp in modern or industrial settings. With a solid frame and durable fabric, it's ready to welcome tired feet or to serve as extra seating for guests. 32&quot;W x 26&quot;D x 19&quot;H; Seat Height: 19&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 26&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 19&quot;H; Leg Height: 5.25&quot;H Polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame; metal legs with bronze finish Crisp, clean lines and metal legs are hallmarks of contemporary style Carefully crafted with a solid wood frame to ensure durability Easy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Edgewest Modern Ottoman, 32&quot;W, Slate Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1DL+K-3cuL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18zQ8MvSkL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18zQ8MvSkL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Nsls60BqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Nsls60BqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1p9eH2B5zL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1p9eH2B5zL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-zMyykglL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-zMyykglL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91s77PlquRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/origina