      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075ZCLPVG\",\"sku\":\"B075ZCLPVG\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"wood-and-metal-round-nesting-side-end-tables-34-w-set-of-2-pine-b075zclpvg\",\"name\":\"Wood and Metal Round Nesting Side End Tables, 34&quot; W, Set of 2, Pine\",\"description\":\"Large table is 34&quot; Diameter and 20&quot;H; Small table is 25&quot; Diameter and 15.25&quot;H Solid pine top with walnut finish; metal frame with dark brown finish Modern metal material and designed combined with classic wood top Space savers when kept together, but can be pulled apart partially or completely Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Complement your living room with this set of two round nesting tables with natural solid pine tops and sturdy sleek metal bases. Each table can be used separately or together to create the space you need for your laptop, drink, and remote controls.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Wood and Metal Round Nesting Side End Tables, 34&quot; W, Set of 2, Pine\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RuARNJmpL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91KUpT9vGZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91KUpT9vGZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81jE2zMyvCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81jE2zMyvCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-W2EPy3eL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-W2EPy3eL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yiYGinz5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yiYGinz5L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"20.0\",\"label\":\"inche