        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSKV2QT\",\"sku\":\"B07HSKV2QT\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-stevens-modern-storage-coffee-table-47-24-w-brushed-tundra-gray-b07hskv2qt\",\"name\":\"Rivet Stevens Modern Storage Coffee Table, 47.24&quot;W, Brushed Tundra Gray\",\"description\":\"Update your home décor with this gorgeous modern-style coffee table. Made from solid acacia, this table is highly durable, and its brushed tundra-gray finish blends well with most home-décor themes. Its drawer and storage niche offer helpful organization options. 47.24&quot;W x 27.56&quot;D x 15.75&quot;H Solid acacia Clean lines and rich gray finish create a modern design that's perfect for any contemporary-style home. This stylish coffee table has a drawer and an alcove for storing items. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Stevens Modern Storage Coffee Table, 47.24&quot;W, Brushed Tundra Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71zk0y1UtCL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XDiPKPsbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XDiPKPsbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Mb9KHSR5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Mb9KHSR5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71PYqzhfJeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71PYqzhfJeL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91spHvM9KsL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91spHvM9KsL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"13.75\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"W