        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B085FHBF2S\",\"sku\":\"B085FHBF2S\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-recliner-chair-37-w-brown-b085fhbf2s\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Recliner Chair, 37&quot;W, Brown\",\"description\":\"37&quot;W x 35.4&quot;D x 39.8&quot;H; seat height: 18.5&quot;H; seat depth: 21&quot;D Plywood frame with strong reclining mechanism and solid performance seat and backrest cushions Manual recliner with big, soft arms and wingback design Assemble in 15 minutes or less Indoor use only; avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Recliner Chair, 37&quot;W, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mqev7YpnL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71RR2h5pO0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71RR2h5pO0L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81MSU+wnXYL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81MSU+wnXYL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81aIPQhfCnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81aIPQhfCnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71NXjpILT1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71NXjpILT1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/613noW30pJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/613noW30pJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71OZKI-lHHL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71OZKI-lHHL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ngHk0sr5L.jpg\",\"url\"