      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B074KKMQBG\",\"sku\":\"B074KKMQBG\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"cabernet-slatted-3-drawer-side-end-table-nightstand-18-9-w-ash-b074kkmqbg\",\"name\":\"Cabernet Slatted 3-Drawer Side End Table Nightstand, 18.9&quot;W, Ash\",\"description\":\"18.9”W x 15.7”D x 27.2”H Solid ash frame and legs are complemented by hardwood doors with ash veneer A handsome piece that can anchor a modern, rustic or transitional style room Can be a standalone piece in a hallway or a side table in a living room or bedroom. Assembly in 15 minutes or less. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This simple, beautifully designed 3-drawer cabinet can double as a compact side table next to a sofa or bed, providing storage space as well as a handsome complement to a modern, transitional or rustic decor. Solid ash accents add visual interest.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Cabernet Slatted 3-Drawer Side End Table Nightstand, 18.9&quot;W, Ash\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91aNeOyDxNL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A17rbKGZZ+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A17rbKGZZ+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LgGETmfRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1LgGETmfRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91dSxAmzLoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91dSxAmzLoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1CYglVAS9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1CYglVAS9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91fJCCP+ybL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91