        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B071SHBTM5\",\"sku\":\"B071SHBTM5\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-west-mid-century-oak-distinct-grain-chest-bedroom-dresser-38-w-dark-oak-finish-b071shbtm5\",\"name\":\"Rivet West, Mid-Century, Oak Distinct Grain Chest Bedroom Dresser, 38&quot;W, Dark Oak Finish\",\"description\":\"Add the perfect touch of originality to your bedroom with this mid-century dresser. The brass pulls and concealed drawer glides provide a modern style, while veneer made from hand-selected quarter-sawn oak adds a distinctive grain. 38&quot;W x 19&quot;D x 52&quot;H Solid hardwoods with finish of wire-brushed matte dark oak Modern and simple yet distinctive design No assembly needed. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Drawers are suspended on easy opening, concealed, self-closing extension guides\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet West, Mid-Century, Oak Distinct Grain Chest Bedroom Dresser, 38&quot;W, Dark Oak Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91NhtYKF03L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PMINs+WuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91PMINs+WuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rCGiNLzJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rCGiNLzJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Efaut9FPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Efaut9FPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19x5qw-56L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19x5qw-56L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"52.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value