      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B074KMW499\",\"sku\":\"B074KMW499\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"glenwood-entertainment-tv-console-media-stand-68-w-oak-b074kmw499\",\"name\":\"Glenwood Entertainment TV Console Media Stand, 68&quot;W, Oak\",\"description\":\"68&quot;W x 16&quot;D x 25&quot;H Hardwood with quarter-sawn oak veneer for a handsome grain; metal door handles and base Simple, sleek design and classic oak veneer combine for a transitional style Two easy gliding, sliding doors Wipe with soft dry cloth Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Your family will enjoy many Netflix binges, movie nights, and Sunday mornings in pajamas with coffee in front of this entertainment console. Store your games, movies, and extra cables behind the two sliding doors.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Glenwood Entertainment TV Console Media Stand, 68&quot;W, Oak\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91xum5pEdlL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19UsXNbb+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19UsXNbb+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-zttBhRhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-zttBhRhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+1uuRZ5aL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+1uuRZ5aL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/910k5voHPqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/910k5voHPqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rubFsaREL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1rubFsaREL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"25.0\",\"label\":\"in