        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSCRFTN\",\"sku\":\"B07HSCRFTN\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-desk-35-inch-natural-b07hscrftn\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Desk - 35 Inch, Natural\",\"description\":\"Sleek, simple, and functional, this writing table has traded the bells and whistles for functionality, style, and structural integrity. A smooth, wooden writing surface with 3 built-in niches forms the beautiful top to this piece, with sturdy, black metal legs beneath for dependable support. 47.24”W x 24.4”D x 35.04”H 30% metal, 70% MDF with veneer Simple, yet striking, the natural wood finish contrasts sharply with the black metal legs. Sturdy metal legs support a smooth wooden writing surface No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Desk - 35 Inch, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71retuUKr3L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EiebqBthL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EiebqBthL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71u1F68gXqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71u1F68gXqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91e3w8XJH5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91e3w8XJH5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/812PrEUicpL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/812PrEUicpL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j2WXpX3lL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j2WXpX3lL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"29.1\",\"label\":\"inches\