        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4GXNLL\",\"sku\":\"B07B4GXNLL\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"andover-modern-right-l-sectional-sofa-124-w-grey-linen-b07b4gxnll\",\"name\":\"Andover Modern Right L-Sectional Sofa, 124&quot;W, Grey Linen\",\"description\":\"With sturdy frames and reversible cushions, the furniture in this collection will withstand years of fun and cuddles with family and pets. Features such as track arms and box-edge lines bring stylish sophistication to modern or transitional rooms. 124&quot;W x 96&quot;D x 33&quot;H; Seat Height: 21&quot;H ; Seat Depth: 25&quot;D; Seat Back Height: 28&quot;H; Arm Height: 28&quot;H; Leg Height: 4.25&quot;H Polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame Track arms and a streamlined shape are hallmarks of modern design Carefully crafted to ensure durability and years of use Easy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Andover Modern Right L-Sectional Sofa, 124&quot;W, Grey Linen\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81CZhCHYK3L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91FXxVVAaQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91FXxVVAaQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91j3RjmB-TL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91j3RjmB-TL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1q5GbLsMjS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1q5GbLsMjS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71lAn9--UKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71lAn9--UKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1U8A+A5R1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com