      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QD6V1S4\",\"sku\":\"B07QD6V1S4\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"ravenna-home-classic-glass-doored-media-storage-cabinet-31-5-w-white-b07qd6v1s4\",\"name\":\"Ravenna Home Classic Glass-Doored Media Storage Cabinet, 31.5&quot;W, White\",\"description\":\"31.5&quot;W x 16.54&quot;D x 31.5&quot;H Pine, MDF and glass, Metal The white finish and metal pulls add a modern element to the design. Geometric door trim gives it a graceful style that will go with most any decor. No assembly required Use a soft, damp cloth to dust wood furniture, and wipe in the direction of the grain. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ravenna Home Classic Glass-Doored Media Storage Cabinet, 31.5&quot;W, White\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71eym9GhRYL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71vVLDXQ0QL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71vVLDXQ0QL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71yi02DiO6L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71yi02DiO6L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91EnNeUMeKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91EnNeUMeKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61lnt1ELgPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61lnt1ELgPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41HasdnMU0L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/41/41HasdnMU0L.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"31.5\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"16.54\",\"label\":\"inches\"