      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B073GC43L7\",\"sku\":\"B073GC43L7\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-sweeping-arm-accent-chair-28-w-sea-blue-b073gc43l7\",\"name\":\"Modern Sweeping Arm Accent Chair, 28&quot;W, Sea Blue\",\"description\":\"This graceful chair will make a pleasing addition to any style of room. A soft sweep of the arms and clean lines make it modern, but the beautiful woven fabric and turned wood legs with espresso-colored stain give it a classic look as well. 28”W x 29”D x 34”H Solid pine with polyester fabric Modern with classic touches Will blend with classic and transitional style rooms 4 easy-to-attach legs Made-to-order Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Sweeping Arm Accent Chair, 28&quot;W, Sea Blue\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1MmobRVP3L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1rgMxgnnQS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1rgMxgnnQS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919dDe9ksJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/919dDe9ksJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1l21-mIRuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1l21-mIRuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1Io3YdPgwS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1Io3YdPgwS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GMHOyAUgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GMHOyAUgL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"34.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"28.0\",\"