      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075QDV22Z\",\"sku\":\"B075QDV22Z\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-payton-mid-century-modern-tufted-queen-bed-with-headboard-66-3-w-natural-b075qdv22z\",\"name\":\"Rivet Payton Mid-Century Modern Tufted Queen Bed with Headboard, 66.3&quot; W, Natural\",\"description\":\"With its tall tufted headboard and low-profile footboard, this bed is elegant and impactful. Both, along with the side rails, are upholstered in a neutral herringbone fabric. This bed will provide a fresh update to a transitional or modern room. 89.4&quot;L x 66.3&quot;W x 59.8&quot;H 100% polyester fabric Mid-century modern-inspired design with subtle tufting No boxpring required; mattress sold seperatly Assemble in 30 minutes to 1 hour. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Payton Mid-Century Modern Tufted Queen Bed with Headboard, 66.3&quot; W, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915l0XBB+EL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-1xTS--GL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-1xTS--GL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1iEPtfacrL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1iEPtfacrL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915RR7bqOwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915RR7bqOwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B19MNuhpzfS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B19MNuhpzfS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XLYLqH3SL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XLYLqH3SL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"hei