        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072ZMHBKQ\",\"sku\":\"B072ZMHBKQ\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-modern-lacquer-side-end-table-nightstand-grey-and-walnut-b072zmhbkq\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Lacquer Side End Table Nightstand, Grey and Walnut\",\"description\":\"This sleek mid-century side table will be a handsome addition to your room while displaying framed photos and other treasured items on top. A second shelf below and a drawer are handy places to stash keys, phones and more. 17.7&quot;L x 14.2&quot;W x 23.6&quot;H Engineered wood with walnut veneer Mid-century modern A compact, convenient piece for any room in need of a small side table Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Lacquer Side End Table Nightstand, Grey and Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81epQi+CwGL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A10rNmdZ1qL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A10rNmdZ1qL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Auswk2cSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Auswk2cSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19L80dMYCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19L80dMYCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gqyy6EPML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91gqyy6EPML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81jL9-7f91L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81jL9-7f91L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91yzz5UahgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"htt