      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B082JLXB9Z\",\"sku\":\"B082JLXB9Z\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"modern-home-office-writing-desk-with-recessed-metal-handles-48-w-white-b082jlxb9z\",\"name\":\"Modern Home Office Writing Desk with Recessed Metal Handles, 48&quot;W, White\",\"description\":\"This simple modern writing desk has recessed metal hardware and clean styling. The tapered legs add a touch of elegance that subtly balances its practicality. This white desk is perfect as a multifunctional home-work space. 48&quot;W x 20&quot;D x 30.5&quot;H Solid pine and MDF with metal hardware The large writing space is excellent for multiple projects. The white color gives this writing desk a clean modern look. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Modern Home Office Writing Desk with Recessed Metal Handles, 48&quot;W, White\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61-zl5jJwoL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61VszIpGwBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61VszIpGwBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61wUXYdUgAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61wUXYdUgAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51RKd2euw4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51RKd2euw4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61jRBgUaMVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61jRBgUaMVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/21/21bUEtIQYOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/21/21bUEtIQYOL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.goo