        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B78G4QH\",\"sku\":\"B07B78G4QH\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"jon-casual-farmhouse-wood-dining-table-54-72-w-birch-finish-b07b78g4qh\",\"name\":\"Jon Casual Farmhouse Wood Dining Table, 54&quot;-72&quot;W, Birch Finish\",\"description\":\"54&quot;L x 54-72&quot;W x 30&quot;H Solid hardwood made of poplar; birch veneer A simple design and rustic finish make it casual and ideal for a modern farmhouse décor A great table for dining or doing homework and crafts Assembly in 30 minutes or less; attach base to top Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This handsome rustic table is ideal for a lake house -- or for adding a warm natural touch to your home. The solid hardwood and sturdy construction will last through many family dinners, and an extra leaf allows you to extend the round table to a longer oval when needed.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Jon Casual Farmhouse Wood Dining Table, 54&quot;-72&quot;W, Birch Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81O2ppTqySL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CcJVxNLuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CcJVxNLuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ykkjPNDTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ykkjPNDTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zhHcUBIjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zhHcUBIjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913g4LLjEbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913g4LLjEbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B10qGdxh2kS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B10qGdxh2kS.jpg\"},{\