      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4CZP57\",\"sku\":\"B07B4CZP57\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"andover-ottoman-32-w-charcoal-leather-b07b4czp57\",\"name\":\"Andover Ottoman, 32&quot;W, Charcoal Leather\",\"description\":\"Overall: 32&quot;W x 25&quot;D x 21&quot;H; seat height: 21&quot;H; seat depth: 33&quot;D; leg height: 4.25&quot;H Sturdy wood frame with rich top-grain leather upholstery Transitional style blends well with a variety of home-decor themes. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you. Complete your living space with this stylish ottoman. With its charcoal-colored upholstery, this ottoman is an ideal accent for transitional-style home decor. The solid-wood frame enhances durability and extends this ottoman’s life.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Andover Ottoman, 32&quot;W, Charcoal Leather\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81dY-MU1TZL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81XPQmmE68L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81XPQmmE68L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71enQFgSM3L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71enQFgSM3L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JmEnF4WUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1JmEnF4WUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tRMFkrCdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tRMFkrCdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nOrkI7LgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81nOrkI7LgL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\"