      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075X5445L\",\"sku\":\"B075X5445L\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-parks-mid-century-modern-wingback-leather-accent-chair-30-5-w-saddle-b075x5445l\",\"name\":\"Rivet Parks Mid-Century Modern Wingback Leather Accent Chair, 30.5&quot;W, Saddle\",\"description\":\"The Mid-century inspired wingback gets a modern update in this leather accent chair. A matching luxe pillow provides extra lumbar support to a tall back and perfectly shaped arms. Tapered hardwood legs add a crowning touch to a bold, impressive style. 30.5&quot;W x 35.25''D x 40''H 100% top grain leather upholstery and pillow; hardwood frame and birch legs A refresh of the classic wingback Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. No assembly. Wipe with a dry cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Parks Mid-Century Modern Wingback Leather Accent Chair, 30.5&quot;W, Saddle\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+R-muInXL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VSuuWY3dL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VSuuWY3dL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1MCesN-faL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1MCesN-faL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1gpeqe98NL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1gpeqe98NL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A17iMpRAyUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A17iMpRAyUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DdVZ-z5zL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DdVZ-z5zL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"40