        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSLTL8K\",\"sku\":\"B07HSLTL8K\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-stevens-modern-storage-accent-side-end-table-nightstand-19-69-w-brushed-tundra-gray-b07hsltl8k\",\"name\":\"Rivet Stevens Modern Storage Accent Side End Table Nightstand, 19.69&quot;W, Brushed Tundra Gray\",\"description\":\"Update your home décor with this gorgeous modern-style end table. Made from solid acacia, this table is highly durable, and its brushed tundra-gray finish blends well with most home-décor themes. Its drawer and top surface offer helpful organization and display options. 19.69&quot;W x 19.69&quot;D x 19.69&quot;H Solid acacia Clean lines and rich gray finish create a modern design that's perfect for any contemporary-style home. This stylish end table has a drawer for storing items. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Stevens Modern Storage Accent Side End Table Nightstand, 19.69&quot;W, Brushed Tundra Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814gQY784GL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Kok9zBWAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Kok9zBWAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81c7WgAkstL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81c7WgAkstL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lEW8iK0iL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lEW8iK0iL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Mb9KHSR5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Mb9KHSR5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Fjghnp4YL.jpg\",\"url\