      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSG5DGP\",\"sku\":\"B07HSG5DGP\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-roxmere-mid-century-modern-tv-media-console-center-stand-59-w-acacia-wood-amp-dark-metal-b07hsg5dgp\",\"name\":\"Rivet Roxmere Mid-Century Modern TV Media Console Center Stand, 59&quot;W, Acacia Wood &amp; Dark Metal\",\"description\":\"Complete your interior design with this beautiful modern-style media center, made from solid acacia with a sandblast-gray finish that nicely complements most home-décor themes. With 2 niches and shelves behind a cabinet door, this media center will add both style and organization to your room. 59&quot;W x 17.7&quot;D x 19.7&quot;H Solid acacia with MDF acacia veneer Modern styling that also blends well with rustic- and contemporary-style home décor This media center has 2 niches, a cabinet door, and shelves behind the door for maximum organization options. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Roxmere Mid-Century Modern TV Media Console Center Stand, 59&quot;W, Acacia Wood &amp; Dark Metal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811KOvJDGXL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91dKUpK9AbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91dKUpK9AbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81hruAErnIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81hruAErnIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RaNYPL3gL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91RaNYPL3gL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j7JmlRTFL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j7JmlRTFL.jpg\"},{\"