        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075QMGMY8\",\"sku\":\"B075QMGMY8\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"darby-wingback-full-queen-headboard-66-25-w-warm-grey-b075qmgmy8\",\"name\":\"Darby Wingback Full/Queen Headboard, 66.25&quot;W, Warm Grey\",\"description\":\"This mid-century modern headboard's wingback design is covered in linen-look performance fabric for durability. Nailhead trim adds another touch of elegance, and ample foam padding makes it comfortable to lean against while enjoying a good book. 66.25&quot;W x 11.5&quot;D x 51.5&quot;H Hardwood frame; polyester performance fabric; metal nailheads with antiqued brass finish An update of a classic mid-century modern style Performance fabric is durable, easy to clean. Headboard has Dacron-wrapped foam padding. Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Clean with water-based shampoo or foam upholstery cleaner. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Darby Wingback Full/Queen Headboard, 66.25&quot;W, Warm Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VDeEvnqOL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1bWkVT0YzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1bWkVT0YzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B11uWK5vntS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B11uWK5vntS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1u9FExbhxS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1u9FExbhxS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yZH9HCKhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yZH9HCKhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1fcZNmPwgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/origi