        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07JY32YJN\",\"sku\":\"B07JY32YJN\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"wolcott-swivel-chair-fabric-33-w-mist-b07jy32yjn\",\"name\":\"Wolcott Swivel Chair, Fabric, 33&quot;W, Mist\",\"description\":\"This mist-colored swivel chair is the perfect way to add one more comfy seat to your living room. It’s also built to last, with a sturdy wood frame, a tight fixed back, a reversible seat cushion, and stain-resistant fabric upholstery. Sturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric The tight, fixed back and reversible seat cushions ensure durability and comfort. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This item is made to order just for you Overall: 33&quot;W x 36&quot;D x 33&quot;H; seat height: 21&quot;H; seat depth: 23&quot;D; seat back height: 33&quot;H; arm height: 25&quot;H;\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Wolcott Swivel Chair, Fabric, 33&quot;W, Mist\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VU8qtBPvL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A14xuhN7ntL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A14xuhN7ntL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1HCZe++MWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1HCZe++MWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VGldG+qyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1VGldG+qyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1MrWevnJnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1MrWevnJnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GB0JUQzTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1GB0JUQzTL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\