        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B072ZK885L\",\"sku\":\"B072ZK885L\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-king-street-industrial-floating-side-table-night-stand-walnut-black-metal-glass-b072zk885l\",\"name\":\"Rivet King Street Industrial Floating Side Table Night Stand, Walnut, Black Metal, Glass\",\"description\":\"A wooden shelf floats in a metal frame underneath the tempered glass top on this modern console table. This piece is ideal for holding a lamp or displaying framed photos and other treasured objects in your living room, bedroom or hallway. 16.9&quot;L x 16.9&quot;W x 21.3&quot;H Engineered wood, walnut veneer drawers, metal legs, tempered glass top Modern Industrial Movable lacquer tray can hide or uncover four compartment slots No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet King Street Industrial Floating Side Table Night Stand, Walnut, Black Metal, Glass\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818nwDLREzL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ECV9a6klL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ECV9a6klL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+4OOPa8hL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1+4OOPa8hL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ikLIHWS-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ikLIHWS-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817Jzm9DRIL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/817Jzm9DRIL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1vLHQbXITL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1vLHQbXITL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis