        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QDNRFKG\",\"sku\":\"B07QDNRFKG\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-leather-tufted-dining-chair-43-h-cognac-b07qdnrfkg\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Leather Tufted Dining Chair, 43&quot;H, Cognac\",\"description\":\"The tufted back creates a textured look that brings a classic touch to this modern design. The cognac coloring makes this chair a match for any dining decor, and the leather upholstery is easy to care for. The solid wood frame ensures this chair is sturdy and comfortable. 25&quot;W x 27&quot;D x 43&quot;H; seat height: 20&quot;H; seat depth: 18&quot;D; seat back height: 24&quot;H Solid wood frame; top grain leather Transitional design with tufting in the back No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Leather Tufted Dining Chair, 43&quot;H, Cognac\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81A49RaTqOL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81gY8voWFUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81gY8voWFUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/713KqO+GI1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/713KqO+GI1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DQYJW5onL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91DQYJW5onL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/815fYe6d6YL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/815fYe6d6YL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1HzeJe3gML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1HzeJe3gML.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"H