      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z6S94K\",\"sku\":\"B075Z6S94K\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-swope-curved-arm-swivel-office-chair-26-w-aqua-b075z6s94k\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Swope Curved Arm Swivel Office Chair, 26&quot;W, Aqua\",\"description\":\"26&quot;W x 24.8&quot;D x 33.9&quot;H Fabric is durable 100% polyester. Metal swivel base and legs. A swivel chair ideal for a desk but attractive enough for any room No assembly required. Vacuum or wipe with a soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. While designed for the office, this swivel chair adds refreshing style to any room. The Mid-century inspired silhouette features graceful curves and low-profile arms Four metal legs extend outward from the swivel base.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Swope Curved Arm Swivel Office Chair, 26&quot;W, Aqua\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91sLBKennvL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1MVuAak+4S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1MVuAak+4S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91I5k6sqQzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91I5k6sqQzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A15aoAAZDbL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A15aoAAZDbL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BAaq+7onL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1BAaq+7onL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91p4S637wTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91p4S637wTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XyM7yYJTL.jpg\",\"url\