      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075QFCZ1Z\",\"sku\":\"B075QFCZ1Z\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-modern-nailhead-upholstered-storage-bench-58-inch-l-natural-b075qfcz1z\",\"name\":\"Rivet Modern Nailhead Upholstered Storage Bench, 58 Inch L, Natural\",\"description\":\"With a roomy interior and slow-close hinges, this upholstered storage bench is as functional as it is stylish. Clean, simple lines and lovely fabric are accented by nailhead trim, giving your blankets a stylish new home. 58&quot;L x 18&quot;W x 18&quot;H Upholstered with 100% polyester fabric. Metal nailhead trim and hinges. Modern design with neutral-color fabric to blend with transitional and modern décor. A stylish piece for storing blankets or clothes; slow-close hinges for safe closure No assembly needed. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Modern Nailhead Upholstered Storage Bench, 58 Inch L, Natural\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Tbo0dQLHL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1P3FEPQ9IL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1P3FEPQ9IL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VXzK-n7FL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VXzK-n7FL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mRFeEzHfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91mRFeEzHfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pIWwDyjxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pIWwDyjxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1YbMalnEPS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1YbMalnEPS.jpg\"}],\"attribu