      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B082SVGL8Y\",\"sku\":\"B082SVGL8Y\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"sadie-living-room-wingback-accent-chair-33-w-oat-beige-b082svgl8y\",\"name\":\"Sadie Living Room Wingback Accent Chair, 33&quot;W, Oat Beige\",\"description\":\"The classic wingback chair gets a modern refresh with neutral upholstery in Oat Beige. Made to order in the United States of partially imported materials, it features a sturdy wood frame, tall tapered legs, and durable, tightly woven fabric. Sturdy wood frame and legs; hard-wearing fabric with reversible seat cushion for durability; no assembly required Product Dimensions: 33&quot;W x 38&quot;D x 41&quot;H Care Instructions: Avoid moisture; wipe down with a clean, soft cloth Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Sadie Living Room Wingback Accent Chair, 33&quot;W, Oat Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91i+sGnkjrL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81amQBY72EL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81amQBY72EL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91EWIYvRoWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91EWIYvRoWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GzucZR29L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91GzucZR29L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91BKfxF+0WL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91BKfxF+0WL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/815vJ5lGYcL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/815vJ5lGYcL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91m9lyDXtgL.jpg\",\"u