        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B082DMQ8L4\",\"sku\":\"B082DMQ8L4\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"velvet-upholstered-office-chair-with-wood-armrests-and-wood-finished-base-23-w-charcoal-gray-b082dmq8l4\",\"name\":\"Velvet-Upholstered Office Chair with Wood Armrests and Wood-Finished Base, 23&quot;W, Charcoal Gray\",\"description\":\"This comfortable office chair is both luxurious and practical. An attractive addition to your workspace, it will support your back and head while you work, and its adjustable height makes it suitable for anyone. Classic hooded casters make for easy mobility. Overall: 23&quot;W x 29&quot;D x 38.5&quot;–40.5&quot;H; adjustable seat height: 18.75&quot;–20.75&quot; Sleek oak-finished arms and base, metal casters, performance velvet upholstery This chair has a 360-degree swivel mechanism with height and tension adjustments to accommodate your work style. Plush cushions upholstered in grey velvet make this chair a stylish addition to your office space. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Always use on firm, level ground. Do not stand on the seat or let children play with this chair. Check (and if necessary, tighten) all screws every 90 days. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Velvet-Upholstered Office Chair with Wood Armrests and Wood-Finished Base, 23&quot;W, Charcoal Gray\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+bqllZzTL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/910N0b+thhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/910N0b+thhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Hlgf-cqWL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Hlgf-cqWL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91KCiygoWML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91KCiygoWML.jp