        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B076NKJCRN\",\"sku\":\"B076NKJCRN\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"parson-farmhouse-dining-room-kitchen-chairs-40-inch-height-set-of-2-beige-b076nkjcrn\",\"name\":\"Parson Farmhouse Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, 40 Inch Height, Set of 2, Beige\",\"description\":\"Performance fabric Classic materials blend with traditional and rustic farmhouse décor. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. The curved camelback tops of the seatbacks and beautiful wooden legs create elegant lines in these comfortable, durable chairs. A clean, vertical slit down each chair back, with an &quot;x&quot; cross stitch at the bottom, adds a graceful style touch. 25.25&quot;W x 21&quot;D x 40&quot;H Assembly is required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Parson Farmhouse Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, 40 Inch Height, Set of 2, Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91E4QL7WY+L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CoO+Kqt+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91CoO+Kqt+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hd7zpMcQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hd7zpMcQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1nSOtp8oVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1nSOtp8oVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19tfFVZVeL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A19tfFVZVeL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"40.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"25.25\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"length\",\"label\":\"Length\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"21.0\",\