      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B082MS2R6P\",\"sku\":\"B082MS2R6P\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"decatur-modern-tufted-wingback-living-room-accent-chair-32-3-w-optical-b082ms2r6p\",\"name\":\"Decatur Modern Tufted Wingback Living Room Accent Chair, 32.3&quot;W, Optical\",\"description\":\"This contemporary wingback accent chair in Optical looks beautiful while it stands up to the demands of a busy life. Stitch-tufted fabric and gently curved sides bring style and comfort, while durable construction holds up to family, pets and entertaining in your living room. Solid wood frame; upholstered with polyester fabric Minimal assembly; just attach legs Product Dimensions: 32.3&quot;W x 35.8&quot;D x 36.2&quot;H Care Instructions: Avoid moisture and wipe clean with soft, dry cloth Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Decatur Modern Tufted Wingback Living Room Accent Chair, 32.3&quot;W, Optical\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+fld+uP-L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91UCtVRaSGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91UCtVRaSGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61QzNOhvUdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61QzNOhvUdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81p0cBtRt1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81p0cBtRt1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71dChqrUu4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71dChqrUu4L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81G5+NeN18L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81G5+NeN18L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.google