        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075ZBW1QM\",\"sku\":\"B075ZBW1QM\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"larson-industrial-wood-metal-side-end-table-22-w-set-of-2-walnut-b075zbw1qm\",\"name\":\"Larson Industrial Wood & Metal Side End Table, 22&quot;W, Set of 2, Walnut\",\"description\":\"This set of two bunching tables can book-end a sofa or stand side by side as cocktail/coffee tables. Solid pine wood tops and shelves have a natural distressed finish, while the metal legs and trim have a darker brown matte finish. 22&quot;W x 22&quot;L x 19&quot;H Solid pine wood tops and shelves with walnut finish; metal legs Industrial and rustic touches allow this set to blend with many styles. Top with lamps on either end of a sofa or use for serving snacks to your guests Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Larson Industrial Wood & Metal Side End Table, 22&quot;W, Set of 2, Walnut\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/814jwv-BYML.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81LeyfYsH+L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81LeyfYsH+L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yiYGinz5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1yiYGinz5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915C-YQucaL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/915C-YQucaL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-GvTp-tRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-GvTp-tRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1a40QcGnKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1a40QcGnKL.jpg\"}