      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7B75GF\",\"sku\":\"B07B7B75GF\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"amber-metal-buffet-table-kitchen-storage-rack-47-5-w-white-carrera-marble-black-metal-b07b7b75gf\",\"name\":\"Amber Metal Buffet Table Kitchen Storage Rack, 47.5&quot;W, White, Carrera Marble, Black Metal\",\"description\":\"24&quot;L x 45.5&quot;W x 36.5&quot;H Metal with black finish; marble top A transitional piece that works with any décor Use as bar cart or pull out for extra counter or island space Assembly in an hour or less Free return for 30 days. 3-year warranty. You'll get a handsome industrial design along with functionality in this multi-functional bar cart. With a beautiful marble top and sturdy metal base, this piece is also convenient to pull out as a small kitchen island or for extra counter space.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Amber Metal Buffet Table Kitchen Storage Rack, 47.5&quot;W, White, Carrera Marble, Black Metal\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Yezkdxd9L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91t2+LK9IwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91t2+LK9IwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ncg6A0tCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71ncg6A0tCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Cs5ZN3u8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Cs5ZN3u8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Y04L6A7oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Y04L6A7oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71HgBLhyd7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71HgBLhyd7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://st