      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07BWK59RG\",\"sku\":\"B07BWK59RG\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bradbury-chesterfield-modern-tufted-ottoman-30-3-w-warm-grey-b07bwk59rg\",\"name\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Modern Tufted Ottoman, 30.3&quot;W, Warm Grey\",\"description\":\"This classic, tailored ottoman is the perfect place for extra guests to sit or to rest your feet after a long day. Simple modern design in a magnificent deep navy color adds just the right pop of color. Dimensions: 22.4”D x 30.3 ”W x 19.7”H Solid and engineered hardwoods; polyester/nylon fabric Timeless and functional Refreshed design of a classic Easy-to-attach legs Free returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bradbury Chesterfield Modern Tufted Ottoman, 30.3&quot;W, Warm Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jBJlZtKyL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cwVZVtBgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81cwVZVtBgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A188EHQUNfL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A188EHQUNfL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18tJr72ZAL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A18tJr72ZAL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91e76sc6XmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91e76sc6XmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91o81MRbfhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91o81MRbfhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j76+1XpuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1j76+1XpuL.jpg\"},{