        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B0853VPXF3\",\"sku\":\"B0853VPXF3\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"hansberry-upholstered-swivel-chair-34-4-w-hemp-b0853vpxf3\",\"name\":\"Hansberry Upholstered Swivel Chair, 34.4&quot;W, Hemp\",\"description\":\"The sloping arms and low profile of this comfortable chair make it a welcome addition to your living room or office. The swiveling mechanism makes it easy to carry on conversations with everyone in the room. 34.3&quot;W x 37.4&quot;D x 36.6&quot;H Metal, fabric, and foam-filled cushions This swivel chair has an elegant wood base upholstered with a stain-resistant fabric. No assembly required Avoid moisture, and wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Hansberry Upholstered Swivel Chair, 34.4&quot;W, Hemp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81EI0h5qM2L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71RSSCjVehL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71RSSCjVehL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Obmv6hngL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71Obmv6hngL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+aNUaimOL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71+aNUaimOL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811CSIZmf-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/811CSIZmf-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71PeRrypFuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71PeRrypFuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91uaal1uWKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-im