    "dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Data": {
      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07LBXYTT9\",\"sku\":\"B07LBXYTT9\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"solimo-optima-manual-box-storage-king-bed-sienna-cherry-b07lbxytt9\",\"name\":\"Solimo Optima Manual Box Storage King Bed (Sienna Cherry)\",\"description\":\"King size bed with dimensions of 196cm (length), 206cm (width), 82cm (height) Premium quality engineered wood structure with more than 20 safety and quality tests performed Smooth edges for protection against accidental scrapes and cuts Underwent dynamic loading tests for 21,000 cycles and edge durability tests for 10,000 cycles Capable of withstanding loads of up to 360 kg Elegant caramel mahogany finish which gives a glossy look and makes cleaning easy Made with high quality European standard particle board Tested for resistance against humidity to ensure durability Free from harmful chemicals and toxins for safe use Comes with 3-year warranty on manufacturing defects Do not move or push without dismantling. Avoid using wet cloth to wipe furniture for better care\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Solimo Optima Manual Box Storage King Bed (Sienna Cherry)\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81b-elguZKL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71wGN75XIZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71wGN75XIZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711um2YFZxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/711um2YFZxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HY+HcTlVL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81HY+HcTlVL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61TVZh6K4bL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/61/61TVZh6K4bL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleap