    "dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Data": {
      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QFP4WFR\",\"sku\":\"B07QFP4WFR\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-stacey-mid-century-modern-round-backed-armless-living-room-chair-27-w-sangria-b07qfp4wfr\",\"name\":\"Rivet Stacey Mid-Century Modern Round-Backed, Armless Living Room Chair, 27&quot;W, Sangria\",\"description\":\"This chair’s rounded back and armless design make it both comfortable and stylishly modern. The solid hardwood structure creates a secure base, and brass caps on the legs provide easy maneuverability. The rich sangria-colored upholstery adds a touch of classic elegance to this contemporary piece. 27&quot;W x 28&quot;D x 29&quot;H; seat height: 18&quot;H; seat depth: 20&quot;D; leg height: 13&quot; Solid hardwood frame and brass cap; 80% polyester and 20% acrylic fabric The sculptural silhouette of this chair makes it a superb accent piece. Comfortable without being confining, this armless chair is a welcome addition to any room. Assemble in 15 minutes or less Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Stacey Mid-Century Modern Round-Backed, Armless Living Room Chair, 27&quot;W, Sangria\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81szWDUNPkL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816Tu+9W30L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/816Tu+9W30L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ZIbIIEWSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ZIbIIEWSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tF5SbJkqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71tF5SbJkqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lY-KdPROL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-p