      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4W23D7\",\"sku\":\"B07B4W23D7\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"bridgewater-curved-queen-headboard-66-w-lagoon-b07b4w23d7\",\"name\":\"Bridgewater Curved Queen Headboard, 66&quot;W, Lagoon\",\"description\":\"This headboard adds classic style to any space. Hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the headboards curved silhouette. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. This item is made to order just for you Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame The headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort. Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. 66&quot;W x 4&quot;D x 56&quot;H\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bridgewater Curved Queen Headboard, 66&quot;W, Lagoon\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ngsRBbzpL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1B6onY9FxL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1B6onY9FxL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1FwjDfXqKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1FwjDfXqKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mC-Rg1RZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1mC-Rg1RZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A13CIku1PJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A13CIku1PJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A15QFyOHKqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A15QFyOHKqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"h