      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4SCPG5\",\"sku\":\"B07B4SCPG5\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"edgecliff-contemporary-tufted-king-bed-with-headboard-81-w-grey-b07b4scpg5\",\"name\":\"Edgecliff Contemporary Tufted King Bed with Headboard, 81&quot;W, Grey\",\"description\":\"89&quot;L x 81&quot;W x 62&quot;H Fabric (95% polyester; 3% cotton; 2% nylon); wood legs Elegant tufted upholstery with clean lines for easy transitional style High performance fabric is easy to clean, stain resistant and extremely durable Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour with two people Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty This upholstered bed has it all: style, durability and coziness. This light gray platform-style bed features an elegant tufted headboard with clean, modern edges. It's covered in high performance fabric that is long lasting and resists stains.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Edgecliff Contemporary Tufted King Bed with Headboard, 81&quot;W, Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91m3ak6uJLL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1Gsn6QUj2S.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1Gsn6QUj2S.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1zk119qocS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1zk119qocS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91eL+KegodL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91eL+KegodL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-k28kZXhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-k28kZXhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B16RvpAkPHS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B16RvpAkPHS.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\