      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B084W2WJJ2\",\"sku\":\"B084W2WJJ2\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"louise-memory-swivel-barstool-42-1-h-wax-sand-b084w2wjj2\",\"name\":\"Louise Memory Swivel Barstool, 42.1&quot;H, Wax Sand\",\"description\":\"This barstool features a memory swivel, which will return the seat to its proper position every time. The sturdy wood frame includes a footrest, and the padded wax-sand-colored-upholstered seat makes this barstool an easy addition to your breakfast bar or kitchen counter! 23.6&quot;W x 24&quot;D x 42.1&quot;H; seat height: 29.9&quot;H; seat depth: 16.9&quot;D; seat back height: 16.1&quot;H; leg height: 26&quot;H Solid hardwood frame with vegan leather A memory-swivel mechanism means this barstool always looks tidy. Wingback dining chair with polished brass nailhead trim No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Louise Memory Swivel Barstool, 42.1&quot;H, Wax Sand\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-rgDj68rL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71iZ-RSa+tL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71iZ-RSa+tL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51N1RM9phNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/51/51N1RM9phNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91OHZ09r3oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71JRl8kWTGL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71JRl8kWTGL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71nlwF4QowL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/pures