      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B084W2X38T\",\"sku\":\"B084W2X38T\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"esme-memory-swivel-counter-height-barstool-39-4-h-slate-b084w2x38t\",\"name\":\"Esme Memory-Swivel Counter-Height Barstool, 39.4&quot;H, Slate\",\"description\":\"This slate-colored counter-height barstool features a memory swivel, so it will always look polished and poised at your bar or kitchen counter. The very slightly winged high back makes a refined statement when set against your classic kitchen cabinets or polished bar. 20.1&quot;W x 22.4&quot;D x 39.4&quot;H; seat height: 26&quot;H; seat depth: 16.5&quot;D; seat back height: 18.5&quot;H; leg height: 20.9&quot;H Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric The classic style of these chairs makes theme equally suited to modern or traditional decor. A classic transitional look makes this stool. No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Esme Memory-Swivel Counter-Height Barstool, 39.4&quot;H, Slate\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pjIUGUb1L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ryJX4UxTL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81ryJX4UxTL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1K7jUru+qS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1K7jUru+qS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pC6SEoU5L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81pC6SEoU5L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914srQ2grRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/914srQ2grRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/o