      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7BJK9S\",\"sku\":\"B07B7BJK9S\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"jon-casual-farmhouse-wood-dining-chair-40-h-pack-of-2-beige-b07b7bjk9s\",\"name\":\"Jon Casual Farmhouse Wood Dining Chair, 40&quot;H, Pack of 2, Beige\",\"description\":\"23.5&quot;L x 21&quot;W x 40&quot;H Hardwood made of rubberwood; rattan back Natural wood, rattan and fabric combine for a transitional or modern rustic look A perfect chair for the kitchen or dining room, or anywhere else you need extra seating Fully assemble all parts Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. Grooved details on the frame and back give this chair an upscale rustic appeal. The squared back has a fabric inset on the front and rattan on the rear. Quality hardwood and construction techniques ensure it will last through many family dinners.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Jon Casual Farmhouse Wood Dining Chair, 40&quot;H, Pack of 2, Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81901EVnCGL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1a1e2Z3G7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1a1e2Z3G7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9172btlOK-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/9172btlOK-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zS-tTV-bL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91zS-tTV-bL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mljICrcXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81mljICrcXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91D7TRkumUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91D7TRkumUL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"