        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7DMMTH\",\"sku\":\"B07B7DMMTH\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-fun-contemporary-office-chair-36-39-grey-black-b07b7dmmth\",\"name\":\"Rivet Fun Contemporary Office Chair, 36&quot;-39&quot;, Grey/Black\",\"description\":\"With both height and tilt adjustments along with 360 degree swivel, this chair is functional and comfortable. The classic grey upholstery is paired with a metal base on casters, for a look that blends with modern or industrial decor. 21&quot;W x 16.5&quot;D x 36&quot;-39&quot;H Hardwood; metal base, polyester fabric, foam padding in back and seat Minimalist modern style 360 degree swivel function; height and tilt of chair can be adjusted Assembly in 15 minutes or less; simply screw on seat and casters Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Fun Contemporary Office Chair, 36&quot;-39&quot;, Grey/Black\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91LIJoviT3L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+SZBcSIBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91+SZBcSIBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1YOJOLZaHS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1YOJOLZaHS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Vm0eKwGuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Vm0eKwGuL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1sZZsjwxjS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1sZZsjwxjS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VCZoXuJJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91VCZoXuJJL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\