        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QGWM35P\",\"sku\":\"B07QGWM35P\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"mid-century-counter-stool-37-5-h-beige-b07qgwm35p\",\"name\":\"Mid-Century Counter Stool, 37.5&quot;H, Beige\",\"description\":\"This high-back chair has gently sloping sides and foam-padded upholstery for extra comfort. Quilted detail provides an appealing pattern to the exterior. Solid wood legs offer sturdy support while the fabric makes for easy cleaning. 24.25&quot;W x 22&quot;D x 37.5&quot;H; seat height: 30&quot;H; seat depth: 16&quot;D; seat back height: 12.25&quot;H Durable fabric on wood frame The foam padding and elastic suspension system help keep the back and seat firm and springy. Contemporary design with light-green upholstered fabric combines with durable wood frame and solid wood legs with walnut finish. Assemble in 15-30 minutes Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Mid-Century Counter Stool, 37.5&quot;H, Beige\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91wr8viigHL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lgrBLB6HL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91lgrBLB6HL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81L1STCz6oL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81L1STCz6oL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/812x5waBY-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/812x5waBY-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Sqx4YLXNL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Sqx4YLXNL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1dsDfjNr4L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.