        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B78G1BW\",\"sku\":\"B07B78G1BW\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-ian-mid-century-modern-wood-buffet-bar-cabinet-credenza-brown-b07b78g1bw\",\"name\":\"Rivet Ian Mid-Century Modern Wood Buffet Bar Cabinet Credenza, Brown\",\"description\":\"This mid-century buffet is as functional as it is stylish. With four adjustable inside shelves and a lower slatted shelf perfect for laying wine bottles, this piece will enhance your dining room but could also enhance your living space or hallway. 18&quot;L x 54&quot;W x 32&quot;H Sturdy hardwoods with acacia veneer Strong modular design with minimalist hardware is classic mid-century modern Interior shelves are adjustable and removable Assembly in 30 minutes or less; bolt on legs and lower shelf Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Ian Mid-Century Modern Wood Buffet Bar Cabinet Credenza, Brown\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91dsjDGVRLL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cmmh27hdL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91cmmh27hdL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hZlbwWzUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hZlbwWzUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91P-cFV5WyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91P-cFV5WyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/810Tdxt0VKL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/810Tdxt0VKL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-SKeS4msL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1-SKeS4msL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/pure