        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07QJ23JZG\",\"sku\":\"B07QJ23JZG\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-contemporary-dining-chair-with-swivel-seat-33-h-hemp-b07qj23jzg\",\"name\":\"Rivet Contemporary Dining Chair with Swivel Seat, 33&quot;H, Hemp\",\"description\":\"The swivel seat of this chair allows for greater mobility in any dining area. The stain-resistant and moisture-repellent upholstery fabric means that caring for this item will be simple. Its hemp color can match most dining room decorations, and the solid wood frame gives it sturdy construction. 21&quot;W x 24&quot;D x 33&quot;H; seat height: 19&quot;H; seat depth: 18&quot;D; seat back height: 14&quot;H Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric made of 95% polyester, 5% nylon Swivel chair that can be suitable for many occasions No assembly required Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Contemporary Dining Chair with Swivel Seat, 33&quot;H, Hemp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Xo3iioSPL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lqyXnRgRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81lqyXnRgRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hycqJ1IoL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1hycqJ1IoL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hGm7eSmQL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91hGm7eSmQL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yn+jUHhBL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81yn+jUHhBL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/818F4FRAZML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.goo