        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B7GV4P3\",\"sku\":\"B07B7GV4P3\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-modern-white-marble-and-metal-side-end-table-22-black-amp-marble-b07b7gv4p3\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern White Marble and Metal Side End Table, 22&quot;, Black &amp; Marble\",\"description\":\"Two iron trapezoids form a sturdy base for the lovely white marble top. This side table will be a handsome conversation piece along with providing a place for a small lamp or a few favorite photos. Its compact design will fit nicely in small spaces. 17.88&quot;W x 17.88&quot;D x 22&quot;H Marble top with iron base Stark contrasting colors and geometric design give this a totally modern flair A compact design great for a small space beside a sofa No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern White Marble and Metal Side End Table, 22&quot;, Black &amp; Marble\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Zlwu41c6L.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/812Ix1rMj9L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/812Ix1rMj9L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Wc9dWgMqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Wc9dWgMqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91YFFt1VJ1L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91YFFt1VJ1L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81G2BwDoIwL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81G2BwDoIwL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JJZ0ttAjL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81JJZ0ttAjL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"htt