        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B075Z6S9CY\",\"sku\":\"B075Z6S9CY\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"roland-x-frame-side-end-table-24-w-pine-b075z6s9cy\",\"name\":\"Roland X-Frame Side End Table, 24&quot;W, Pine\",\"description\":\"24&quot;L x 24&quot;W x 20&quot;H Solid pine top with metal frame Industrial, rustic and modern touches come together in a piece that blends with most décor This sturdy piece will last through years of family movie nights and entertaining guests Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty. This wood and metal end table combines elements of industrial and rustic, allowing it to blend with many styles. The solid pine wood top has a natural distressed finish, while the metal base has modern &quot;x&quot; frames on either end.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Roland X-Frame Side End Table, 24&quot;W, Pine\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91XJH1zVXuL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ug8bx8VgL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91ug8bx8VgL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Qnkp86ciL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91Qnkp86ciL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B16uXDdnSYS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B16uXDdnSYS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jjFiZTgyL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jjFiZTgyL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Ajr-iHe-L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Ajr-iHe-L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/910