        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07177355J\",\"sku\":\"B07177355J\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-west-mid-century-oak-nightstand-bedside-1-drawer-table-22-w-dark-oak-finish-b07177355j\",\"name\":\"Rivet West, Mid-Century, Oak Nightstand Bedside, 1-Drawer Table, 22&quot;W, Dark Oak Finish\",\"description\":\"This mid-century nightstand's brass pull and concealed drawer glides provide a modern style, while veneer made from hand-selected quarter-sawn oak adds a distinctive grain. A back-mounted power outlet and two USB ports make it even more functional. 22&quot;W x 16&quot;D x 23&quot;H Solid hardwoods with finish of wire-brushed matte dark oak Modern and simple yet distinctive design No assembly needed. Wipe with soft dry cloth. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Drawer is suspended on easy opening, concealed, self-closing extension guides\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet West, Mid-Century, Oak Nightstand Bedside, 1-Drawer Table, 22&quot;W, Dark Oak Finish\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1x9RCXBDEL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Efaut9FPL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Efaut9FPL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1O3FrXwLqL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1O3FrXwLqL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918eDJDLdUL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/918eDJDLdUL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91uedhWpC8L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91uedhWpC8L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1btNsY4THL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/