      "content": {
        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07HSH278Q\",\"sku\":\"B07HSH278Q\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rylee-modern-acacia-wood-nightstand-22-w-gray-wash-acacia-b07hsh278q\",\"name\":\"Rylee Modern Acacia Wood Nightstand, 22&quot;W, Gray-Wash Acacia\",\"description\":\"Add a modern flair to your home with this beautiful nightstand. Made from solid acacia with a subtle gray-wash finish, this nightstand perfectly complements most home-décor styles. Its 4 elegant but strong legs keep the nightstand sturdy, and its 2 drawers provide plenty of storage options. 21.7&quot;W x 15.7&quot;D x 23.6&quot;H Solid acacia, with acacia veneer on back panel, shelves, and drawer bottoms Subtle gray-washed distressed finish and clean lines create an attractive modern look. This nightstand has 2 sturdy drawers. No assembly required Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rylee Modern Acacia Wood Nightstand, 22&quot;W, Gray-Wash Acacia\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91TU7J9ZqUL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jhIceXCXL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91jhIceXCXL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913tIngHHRL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/913tIngHHRL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91bhPj0oLJL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91bhPj0oLJL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1ShIdV8OMS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1ShIdV8OMS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Y6awpjozL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81Y6awpjozL.jpg\"}],\"attribute