        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07TZRJSKN\",\"sku\":\"B07TZRJSKN\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-decatur-modern-kitchen-bar-stool-41-h-hemp-b07tzrjskn\",\"name\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Kitchen Bar Stool, 41&quot;H, Hemp\",\"description\":\"This beautiful modern barstool features a bold squared-off design for both the seat and legs. The metal frame, supported by an H-spreader bar supports a plush, backed, armless seat covered in versatile neutral upholstery. Overall: 22&quot;D x 18&quot;W x 41&quot;H. Seat height: 30&quot; Solid wooden frame and black metal legs combine for maximum style and support Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Arrives fully assembled. Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Decatur Modern Kitchen Bar Stool, 41&quot;H, Hemp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71-KVvCvNCL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71AGQYA6w7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71AGQYA6w7L.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71xjX0Vm6bL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71xjX0Vm6bL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+fzDnoezL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81+fzDnoezL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81zs5CXC2kL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81zs5CXC2kL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81NzZbebPCL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81NzZbebPCL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/71/71uvI0Dgu7L.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-image