        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4G5R5H\",\"sku\":\"B07B4G5R5H\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"canfield-modern-reclining-tufted-arm-chair-30-3-w-light-grey-b07b4g5r5h\",\"name\":\"Canfield Modern Reclining Tufted Arm Chair, 30.3&quot;W, Light Grey\",\"description\":\"30.3&quot;W x 36.6&quot;D x 41.3&quot;H Polyester fabric on wood frame Modern and classic touches come together for a transitional style A push-back recliner that's attractive when fully upright, too. Assembly in 15 minutes or less; just screw in legs Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Traditional button tufting combined with modern straight arms results in a transitional style. This recliner is comfy and soft to sit in when upright, then pushes back, with a pop-up foot rest, when you're ready to truly relax.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Canfield Modern Reclining Tufted Arm Chair, 30.3&quot;W, Light Grey\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1j7qS8fyzS.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1tVGYbjhLS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/B1/B1tVGYbjhLS.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Utxf1-NhL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1Utxf1-NhL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1s+GSJGzZL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1s+GSJGzZL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-cOZxvMmL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91-cOZxvMmL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1CRwIvfymL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1CRwIvfymL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"val