        "bytes": "{\"id\":\"B07B4W2H78\",\"sku\":\"B07B4W2H78\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"slug\":\"rivet-mid-century-modern-wood-king-bed-79-w-casual-cherry-b07b4w2h78\",\"name\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Wood King Bed, 79&quot;W, Casual Cherry\",\"description\":\"79&quot;W x 85.2&quot;D x 50&quot;H; LegHeight: 4.25&quot; 100% constructed by hand Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour with two people Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty. Complement your mid-century modern bedroom escape with this handcrafted king-size platform bed. The straight lines of the paneled headboard contrast with the tapered legs for a relaxing, casual style that is sure to carry you to peaceful sleep.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"alt\":\"Rivet Mid-Century Modern Wood King Bed, 79&quot;W, Casual Cherry\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81uzJT0QXSL.jpg\"},\"gallery\":[{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81e3eZekYML.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/81/81e3eZekYML.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xiN7qWDnL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A1xiN7qWDnL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A142xFhkfSL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/A1/A142xFhkfSL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qPHpTOrzL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91qPHpTOrzL.jpg\"},{\"alt\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tRAmNGyuL.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/puresight-pim-images/original/91/91tRAmNGyuL.jpg\"}],\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"height\",\"label\":\"Height\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"50.0\",\"label\":\"inches\"}]},{\"name\":\"width\",\"label\":\"Width\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"79.0\",\"la